Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,《虎胆龙威2》
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.20,0:00:39.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 喔 哟 是假警报 等等
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.50,0:00:40.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了 我来了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我过来了 好了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.07,0:00:45.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,轻轻的放下 好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.11,0:00:46.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 在违章车辆暂扣处
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.61,0:00:47.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,下一次要看好交通标志
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你不明白
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看,我只是来这儿接我老婆飞机的.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.76,0:00:52.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你得把这车还给我
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.17,0:00:53.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,会的,明天 八点到下午四点
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.70,0:00:55.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你付四十元罚金 我们就还你
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.32,0:00:57.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别开罚单  别开罚单
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.11,0:00:59.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友,别这样.这是我岳母的车
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.19,0:01:01.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,她已经因为我不是牙医而对我很反感了.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.58,0:01:04.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧,我是警察... 洛杉矶警局
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.23,0:01:06.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,我在洛杉矶待过 讨厌的地方
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.80,0:01:07.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,呃,可以理解
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.84,0:01:09.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己也不喜欢那鬼地方
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.47,0:01:11.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那是个塑料挡泥板! 小心一点
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.46,0:01:14.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给点面子,怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.05,0:01:15.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前是纽约的警察
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.77,0:01:18.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我会搬到洛杉矶完全是因为我太太在那儿找了份工作
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.34,0:01:19.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托.好不好?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.75,0:01:22.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约 华盛顿特区 都是民主的核心
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.67,0:01:24.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一首"星条旗永不落"唱不出两家人
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托! 老兄 这是圣诞啊
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.34,0:01:28.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那就叫圣诞老人另外给你辆车
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.12,0:01:30.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐 朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,都交给你了 默里
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.74,0:01:39.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,王八蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.59,0:02:17.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 拉里 我知道
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,电话在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.28,0:02:24.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.35,0:02:25.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.82,0:02:29.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,莱昂纳德 阿德金斯在一个更温暖的地方给你报导\N持续升温的热点新闻…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.66,0:02:32.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦维得共和国的艾加龙机场
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.16,0:02:33.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,此刻戒备森严
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.06,0:02:35.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,据政府当局称
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.63,0:02:37.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,被罢免的雷蒙 埃斯波兰萨将军
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.66,0:02:41.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,经此移交并立即引渡前往美国
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.07,0:02:43.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,仅两年前… 埃斯波兰萨将军
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.47,0:02:44.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还领导该国军队
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.72,0:02:46.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,发动了一场打击共党叛乱分子的斗争
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.93,0:02:49.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,斗争背后是美国的金钱及顾问在撑腰
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.09,0:02:54.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,埃斯波兰萨的下台不仅在该国最近的选举中掀起波澜…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在美国国内也一样
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.75,0:02:59.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有高级国防官员被指控…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,违反国会禁令提供武器给埃斯波兰萨
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.49,0:03:05.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但更多证据显示埃斯波兰萨的部队
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.08,0:03:07.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妨碍了邻国的中立
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以致于国会停止对其拔款
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.40,0:03:12.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,埃斯波兰萨被指控将拨款挪用
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.13,0:03:15.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,用来从事获得暴利的可卡因走私
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.44,0:03:19.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然埃斯波兰萨 今年初就被解除三军总司令的职务
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.23,0:03:22.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但引渡他受审的协议 昨天才达成
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.70,0:03:24.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,据华盛顿消息灵通人士称
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.40,0:03:26.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,协议的达成源于一个电话
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.43,0:03:28.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一个来自…
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.66,0:03:34.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你是谁
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.39,0:03:41.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,找到电话我就打给你
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.18,0:04:13.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.96,0:04:15.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,借过 谢谢你
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.65,0:04:26.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是麦克莱警督
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.23,0:04:27.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有人刚呼了我?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.32,0:04:28.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是指我吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.80,0:04:30.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 干嘛呢? 在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.94,0:04:32.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,降落了吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了这是90年代?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.75,0:04:38.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,微芯片 微波炉 传真机 无线电话
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.35,0:04:41.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就我而言…
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.20,0:04:43.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,冷冻披萨是科技进步的最高峰
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.70,0:04:46.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着,我们降落大约会迟半个多小时
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.10,0:04:49.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想让你知道
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.26,0:04:50.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.40,0:04:54.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们正在为你父母给的那些糖喜不自禁呢
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.68,0:04:57.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你借妈的新车 她有为难你吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.70,0:05:00.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 还没呢
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.40,0:05:04.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 亲爱的 等你落了地 我们租一辆车…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把孩子交给你父母 我们住旅馆
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.90,0:05:12.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,叫房间服务订瓶香槟如何?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.10,0:05:15.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一言为定 警督
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.20,0:05:18.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那就半小时后见了 我爱你 拜
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.60,0:05:25.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你看科技是不是很奇妙?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.20,0:05:30.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我老公可不这么想 - 我是这么想
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.10,0:05:34.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前得带着那种麻烦的催泪瓦斯
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.80,0:05:41.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个杂种惹我我就电他
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.80,0:05:45.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在我家的狗身上试过
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.10,0:05:49.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的家伙 瘸了一个星期
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.00,0:05:58.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看你很眼熟
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.50,0:06:04.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人都说 我上过电视
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.90,0:06:06.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我也是
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拿一下工具  - 没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.40,0:06:37.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是艾美 尼可 在艾加龙机场现场报导
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.80,0:06:42.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,雷蒙 埃斯波兰萨将军 刚在戒护森严下抵达此处
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.30,0:06:45.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这位被罢黜的独裁者似乎心情愉快
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.60,0:06:49.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,像是竞选候选人一样微笑并向人群挥手
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.50,0:06:55.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,...成千上万的政治犯 包括新任总统…
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.00,0:07:01.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问,不管在国外还是在这儿,他仍然拥有热情的支持者
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,国会谣言满天飞说有…
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.40,0:07:09.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎样? - 抱歉打扰你 先生
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.05,0:07:10.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在检查我们的装备
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.37,0:07:14.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 管线有什么问题吗? - 这我就不知道了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 介意让我们看看吗?  - 请便
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.10,0:07:32.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把这个教堂给关了 总不太对劲
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道教区会继续使用它
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.67,0:07:36.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是它不会跟以前一样了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年了 我一直陪伴着它
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.10,0:07:42.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是,我好像有种感觉…
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.25,0:07:44.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有一部份的我正和这教堂一起死去
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.40,0:07:46.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,呃, 你说得没错
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.40,0:07:55.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走私可卡因和贿赂政府官员
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.01,0:07:58.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他自然不让这些事曝光
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.25,0:08:00.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,无论他的理念多好
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.75,0:08:02.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们无法隐瞒的事实是
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.42,0:08:03.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,美国的反毒品之战
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.90,0:08:06.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,终于捉到了它第一个犯人
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是巴圭 俱乐部开放了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.60,0:08:17.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在达拉斯 司法部…
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.59,0:08:22.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,正准备逮捕这个象征美国反可卡因之战敌人的人
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.40,0:08:25.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这场缉毒战可能打赢了,但整个禁毒战却胜负难料
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.90,0:08:29.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,莎曼萨柯曼 WNTW夜间新闻
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 上校 完毕
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.77,0:08:48.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是上校
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.50,0:08:52.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都准备好了 天气怎样?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.60,0:08:55.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,整个维珍尼亚海岸都在飘雪
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.53,0:08:58.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有暴风雪从东北方来
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.34,0:09:02.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 上帝真眷顾步兵 - 阿门
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.53,0:09:05.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去执行你们的任务
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.80,0:09:11.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对时 15:51 - 对好了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.86,0:09:13.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,待会见
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.14,0:09:15.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再见
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.49,0:09:39.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,外面可真冷
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.56,0:09:41.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我脚跺了有五分钟了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.87,0:09:53.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,两杯卡布其诺 快一点来
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.18,0:10:14.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,纯威士忌,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.54,0:10:16.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 警官
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.55,0:10:17.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,说起来像是有点疯狂
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.08,0:10:19.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但我好像看见…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看见什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.90,0:10:26.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾维斯 艾维斯·普莱士利(猫王)
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的观光客 得有法律治治他们
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.90,0:10:34.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思,今晚这儿有很多司法部官员
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.90,0:10:38.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有什么具体事由吗? - 例行公事
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.07,0:10:38.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,例行公事
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.78,0:10:41.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有意见吗? 先生 - 现在还不行
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 先生 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.25,0:10:51.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 那是史都华上校
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,人员调派上出了问题…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在最后一刻换了人
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.20,0:11:00.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 机场的警戒怎么样? - 就我们来看 简直是儿戏
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,史都华上校 能对我们说几句话吗
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.82,0:11:05.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给你两个字:“我操”
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.30,0:11:07.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不准拍照 你这左倾婊子
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.60,0:11:10.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真嚣张
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.18,0:11:26.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.28,0:11:29.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,借过
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.70,0:11:57.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么? - 你有这扇门的钥匙?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.10,0:11:58.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有呀 干嘛?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.90,0:12:01.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你把这门打开 你说干嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.40,0:12:07.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这附近有值班警察吗? - 有机场警察
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.90,0:12:09.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去找他们来
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.64,0:12:37.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把板手递给我
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.89,0:12:41.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还得要加班呢   好主意
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.27,0:12:44.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把那头抓紧
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.35,0:12:46.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,留神
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.86,0:12:49.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 太好了…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.17,0:12:52.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.87,0:12:57.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  这里是禁区
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.60,0:13:00.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?  不能等搬行李的来吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.23,0:13:01.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是在这里工作的
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.22,0:13:03.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把证件拿出来
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.05,0:13:06.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.40,0:13:48.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.85,0:13:49.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,干!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.81,0:14:38.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是工作小组吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.10,0:15:15.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他进来这里然后亮了一下警徽? - 是,他说把你们的人叫回这边来
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.85,0:15:45.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.58,0:16:03.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不准动
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,猜得真对 混蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个警察 那才是个坏人
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.20,0:16:13.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的证件呢?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.35,0:16:20.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,正在往克里夫兰的路上
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.10,0:16:27.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么也不解释…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.00,0:16:30.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就把我塞进这个破车里
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.77,0:16:34.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生,我们已经告知你机票超卖了 - 这个我可以接受
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.90,0:16:38.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么不给我吃头等舱的餐 我已经花了钱
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.30,0:16:41.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道我是谁? - 我们都看过你的节目
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.40,0:16:45.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你那集“飞行垃圾场”客观反映了空中交通的安全问题
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.80,0:16:49.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不过比起“空中辣妹”那集的教育意义就差远了,不是吗? 小姐
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们认为自己很幽默
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.16,0:16:56.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 我记住了你的工号
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.40,0:16:59.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而我也记住了你的. 坐下吧 先生
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.71,0:17:02.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.10,0:17:15.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 空中小姐 - 索伯先生
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.81,0:17:17.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能独占我的时间
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.99,0:17:20.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不能靠这个女人坐 - 什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.64,0:17:26.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他向法院对我提出限制令
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不得靠近他超过五十尺
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.10,0:17:34.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是五十码 把我放在这一区 违背了法庭禁令
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.77,0:17:37.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以告你和这家航空公司
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.20,0:17:42.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这女人在大庭广众打我 羞辱我
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.85,0:17:51.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.27,0:17:54.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,打掉了他的两颗牙齿
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要来杯香槟吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.15,0:18:04.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 麦克莱警官 我得查清楚
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.76,0:18:06.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的枪和你的警徽
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.05,0:18:09.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢啦
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.93,0:18:11.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在这边 警官
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.23,0:18:13.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们了解刚才有枪战
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.81,0:18:16.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,美国司法部官员在场...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.00,0:18:18.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.11,0:18:19.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿,就一句,怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.37,0:18:23.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们他妈这帮人在… 你在这儿干什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是犯罪现场 你应该把这地方封闭起来
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.25,0:18:30.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这得由警监决定 - 那你最好带我去见警监,嗯?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.47,0:18:42.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,柯可兰呢?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.54,0:18:43.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他挂了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.54,0:18:54.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你来晚了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.22,0:18:58.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们遇到麻烦了 上校
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.56,0:19:01.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有个警察 他杀了柯可兰
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.53,0:19:03.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点没逃出来,长官
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.89,0:19:05.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的任务呢?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.97,0:19:09.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,完成了 长官 可是柯可兰…
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.47,0:19:11.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯,那就没什么大损失
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.40,0:19:13.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但处罚可能是严厉的
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.98,0:19:23.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你再失误一次…
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.43,0:19:25.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就不是空枪了
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.41,0:19:27.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,解散
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.63,0:19:33.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐…我找不到我的狗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.00,0:19:36.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐 我的狗. 太太 请稍等
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请你把这张表填上
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.60,0:19:46.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁? 进来
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.77,0:19:48.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伦佐队长?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.70,0:19:49.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.15,0:19:51.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是约翰麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.24,0:19:52.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是谁
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那个违反了7条联邦航空局...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.60,0:19:59.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,和5条特区法规在我机场到处跑的混蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.25,0:20:01.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还到处乱开枪
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.35,0:20:03.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么解释你的所作所为?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.30,0:20:04.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,正当...防卫
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.35,0:20:07.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么,你以为那个洛杉矶警徽…
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.80,0:20:09.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,能让你在这儿吃到免费午餐吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.53,0:20:13.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 或许该受到身为专家的礼遇
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.38,0:20:15.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在一个圣诞节的机场里?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.59,0:20:16.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.07,0:20:17.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别管礼遇了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.97,0:20:19.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的专业精神呢?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.95,0:20:22.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你手下自犯罪现场走开 警长
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.90,0:20:24.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你没把那地方给围起来
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.65,0:20:27.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定得把那地带封闭 照相片
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.49,0:20:29.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别对我说教
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.69,0:20:32.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我是在干么 我们会去采指纹
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.80,0:20:36.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,照相 采样
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.30,0:20:38.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候去? 等三四百人去过后
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.97,0:20:40.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是采到指纹 你才狗运呢!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.94,0:20:44.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把那个地区关闭… - 把那个地区关闭?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.14,0:20:46.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就那么简单 把它关闭?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.68,0:20:50.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,干! 我什么人都有
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.22,0:20:52.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有兄弟会的 也有童子军
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我有失踪的儿童 失踪的狗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.95,0:20:56.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.46,0:20:58.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有国际外交官
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.55,0:21:02.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有从可爱动物园来的驯鹿
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.02,0:21:06.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但 约翰麦克莱 他有个小问题
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.09,0:21:08.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们把整个机场关闭
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.73,0:21:11.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我这么说上头的人会怎么说
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.46,0:21:12.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拿起电话来请示呀!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.00,0:21:18.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,用不着鉴识科的笨蛋来告诉我这只是一个小贼想偷行李
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.67,0:21:21.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,行李? 这小贼用的枪是GLOCK-7 你知道吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.10,0:21:23.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是德国制陶瓷枪
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.51,0:21:25.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,X光机看不出来的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.82,0:21:27.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它的价值超过你一个月的所得
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.85,0:21:29.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我挣多少你一定会吃惊的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.05,0:21:31.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,比一块九毛八还多?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.05,0:21:35.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别去相信报上对你的报导
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.39,0:21:38.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我知道你的一切 还有在洛杉矶中臣大厦那件事
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.83,0:21:42.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但电视说你是个人物并不表示你就是
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.77,0:21:45.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看,你现在是在我这个小池子里
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.60,0:21:48.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而我是管这池子的大鱼
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.29,0:21:51.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你杀了条不值钱的人命
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.56,0:21:52.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.40,0:21:56.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我会给你他妈的洛杉矶警监寄封表扬信的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.73,0:21:58.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在滚你的吧!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.95,0:22:01.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,省得我必须把你赶出机场去
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.40,0:22:14.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿,我问你一件事 卡敏
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.86,0:22:17.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么最先启动金属侦测器?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.43,0:22:20.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是你屁眼里的子弹还是你大脑里的大粪?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.07,0:22:21.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,肥猪!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.25,0:22:32.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙身上有身份证明吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.80,0:22:34.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那个让别人去操心吧!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.95,0:22:40.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的车预备好了 就在这签字
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.44,0:22:44.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要借用这个和这个 马上还回来
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.06,0:22:45.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.20,0:22:47.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿,喂,等一下
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.70,0:22:49.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.33,0:22:53.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.50,0:22:54.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 我们要查一件事
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.93,0:22:57.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在什么? - 讨人厌的差事
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.11,0:23:02.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一团乱 忘了采这混蛋的指纹了
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.18,0:23:07.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.75,0:23:09.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你该在殓房做的
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.61,0:23:13.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是了,航空署对送达后已死的有新的操作流程
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.10,0:23:19.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看这个人是活不了了
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.32,0:23:20.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.14,0:23:31.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,护航机开走了
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.04,0:23:36.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 现在没危险
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.71,0:23:39.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们一路到美国都会平安的
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.60,0:23:40.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要飞多久?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.80,0:23:43.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,3个半小时
Dialogue: 1,0:23:58.91,0:24:00.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,戴着这链子好痛
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.02,0:24:05.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,能把这个拿掉吗? 小鬼
Dialogue: 1,0:24:05.81,0:24:07.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你想我还能往哪儿跑呢?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:07.91,0:24:11.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 将军 我不能这么做
Dialogue: 1,0:24:13.15,0:24:15.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 小鬼 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:24:15.85,0:24:18.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好兵
Dialogue: 1,0:24:20.63,0:24:25.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 不给我自由 给我借个火总行吧?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:14.03,0:25:15.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是波威尔
Dialogue: 1,0:25:15.25,0:25:16.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把你嘴里的海绵蛋糕拿出来
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.80,0:25:18.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拿起铅笔 行吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:18.27,0:25:20.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈! 约翰 你好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:20.68,0:25:24.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉放了我一天鸽子 我孤身一人呆在华盛顿
Dialogue: 1,0:25:24.23,0:25:26.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,和我岳父母
Dialogue: 1,0:25:26.25,0:25:27.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,岳父母...啊?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:27.85,0:25:30.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们很喜欢自己的警察女婿吧?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:30.80,0:25:31.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 艾尔
Dialogue: 1,0:25:31.55,0:25:34.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,局里的传真机什么号码?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.37,0:25:36.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:41.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,555-3212
Dialogue: 1,0:25:41.56,0:25:44.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,3212 等一下
Dialogue: 1,0:25:44.27,0:25:46.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要传点东西给你
Dialogue: 1,0:25:46.22,0:25:47.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 1,0:25:47.22,0:25:50.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你会用传真机? 这可是破天荒
Dialogue: 1,0:25:50.35,0:25:51.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的,呃,荷莉告诉我...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:51.77,0:25:53.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我该跟上90年代潮流
Dialogue: 1,0:25:53.87,0:25:54.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这样?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.86,0:25:56.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不对 该这样
Dialogue: 1,0:25:56.59,0:25:57.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上下颠倒了
Dialogue: 1,0:25:57.98,0:25:59.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没有关系
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.10,0:26:00.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,行了 送进机器了
Dialogue: 1,0:26:03.36,0:26:05.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,正在传送
Dialogue: 1,0:26:05.39,0:26:07.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 牛仔
Dialogue: 1,0:26:22.48,0:26:23.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是指纹?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:23.58,0:26:25.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有具无名尸体
Dialogue: 1,0:26:25.55,0:26:27.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我用笔圈起了
Dialogue: 1,0:26:27.43,0:26:29.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以防传送后模糊
Dialogue: 1,0:26:29.05,0:26:31.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 把它抄送给州、联邦和国际刑警
Dialogue: 1,0:26:31.97,0:26:34.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 这是怎么一回事?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:34.42,0:26:36.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,只是第六感
Dialogue: 1,0:26:36.16,0:26:38.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀,一旦你有第六感
Dialogue: 1,0:26:38.42,0:26:40.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,保险公司准破产
Dialogue: 1,0:26:40.50,0:26:43.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 这里的传真机号码是…
Dialogue: 1,0:26:43.16,0:26:45.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在传过去的纸上头有
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.13,0:26:47.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就在你刚收到的纸上头有
Dialogue: 1,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,一个飞机场?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:52.47,0:26:55.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你没在别人的池子里撒尿吧?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:55.64,0:26:58.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 而且我没带漂白粉
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.05,0:27:07.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的风暴正要开始减弱…
Dialogue: 1,0:27:07.52,0:27:10.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,气象卫星又送坏消息来了
Dialogue: 1,0:27:10.56,0:27:12.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,前头那个峰面
Dialogue: 1,0:27:12.73,0:27:15.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,和这个比真是小巫见大巫
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.62,0:27:19.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以在跑道上撒沙子
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.23,0:27:21.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,并且在飞机降落间隙里整好
Dialogue: 1,0:27:21.05,0:27:23.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可是你得给我时间来干活儿
Dialogue: 1,0:27:23.70,0:27:24.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:27:25.60,0:27:27.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 各位…
Dialogue: 1,0:27:27.78,0:27:30.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让飞机降落放慢一些…
Dialogue: 1,0:27:30.21,0:27:32.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这样咱们才能清理停机坪
Dialogue: 1,0:27:32.39,0:27:34.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,从密西西比的飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:27:34.12,0:27:36.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,开始排队降落
Dialogue: 1,0:27:46.60,0:27:48.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还要再来一杯吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:51.64,0:27:53.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不了 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:27:53.16,0:27:54.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再过15到20分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:27:54.22,0:27:56.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不用再对着他那张脸了
Dialogue: 1,0:27:57.40,0:27:59.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们 先生们 我是机长
Dialogue: 1,0:27:59.95,0:28:02.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚接到达拉斯航管中心通知
Dialogue: 1,0:28:02.73,0:28:05.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,前方有一个锋面向我们靠近
Dialogue: 1,0:28:05.48,0:28:08.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许咱们得在天上多待一会儿了
Dialogue: 1,0:28:08.46,0:28:09.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:28:10.15,0:28:11.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我又重新想了想…
Dialogue: 1,0:28:19.14,0:28:20.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾尔
Dialogue: 1,0:28:20.06,0:28:21.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在 搭档
Dialogue: 1,0:28:22.00,0:28:25.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你那尸体的档案正传送过来
Dialogue: 1,0:28:26.67,0:28:28.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,内容是什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:28.74,0:28:29.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了
Dialogue: 1,0:28:29.98,0:28:31.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个还需要电脑告诉你?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:31.93,0:28:33.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是 你没明白我的意思
Dialogue: 1,0:28:34.08,0:28:35.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,据国防部说
Dialogue: 1,0:28:36.04,0:28:38.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经死了两年了
Dialogue: 1,0:28:38.88,0:28:39.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:39.93,0:28:42.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 奥斯华·科奇蓝中士
Dialogue: 1,0:28:42.31,0:28:44.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,美国派驻洪都拉斯的军事顾问
Dialogue: 1,0:28:44.88,0:28:47.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,死于1988年5月11日 直升机意外
Dialogue: 1,0:28:47.92,0:28:48.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警官
Dialogue: 1,0:28:50.23,0:28:54.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看样子里面大有文章
Dialogue: 1,0:28:54.27,0:28:55.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 1,0:28:55.48,0:28:56.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,行了 谢啦!
Dialogue: 1,0:28:57.09,0:28:58.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,随时效劳
Dialogue: 1,0:28:58.78,0:28:59.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:29:01.34,0:29:03.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我还有不到1小时就可以休息…
Dialogue: 1,0:29:03.67,0:29:05.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要去喝一杯?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:07.60,0:29:09.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只是传个真 女士
Dialogue: 1,0:29:09.61,0:29:11.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只是传个真
Dialogue: 1,0:29:15.98,0:29:17.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我瞧见了一个人
Dialogue: 1,0:29:17.61,0:29:19.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我会再打给你的
Dialogue: 1,0:29:25.24,0:29:27.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去年圣诞节的鬼魂
Dialogue: 1,0:29:27.18,0:29:29.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,中臣大厦? 洛杉矶? 你是约翰·麦克莱 对吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:29.79,0:29:30.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:30.67,0:29:32.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·坷曼 WNTW电视台的
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.78,0:29:34.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪了
Dialogue: 1,0:29:34.82,0:29:37.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我个忙 我瞧见那具尸体了
Dialogue: 1,0:29:37.21,0:29:39.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听说是你的杰作
Dialogue: 1,0:29:40.02,0:29:42.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 我只会做针线活
Dialogue: 1,0:29:47.16,0:29:49.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了 国际机场刚关闭了
Dialogue: 1,0:29:49.90,0:29:51.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,全都是冰
Dialogue: 1,0:29:51.53,0:29:52.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫飞机都飞到咱们这儿来
Dialogue: 1,0:29:52.86,0:29:54.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,假日快乐
Dialogue: 1,0:29:54.24,0:29:56.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,特鲁多先生,最糟的是那帮媒体…
Dialogue: 1,0:29:56.55,0:29:59.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,他们无孔不入,到处打探埃斯波兰萨的消息
Dialogue: 1,0:29:59.66,0:30:01.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,已经有新闻报导了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:01.30,0:30:02.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真是血迹斑斑
Dialogue: 1,0:30:02.87,0:30:05.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我真想把所有记者
Dialogue: 1,0:30:05.27,0:30:07.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,都挡在机场外头
Dialogue: 1,0:30:07.24,0:30:09.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们会大嚷新闻自由
Dialogue: 1,0:30:09.18,0:30:11.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,然后美国平民自由协会就会朝我们泼屎
Dialogue: 1,0:30:11.51,0:30:13.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,电视上的谋杀报导
Dialogue: 1,0:30:13.12,0:30:15.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真给圣诞节开了个好头
Dialogue: 1,0:30:16.44,0:30:18.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这次又是怎么回事? 跟上次一样的黑帮活动?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:18.98,0:30:21.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你说的黑帮是在布拉格堡训练的
Dialogue: 1,0:30:23.22,0:30:24.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 这人是谁?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:24.21,0:30:25.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,0:30:25.25,0:30:26.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个警官
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.27,0:30:27.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,乱闯禁区的警官
Dialogue: 1,0:30:27.82,0:30:30.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,洛杉矶来的 特鲁多先生 那有个屁用
Dialogue: 1,0:30:30.37,0:30:33.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我上次验胆固醇的时候也这么说
Dialogue: 1,0:30:34.00,0:30:36.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那你的问题是什么? 麦克莱警督
Dialogue: 1,0:30:37.92,0:30:40.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我确信罗伦佐警监已经向你解释过了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:40.40,0:30:43.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们关于小贼的小小争议
Dialogue: 1,0:30:43.35,0:30:45.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他能再解释一下这个
Dialogue: 1,0:30:45.74,0:30:47.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,（机密任务:特殊训练死于...）
Dialogue: 1,0:30:47.34,0:30:49.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,（5-11-88直升机坠毁）
Dialogue: 1,0:31:04.02,0:31:05.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的系统都接通了 上校
Dialogue: 1,0:31:06.00,0:31:07.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,启动吧!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:21.77,0:31:23.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,5分钟后行动
Dialogue: 1,0:31:23.96,0:31:25.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好
Dialogue: 1,0:31:26.78,0:31:29.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们在殓房有一具
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.16,0:31:30.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,死了两次的尸体
Dialogue: 1,0:31:30.92,0:31:32.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,假设不是电脑出错
Dialogue: 1,0:31:32.68,0:31:33.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们该假设什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:33.61,0:31:35.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有人想对机场图谋不轨
Dialogue: 1,0:31:35.99,0:31:37.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么说?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:37.86,0:31:39.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们这里都是笨蛋,麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,0:31:39.83,0:31:42.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以告诉我们你天才的想法
Dialogue: 1,0:31:42.14,0:31:43.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的是劫机? 抢劫? 还是别的什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:43.96,0:31:45.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能确定
Dialogue: 1,0:31:45.18,0:31:47.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 他不能确定 我太震惊了
Dialogue: 1,0:31:48.00,0:31:49.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我得去躺一会儿了
Dialogue: 1,0:31:49.22,0:31:51.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,能做到这个程度的只有行家
Dialogue: 1,0:31:51.66,0:31:53.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不是偷行李的小毛贼也不是小混混
Dialogue: 1,0:31:53.25,0:31:54.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哪方面的行家?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:54.45,0:31:56.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈到底认为是什么? 嗯!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:56.56,0:31:57.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,巡逻保安?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:57.95,0:32:00.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是一份职业雇佣兵的履历…
Dialogue: 1,0:32:00.41,0:32:02.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个世界上最大的毒贩正往这儿赶
Dialogue: 1,0:32:02.52,0:32:04.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是需要一把计算尺才算得出来
Dialogue: 1,0:32:04.09,0:32:06.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还是需要在你开始提问前在尸袋里再来上具尸体?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:06.90,0:32:09.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那该死的尸体是你给我们弄来的
Dialogue: 1,0:32:09.20,0:32:10.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:10.60,0:32:11.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是,我没忘
Dialogue: 1,0:32:18.85,0:32:22.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伦佐 现在叫你所有轮班的部下来报告
Dialogue: 1,0:32:22.69,0:32:24.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 你相信他的话?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:24.47,0:32:26.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要他们报告一切不同寻常的事…
Dialogue: 1,0:32:26.62,0:32:28.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是多小的事 明白吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:28.28,0:32:29.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,照办
Dialogue: 1,0:32:29.56,0:32:30.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天呀!
Dialogue: 1,0:32:30.87,0:32:31.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:32.00,0:32:33.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,跑道 你瞧!
Dialogue: 1,0:32:33.62,0:32:34.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:34.71,0:32:36.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,照明统统给关掉了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:36.83,0:32:38.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 1,0:32:43.88,0:32:45.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻把紧急照明打开
Dialogue: 1,0:32:46.63,0:32:49.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,紧急状况 我们现在处于黄色警报状态
Dialogue: 1,0:32:49.61,0:32:51.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,后备系统失灵了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:51.30,0:32:52.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,换到另一个终端试试看
Dialogue: 1,0:32:52.31,0:32:53.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,巴比 你那边怎样?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:54.11,0:32:56.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,完了. 整个线路都不管用了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:56.17,0:32:58.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,或许咱们该打电话给电力公司?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:58.04,0:32:59.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟我们在同一个该死的供电区
Dialogue: 1,0:32:59.92,0:33:01.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,达拉斯机场 怎么回事? 我正要进场
Dialogue: 1,0:33:01.66,0:33:03.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,保持现在位置.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:03.60,0:33:05.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,下面怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:05.24,0:33:06.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 我们正在处理
Dialogue: 1,0:33:06.71,0:33:08.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行 推迟降落
Dialogue: 1,0:33:08.15,0:33:10.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,富士604 错过了进场程序
Dialogue: 1,0:33:10.83,0:33:12.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请重新来过
Dialogue: 1,0:33:12.68,0:33:15.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,TWA23 你还不能进场
Dialogue: 1,0:33:15.79,0:33:18.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请爬高 保持1万尺高度
Dialogue: 1,0:33:18.18,0:33:20.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,检查所有系统 不会有这种事的
Dialogue: 1,0:33:36.05,0:33:37.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,问题出在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:37.81,0:33:39.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,进场雷达失效了…
Dialogue: 1,0:33:39.40,0:33:42.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 自动导航系统失效了
Dialogue: 1,0:33:43.52,0:33:45.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,确定 自动导航系统失效了
Dialogue: 1,0:33:46.05,0:33:48.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有系统都完蛋了
Dialogue: 1,0:33:48.59,0:33:50.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,空中防撞警告系统失效了
Dialogue: 1,0:33:55.33,0:33:57.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意 所有导航员 请注意
Dialogue: 1,0:33:57.46,0:33:59.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,红色警报
Dialogue: 1,0:33:59.63,0:34:02.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有在我们塔台管制区的…
Dialogue: 1,0:34:02.10,0:34:04.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,尚未进入着陆航线的飞机…
Dialogue: 1,0:34:04.25,0:34:06.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,立即安排转往附近机场
Dialogue: 1,0:34:06.93,0:34:09.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,己进入着陆航线的所有飞机…
Dialogue: 1,0:34:09.42,0:34:11.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,或是正要进场的飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:34:11.40,0:34:13.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,维持在外指点标的高度
Dialogue: 1,0:34:13.82,0:34:16.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们放慢 别紧张 排队来
Dialogue: 1,0:34:16.29,0:34:17.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快
Dialogue: 1,0:34:17.45,0:34:19.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快找人来帮忙
Dialogue: 1,0:34:22.88,0:34:25.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里发生的事千万别泄露出去
Dialogue: 1,0:34:25.67,0:34:28.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这机场有一万五千人
Dialogue: 1,0:34:28.24,0:34:30.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不希望发生恐慌
Dialogue: 1,0:34:30.84,0:34:33.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许刚争取到了两个小时
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.51,0:34:35.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,两小时后 燃料用完的飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:34:35.45,0:34:36.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就不能兜圈子了
Dialogue: 1,0:34:37.02,0:34:39.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会掉在白宫草地上的
Dialogue: 1,0:34:41.65,0:34:44.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱 这就是你担心的?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:46.49,0:34:47.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 1,0:34:48.49,0:34:50.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这只不过是开始!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:54.40,0:34:56.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,航空署热线!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:56.46,0:34:58.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么会知道的?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:58.14,0:34:59.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能知道
Dialogue: 1,0:35:00.95,0:35:03.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是那些把你插头拔掉的人打来的
Dialogue: 1,0:35:03.57,0:35:05.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,接到扬声器去
Dialogue: 1,0:35:06.29,0:35:09.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意 达拉斯机场指挥塔 注意
Dialogue: 1,0:35:09.32,0:35:13.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说盲人听力格外好
Dialogue: 1,0:35:13.27,0:35:15.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,既然现在你们又盲又聋…
Dialogue: 1,0:35:15.18,0:35:17.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我已经集中起你们的注意力了
Dialogue: 1,0:35:17.29,0:35:19.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们在录音
Dialogue: 1,0:35:20.02,0:35:21.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我长话短说
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.55,0:35:23.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,过一会儿你们可以再听重播
Dialogue: 1,0:35:23.86,0:35:26.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会用这条线的? 你是谁?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:26.93,0:35:29.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是谁并不重要
Dialogue: 1,0:35:29.16,0:35:30.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是我要什么
Dialogue: 1,0:35:31.39,0:35:34.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不想让那些飞机油料用光
Dialogue: 1,0:35:34.55,0:35:35.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,掉进波托马克河的话
Dialogue: 1,0:35:35.65,0:35:37.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要什么就很重要
Dialogue: 1,0:35:37.94,0:35:41.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,58分钟后有架飞机会在这机场降落
Dialogue: 1,0:35:41.58,0:35:44.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它是FMI外籍军机一号
Dialogue: 1,0:35:44.42,0:35:47.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我确信你们都知道…
Dialogue: 1,0:35:47.56,0:35:48.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,埃斯波兰萨?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:48.89,0:35:51.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,飞机上乘客的重要性
Dialogue: 1,0:35:51.25,0:35:54.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,任何人均不得接近那架飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:35:55.24,0:35:57.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它将降落在我指定的跑道上
Dialogue: 1,0:35:57.84,0:36:00.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不许任何人去接近它
Dialogue: 1,0:36:01.40,0:36:03.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我已经解释清楚了我对那架飞机的关注
Dialogue: 1,0:36:03.40,0:36:05.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以及你们对那架飞机的责任
Dialogue: 1,0:36:05.81,0:36:07.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,同时
Dialogue: 1,0:36:07.37,0:36:11.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要一架加满油的747改装货机
Dialogue: 1,0:36:11.58,0:36:13.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,随时听我指挥
Dialogue: 1,0:36:14.08,0:36:17.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给你们2分钟时间 通知待进场飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:36:17.11,0:36:18.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,保持他们的方位
Dialogue: 1,0:36:18.84,0:36:21.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你们就只能接收 不能发声了
Dialogue: 1,0:36:22.12,0:36:24.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,想修复系统的任何企图…
Dialogue: 1,0:36:24.44,0:36:26.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,都会遭到严厉的惩罚
Dialogue: 1,0:36:26.82,0:36:28.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他在虚张声势
Dialogue: 1,0:36:28.68,0:36:30.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的,你不能这么做
Dialogue: 1,0:36:31.05,0:36:32.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在这么做
Dialogue: 1,0:36:40.38,0:36:41.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大家听好
Dialogue: 1,0:36:41.94,0:36:43.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你启动15号计划
Dialogue: 1,0:36:43.32,0:36:45.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个主意 我需要你帮忙…
Dialogue: 1,0:36:45.82,0:36:47.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是埃斯波兰萨上了那架飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:36:47.12,0:36:49.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,飞到一个跟咱们没引渡条约的国家
Dialogue: 1,0:36:49.43,0:36:50.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就完了
Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.32,0:36:51.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们用咱们的系统通话
Dialogue: 1,0:36:52.10,0:36:53.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定离得很近
Dialogue: 1,0:36:53.09,0:36:55.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我会叫我的手下把这里搜个底朝天
Dialogue: 1,0:36:55.43,0:36:56.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这么一丁点儿时间之内?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:56.92,0:36:58.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 麦克莱 我这里有一级战术小分队
Dialogue: 1,0:36:59.00,0:37:00.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,SWAT特警队等等
Dialogue: 1,0:37:00.15,0:37:02.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不需要事后诸葛亮
Dialogue: 1,0:37:02.51,0:37:05.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我太太在其中一架飞机上
Dialogue: 1,0:37:05.47,0:37:07.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才投身其中
Dialogue: 1,0:37:07.27,0:37:09.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你在我告诉你时就行动
Dialogue: 1,0:37:09.12,0:37:10.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不会像现在这么糟了
Dialogue: 1,0:37:11.05,0:37:12.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吧. 保安 你离开这里
Dialogue: 1,0:37:12.78,0:37:14.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,特鲁多先生 需要我提醒你
Dialogue: 1,0:37:14.74,0:37:16.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有关 航空局
Dialogue: 1,0:37:16.29,0:37:17.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不准闲人
Dialogue: 1,0:37:17.61,0:37:18.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,进指挥塔的规定吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:18.74,0:37:20.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需找到发讯的方法
Dialogue: 1,0:37:20.92,0:37:23.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊,好. 谁跑一趟五金行买一台发报机?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:23.93,0:37:24.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有一台
Dialogue: 1,0:37:24.88,0:37:26.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在新的航站大厦里
Dialogue: 1,0:37:26.23,0:37:29.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,二十条航线都有自己的后备电脑
Dialogue: 1,0:37:29.45,0:37:32.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,依照天线排列的
Dialogue: 1,0:37:32.35,0:37:34.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,带麦克莱先生出去 请他出去
Dialogue: 1,0:37:34.10,0:37:35.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有你的事
Dialogue: 1,0:37:35.65,0:37:37.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你们.全部都齐备了
Dialogue: 1,0:37:37.57,0:37:39.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只需要接上附属空中通道
Dialogue: 1,0:37:39.30,0:37:40.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就可以使用
Dialogue: 1,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,附属空中通道?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:42.26,0:37:43.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要对付的是行家
Dialogue: 1,0:37:44.06,0:37:46.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是骗不了这些人的 听我说
Dialogue: 1,0:37:46.15,0:37:47.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·坷曼 WNTW电视台
Dialogue: 1,0:37:48.15,0:37:50.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,特鲁多先生, 今天这里谣言四起
Dialogue: 1,0:37:50.08,0:37:51.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不行 女士
Dialogue: 1,0:37:51.63,0:37:52.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 不 不
Dialogue: 1,0:37:52.64,0:37:54.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,太过份了 柯曼
Dialogue: 1,0:37:54.95,0:37:56.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请出去
Dialogue: 1,0:37:56.51,0:37:59.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你想到的一切 他们也都会想到
Dialogue: 1,0:37:59.56,0:38:00.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把你他妈的手拿开
Dialogue: 1,0:38:00.94,0:38:03.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  把他们二个赶出去
Dialogue: 1,0:38:04.31,0:38:06.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大厅警卫 回答
Dialogue: 1,0:38:06.69,0:38:07.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是汤姆逊
Dialogue: 1,0:38:07.90,0:38:09.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是罗伦佐警监
Dialogue: 1,0:38:09.06,0:38:11.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以及两个未授权入内人员在这该死的指挥塔里
Dialogue: 1,0:38:11.51,0:38:13.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别他妈在那里发呆…
Dialogue: 1,0:38:13.35,0:38:14.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们赶出电梯去
Dialogue: 1,0:38:14.38,0:38:17.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不然你就等着在你的圣诞祙子里找到解雇信吧
Dialogue: 1,0:38:17.21,0:38:19.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 我们走
Dialogue: 1,0:38:20.05,0:38:21.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的
Dialogue: 1,0:38:22.55,0:38:23.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谁想起什么要说的?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:23.75,0:38:24.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不能弄那个家伙?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:24.81,0:38:26.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的 抓紧
Dialogue: 1,0:38:26.76,0:38:28.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧就对了
Dialogue: 1,0:38:29.86,0:38:31.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大毒贩正被送往监狱
Dialogue: 1,0:38:31.86,0:38:33.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,机场又发生枪战
Dialogue: 1,0:38:33.35,0:38:36.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,咖啡厅里所有航管员都被呼叫并迅速离开
Dialogue: 1,0:38:36.05,0:38:37.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你又在里头搅和
Dialogue: 1,0:38:37.50,0:38:38.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有关连吗?  拜托 麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,0:38:39.06,0:38:40.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就说两句
Dialogue: 1,0:38:40.25,0:38:42.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,OK,就两句. 滚蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:38:42.56,0:38:45.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 史都华上校 已经对我说了
Dialogue: 1,0:38:46.71,0:38:48.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,史都华
Dialogue: 1,0:38:48.50,0:38:50.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,被国会炒鱿鱼的那家伙. 就是他
Dialogue: 1,0:38:50.98,0:38:53.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谁? 他是谁? 什么? 嘿!
Dialogue: 1,0:38:53.20,0:38:55.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘 没关系 这个我以前干过
Dialogue: 1,0:39:07.47,0:39:08.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 1,0:39:08.90,0:39:10.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:10.22,0:39:11.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜他有幽闭恐怖症
Dialogue: 1,0:39:14.00,0:39:16.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是特高频系统, 但飞机离得这么近
Dialogue: 1,0:39:16.51,0:39:17.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系
Dialogue: 1,0:39:17.45,0:39:19.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以在三十分内架设完毕
Dialogue: 1,0:39:19.37,0:39:21.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,然后做无线电交联就行了
Dialogue: 1,0:39:21.52,0:39:23.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,即使这些飞机也分不出哪里不同
Dialogue: 1,0:39:23.15,0:39:25.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,找到你需要的设备 不管你去借、去偷、去杀
Dialogue: 1,0:39:25.52,0:39:27.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要SWAT队跟他去掩护他
Dialogue: 1,0:39:27.77,0:39:30.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能想到的 他们都能想到
Dialogue: 1,0:39:36.40,0:39:38.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,不.我他妈简直不敢相信.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:38.95,0:39:41.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个地下室 另一个电梯
Dialogue: 1,0:39:41.81,0:39:44.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,相同的鬼事发生在我身上两次
Dialogue: 1,0:40:07.75,0:40:12.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:12.29,0:40:13.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:13.80,0:40:15.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:15.58,0:40:17.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:17.24,0:40:20.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:20.61,0:40:22.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:23.04,0:40:25.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:27.32,0:40:32.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:32.74,0:40:33.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:33.94,0:40:37.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:38.08,0:40:40.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:42.97,0:40:44.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:46.26,0:40:47.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是马文
Dialogue: 1,0:40:47.89,0:40:50.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,马文  我是马文
Dialogue: 1,0:40:50.08,0:40:51.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你要...
Dialogue: 1,0:40:51.21,0:40:53.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,偷唱片 仅此而已
Dialogue: 1,0:40:53.40,0:40:55.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是个看门的
Dialogue: 1,0:41:02.22,0:41:04.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是达拉斯塔台 呼叫所有
Dialogue: 1,0:41:04.53,0:41:06.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因暴风雪滞飞的飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:41:06.40,0:41:08.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们发生了技术问题
Dialogue: 1,0:41:09.01,0:41:11.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,气候正不断在恶化
Dialogue: 1,0:41:11.77,0:41:16.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,人为失误使得情形更加复杂
Dialogue: 1,0:41:16.86,0:41:19.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个事故影响了 我们所有的电子设备
Dialogue: 1,0:41:19.51,0:41:21.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以及备用系统
Dialogue: 1,0:41:22.38,0:41:25.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 导航和进场系统已经失效
Dialogue: 1,0:41:25.66,0:41:28.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一分钟后 我们就无法 再发出无线电通讯
Dialogue: 1,0:41:28.59,0:41:29.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你们 继续
Dialogue: 1,0:41:30.09,0:41:32.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,按先前指令保持在外指点标高度
Dialogue: 1,0:41:32.38,0:41:34.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,并等待进一步之指示
Dialogue: 1,0:41:34.89,0:41:36.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦我们的系统重新连线
Dialogue: 1,0:41:36.91,0:41:40.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将按你们的存油量加速安排降落
Dialogue: 1,0:41:41.53,0:41:42.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,祝各位好运
Dialogue: 1,0:41:45.24,0:41:46.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝保佑
Dialogue: 1,0:41:52.44,0:41:54.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 把时间表改掉
Dialogue: 1,0:41:56.80,0:41:58.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(延迟)
Dialogue: 1,0:41:59.40,0:42:00.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(延迟)
Dialogue: 1,0:42:22.28,0:42:23.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿,退后
Dialogue: 1,0:42:24.05,0:42:25.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,空中附属通道?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:25.65,0:42:27.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不,妈的,是附属空中通道
Dialogue: 1,0:42:27.40,0:42:30.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们赶我出来之前听到最后一句话
Dialogue: 1,0:42:30.79,0:42:32.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,来看看这里
Dialogue: 1,0:42:32.91,0:42:34.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是这个 就在这里
Dialogue: 1,0:42:34.59,0:42:37.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看到吗? 那是个架高的平台
Dialogue: 1,0:42:37.63,0:42:39.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,新航站大楼在这
Dialogue: 1,0:42:39.21,0:42:41.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的空中通道
Dialogue: 1,0:42:41.33,0:42:43.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的隘路
Dialogue: 1,0:42:43.15,0:42:45.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是个伏击的好地方
Dialogue: 1,0:42:46.31,0:42:47.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样到那里最快?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:47.68,0:42:49.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你能把我从那弄出来吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:42:51.95,0:42:54.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是我份内的工作
Dialogue: 1,0:42:54.89,0:42:57.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别操心 巴恩先生 我们会保护你
Dialogue: 1,0:42:57.55,0:42:59.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗? 那谁保护你们?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.57,0:43:12.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,主通风管道
Dialogue: 1,0:43:12.75,0:43:14.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,主通风管道
Dialogue: 1,0:43:15.57,0:43:17.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,中奖了
Dialogue: 1,0:43:17.24,0:43:19.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就只这一回我想过一个普通的
Dialogue: 1,0:43:19.93,0:43:21.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,正常的圣诞节
Dialogue: 1,0:43:23.70,0:43:27.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,蛋奶鸡尾酒, 一颗他妈的圣诞树,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:28.53,0:43:30.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,来点火鸡
Dialogue: 1,0:43:30.87,0:43:34.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可是不成… 我得在这
Dialogue: 1,0:43:34.27,0:43:36.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死铁管子里头到处爬
Dialogue: 1,0:43:41.00,0:43:42.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在附属空中通道里
Dialogue: 1,0:43:42.60,0:43:43.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看得见天线盒了
Dialogue: 1,0:43:44.01,0:43:47.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,弄好了我就通知你
Dialogue: 1,0:43:47.19,0:43:48.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样了
Dialogue: 1,0:43:48.31,0:43:50.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,士官 还要些装备
Dialogue: 1,0:43:51.07,0:43:52.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想派个你的人回去拿
Dialogue: 1,0:43:52.86,0:43:54.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是 先生  没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:43:58.08,0:43:59.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这他妈怎么一回事?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.68,0:44:01.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 把那个放回去
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.89,0:44:06.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿,蠢货,你看我像是个什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:07.10,0:44:09.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一个好打的靶
Dialogue: 1,0:44:10.56,0:44:11.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去逮他
Dialogue: 1,0:44:13.30,0:44:14.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:16.57,0:44:19.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我真恨我猜对了
Dialogue: 1,0:44:24.30,0:44:26.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,小心 趴下
Dialogue: 1,0:46:05.89,0:46:07.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,趴着别动
Dialogue: 1,0:46:21.50,0:46:22.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,干!
Dialogue: 1,0:46:31.86,0:46:33.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快! 快!
Dialogue: 1,0:46:54.18,0:46:56.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的!
Dialogue: 1,0:47:24.44,0:47:27.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看你是死定了
Dialogue: 1,0:48:01.00,0:48:02.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷!
Dialogue: 1,0:48:02.74,0:48:03.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 1,0:48:04.03,0:48:06.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 我必须到天线阵列那…
Dialogue: 1,0:48:06.22,0:48:08.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,并且把它接上
Dialogue: 1,0:48:13.33,0:48:14.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下!
Dialogue: 1,0:48:32.85,0:48:34.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的!
Dialogue: 1,0:48:37.50,0:48:38.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是个饵
Dialogue: 1,0:48:41.15,0:48:42.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,摆我们一道
Dialogue: 1,0:48:43.81,0:48:46.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伦佐最棒的手下都牺牲了
Dialogue: 1,0:48:50.06,0:48:51.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们浪费时间
Dialogue: 1,0:48:55.20,0:48:57.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而我们又分秒必争
Dialogue: 1,0:49:11.56,0:49:14.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你可是比五十码还要近呢
Dialogue: 1,0:49:14.27,0:49:17.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那架飞机也是 实际上…
Dialogue: 1,0:49:18.65,0:49:20.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是,还有不少呢
Dialogue: 1,0:49:20.33,0:49:21.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来就像平常塞车
Dialogue: 1,0:49:22.03,0:49:23.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这倒一点也不寻常
Dialogue: 1,0:49:24.87,0:49:26.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧? 你开始感兴趣了
Dialogue: 1,0:49:27.00,0:49:28.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的天赋, 麦克莱女士
Dialogue: 1,0:49:28.45,0:49:29.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我注意到的事…
Dialogue: 1,0:49:30.06,0:49:31.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是别人不会看到的
Dialogue: 1,0:49:32.63,0:49:34.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我有办法使人们好奇
Dialogue: 1,0:49:34.74,0:49:36.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说恶心吧?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.20,0:49:39.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,公众有权知道
Dialogue: 1,0:49:39.02,0:49:40.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:49:41.09,0:49:43.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而你却从中阻扰
Dialogue: 1,0:49:43.15,0:49:45.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 小东西 你危害到我的孩子了
Dialogue: 1,0:49:45.65,0:49:48.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你做的事的目的不会比普通民众高尚一丁点
Dialogue: 1,0:49:49.26,0:49:51.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你只有在有利可图向上爬的时候才会低下头
Dialogue: 1,0:49:51.73,0:49:53.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看看被你踩在脚下的大众
Dialogue: 1,0:49:58.45,0:50:00.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我? 是,我死不了的
Dialogue: 1,0:50:00.71,0:50:03.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但罗伦佐的SWAT队全死了
Dialogue: 1,0:50:03.10,0:50:05.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而且天线阵列…也报销了
Dialogue: 1,0:50:05.86,0:50:07.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你没看到爆炸吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:09.09,0:50:11.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,新的奇迹很难再发生
Dialogue: 1,0:50:12.58,0:50:13.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 1,0:50:14.08,0:50:15.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上再打来
Dialogue: 1,0:50:15.40,0:50:16.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 1,0:50:16.76,0:50:18.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有事发生
Dialogue: 1,0:50:18.44,0:50:20.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对…再等一下
Dialogue: 1,0:50:21.05,0:50:23.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重复一遍 通道队 汇报情况
Dialogue: 1,0:50:25.44,0:50:27.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,通道队 听见了没有?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:29.48,0:50:31.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这上面有某种干扰装置
Dialogue: 1,0:50:31.71,0:50:33.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你有办法对付它吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:34.70,0:50:36.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没办法.这个干扰模式
Dialogue: 1,0:50:36.85,0:50:38.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,必须得由这个密码控制台激活
Dialogue: 1,0:50:38.62,0:50:40.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就算扫瞄到他们的频率
Dialogue: 1,0:50:40.29,0:50:41.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也听不到
Dialogue: 1,0:50:41.74,0:50:42.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是专业的行家
Dialogue: 1,0:50:42.95,0:50:44.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是 破解那密码
Dialogue: 1,0:50:44.19,0:50:46.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要听到那些混蛋正在说什么
Dialogue: 1,0:50:46.06,0:50:47.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是10个数字控制面板
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.95,0:50:49.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,六个数显读出装置
Dialogue: 1,0:50:49.45,0:50:51.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天,密码组合要上百万个呢
Dialogue: 1,0:50:51.99,0:50:54.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,下回你在杀这些人之前
Dialogue: 1,0:50:54.24,0:50:56.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,先叫他把密码给输入
Dialogue: 1,0:50:56.30,0:50:57.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:50:58.73,0:51:01.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,长官!  我们刚监听到了一通电话
Dialogue: 1,0:51:01.96,0:51:04.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的人歼灭了SWAT队
Dialogue: 1,0:51:04.20,0:51:06.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你猜对了 他们想动用那天线
Dialogue: 1,0:51:06.52,0:51:07.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,计划进行顺利
Dialogue: 1,0:51:07.60,0:51:09.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,损失我们自己的人 可不在计划内
Dialogue: 1,0:51:16.50,0:51:18.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意 达拉斯指挥塔
Dialogue: 1,0:51:18.35,0:51:20.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意 控制塔台
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.38,0:51:22.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,特鲁多先生 我知道你在听
Dialogue: 1,0:51:22.76,0:51:24.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不幸地 你没有服从指示
Dialogue: 1,0:51:24.81,0:51:26.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,来跟我单打独斗呀
Dialogue: 1,0:51:26.57,0:51:28.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,已经警告过你不许修复系统
Dialogue: 1,0:51:28.90,0:51:30.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你浪费了宝贵的人命和时间
Dialogue: 1,0:51:30.73,0:51:32.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在明显无用的目标上
Dialogue: 1,0:51:33.17,0:51:35.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你要付出代价
Dialogue: 1,0:51:35.33,0:51:37.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们死了五个警官 史都华上校
Dialogue: 1,0:51:37.88,0:51:39.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这还罚得不够?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:39.75,0:51:41.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱 你别管这闲事!
Dialogue: 1,0:51:41.25,0:51:42.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,否则让你痛不欲生
Dialogue: 1,0:51:44.91,0:51:48.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,麦克莱?  约翰 麦克莱?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:49.20,0:51:52.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,营救中臣大厦人质的警察英雄
Dialogue: 1,0:51:53.31,0:51:55.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过"人物"杂志 介绍你的文章
Dialogue: 1,0:51:55.53,0:51:58.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在“今晚有约”上 你似乎有点失控
Dialogue: 1,0:51:58.10,0:51:59.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿,上校 少你妈说废话
Dialogue: 1,0:51:59.79,0:52:02.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,埃斯波兰萨给了你多少脏钱 让你叛变替他工作?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.94,0:52:08.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,黎塞留主教说得好 叛国不过是时间的问题
Dialogue: 1,0:52:08.37,0:52:09.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个国家必须学会…
Dialogue: 1,0:52:09.91,0:52:11.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不能一再阻扰像
Dialogue: 1,0:52:11.25,0:52:13.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,像埃斯波兰萨将军这样的人
Dialogue: 1,0:52:13.28,0:52:15.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些有胆量起来对抗
Dialogue: 1,0:52:15.43,0:52:17.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,共党侵略的人
Dialogue: 1,0:52:18.25,0:52:20.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那第一课就从杀警察开始?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:20.76,0:52:23.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,第二课是什么? 中子弹?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:24.93,0:52:27.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 我想可以找到中庸之道
Dialogue: 1,0:52:30.26,0:52:31.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等着瞧
Dialogue: 1,0:52:32.80,0:52:35.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我一个 快没油的班机号码
Dialogue: 1,0:52:36.93,0:52:39.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,伦敦来的温莎114
Dialogue: 1,0:52:39.30,0:52:41.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,油箱干得像干马提尼
Dialogue: 1,0:52:42.37,0:52:44.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,启动自动导航降落系统
Dialogue: 1,0:52:44.40,0:52:46.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重新校准海平面到…
Dialogue: 1,0:52:47.30,0:52:49.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,负两百尺
Dialogue: 1,0:52:57.93,0:53:00.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(高度)
Dialogue: 1,0:53:13.77,0:53:15.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!
Dialogue: 1,0:53:15.48,0:53:18.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把地面高度降低了两百尺
Dialogue: 1,0:53:18.42,0:53:20.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,温莎114班机
Dialogue: 1,0:53:20.26,0:53:21.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,达拉斯机场导航呼叫
Dialogue: 1,0:53:21.87,0:53:23.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听到请回答
Dialogue: 1,0:53:23.78,0:53:25.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是温莎114
Dialogue: 1,0:53:26.00,0:53:27.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才死到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 1,0:53:27.72,0:53:29.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,温莎114 达拉斯导航回报
Dialogue: 1,0:53:29.86,0:53:32.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直都在这 老友
Dialogue: 1,0:53:32.14,0:53:35.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的系统一秒钟前才刚恢复正常
Dialogue: 1,0:53:35.75,0:53:39.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,温莎114 你可以使用自动导航仪降落了
Dialogue: 1,0:53:39.55,0:53:41.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,使用第29跑道
Dialogue: 1,0:53:41.60,0:53:44.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,进入进场程序时请联络塔台
Dialogue: 1,0:53:44.27,0:53:46.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 他会让那飞机坠毁
Dialogue: 1,0:53:46.34,0:53:48.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到,进场, 该是时候了
Dialogue: 1,0:53:48.10,0:53:51.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我这上头有230人 靠油气在飞
Dialogue: 1,0:53:51.45,0:53:52.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 114 明白
Dialogue: 1,0:53:53.08,0:53:54.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,校准高度表
Dialogue: 1,0:53:54.69,0:53:55.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷
Dialogue: 1,0:53:55.72,0:53:57.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会撞上水泥地
Dialogue: 1,0:53:57.80,0:53:59.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的
Dialogue: 1,0:53:59.32,0:54:00.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么要听他的
Dialogue: 1,0:54:00.67,0:54:02.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他使用的是我们的专用频率 为什么不听?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:02.73,0:54:04.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,达拉斯机场 我是温莎114…
Dialogue: 1,0:54:04.65,0:54:05.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,巴恩!
Dialogue: 1,0:54:05.60,0:54:08.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是达拉斯塔台 雷达上看到你了
Dialogue: 1,0:54:09.29,0:54:10.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的大衣给我
Dialogue: 1,0:54:10.70,0:54:12.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,温莎114  待命
Dialogue: 1,0:54:12.45,0:54:13.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:15.15,0:54:16.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,尽我所能!
Dialogue: 1,0:54:19.84,0:54:21.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们
Dialogue: 1,0:54:21.17,0:54:23.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你们注意到了 我们即将降落
Dialogue: 1,0:54:23.72,0:54:25.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对延误感到抱歉
Dialogue: 1,0:54:25.65,0:54:27.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,几分钟内 我们将要着陆了 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:54:27.65,0:54:29.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请系上你的安全带
Dialogue: 1,0:54:30.36,0:54:31.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心
Dialogue: 1,0:54:31.63,0:54:32.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经对你们下一趟飞机做了安排
Dialogue: 1,0:54:33.05,0:54:34.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不会错过转机的
Dialogue: 1,0:54:35.37,0:54:36.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请回到你的座位上…
Dialogue: 1,0:54:36.49,0:54:38.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 回到座位
Dialogue: 1,0:54:40.77,0:54:42.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就像英国的火车,亲爱的
Dialogue: 1,0:54:42.67,0:54:44.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可能会误点 但总会把你送到
Dialogue: 1,0:54:44.84,0:54:46.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心
Dialogue: 1,0:55:02.69,0:55:04.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运 麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,0:55:27.31,0:55:29.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是温莎114
Dialogue: 1,0:55:29.55,0:55:31.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,己进入进场程序
Dialogue: 1,0:55:31.63,0:55:34.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 114 这是达拉斯塔台
Dialogue: 1,0:55:34.66,0:55:37.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你显示在雷达上 并在导航仪看到你
Dialogue: 1,0:55:37.16,0:55:38.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的方位正确 没有问题
Dialogue: 1,0:55:48.70,0:55:50.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那外头有个人
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.91,0:55:56.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,0:55:56.89,0:55:58.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷
Dialogue: 1,0:56:02.42,0:56:03.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放下襟翼
Dialogue: 1,0:56:04.29,0:56:05.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,放下襟翼
Dialogue: 1,0:56:06.19,0:56:07.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,进场速度140节…
Dialogue: 1,0:56:08.08,0:56:09.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,进场速度140节…
Dialogue: 1,0:56:09.65,0:56:10.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,130节
Dialogue: 1,0:56:11.66,0:56:13.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,高度 1000尺
Dialogue: 1,0:56:13.89,0:56:15.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是800尺,老兄! 你们只有800尺!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:15.85,0:56:17.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,带上紧急救援装备
Dialogue: 1,0:56:17.10,0:56:19.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,全都带着到29跑道
Dialogue: 1,0:56:19.94,0:56:22.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,规定空速加20
Dialogue: 1,0:56:22.61,0:56:24.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,600尺
Dialogue: 1,0:56:25.45,0:56:26.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看来很好 温莎
Dialogue: 1,0:56:27.05,0:56:27.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意
Dialogue: 1,0:56:27.94,0:56:30.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,侧风30节 跑道上结了冰
Dialogue: 1,0:56:30.99,0:56:33.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,做得好 小子 我们会照顾你
Dialogue: 1,0:56:34.24,0:56:35.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们看到你了
Dialogue: 1,0:56:48.97,0:56:50.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快升高
Dialogue: 1,0:56:51.81,0:56:53.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天
Dialogue: 1,0:57:05.35,0:57:07.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我们要死了
Dialogue: 1,0:57:07.37,0:57:08.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们整到你了
Dialogue: 1,0:57:33.10,0:57:34.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不…
Dialogue: 1,0:57:35.85,0:57:37.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 1,0:57:42.04,0:57:43.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,王八蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:57:46.57,0:57:48.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,王八蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:57:52.19,0:57:53.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 1,0:58:05.29,0:58:07.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚的课程到此结束
Dialogue: 1,0:58:08.42,0:58:11.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们要的747按时备妥
Dialogue: 1,0:58:11.10,0:58:14.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,并且埃斯波兰萨将军的飞机 不受干扰抵达
Dialogue: 1,0:58:14.17,0:58:15.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,下一堂可以不用上
Dialogue: 1,0:58:16.80,0:58:17.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,完毕
Dialogue: 1,0:59:04.52,0:59:06.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没发现生还者
Dialogue: 1,0:59:06.57,0:59:08.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真是该死的恶梦
Dialogue: 1,0:59:08.20,0:59:10.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,尼尔逊 过来
Dialogue: 1,0:59:22.91,0:59:24.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,巴恩!
Dialogue: 1,0:59:24.96,0:59:26.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得警告其他飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:59:26.09,0:59:27.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有个疯子
Dialogue: 1,0:59:27.45,0:59:30.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让我跟天上的飞机通话
Dialogue: 1,0:59:30.48,0:59:31.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么通?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:31.30,0:59:32.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你去想法子
Dialogue: 1,0:59:33.17,0:59:34.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是旅客名单
Dialogue: 1,0:59:55.18,0:59:57.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱, 我知道你的感受
Dialogue: 1,1:00:02.72,1:00:04.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我真想帮那些人
Dialogue: 1,1:00:06.69,1:00:08.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我他妈的真没用
Dialogue: 1,1:00:12.65,1:00:15.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经联邦政府求救
Dialogue: 1,1:00:15.95,1:00:18.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会派个特殊兵种
Dialogue: 1,1:00:18.91,1:00:21.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,叫反恐特攻队
Dialogue: 1,1:00:28.65,1:00:30.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,尊夫人的飞机…
Dialogue: 1,1:00:31.52,1:00:32.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们仍在呼叫
Dialogue: 1,1:00:33.05,1:00:34.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们无法回答
Dialogue: 1,1:00:37.14,1:00:40.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,九十分钟后他们就没油了
Dialogue: 1,1:00:51.80,1:00:53.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 迪克
Dialogue: 1,1:00:53.42,1:00:54.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你名字没错吧?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:55.16,1:00:56.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迪克(混帐)
Dialogue: 1,1:00:57.04,1:00:58.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要继续靠得这么近
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.95,1:00:59.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是否可以考虑...
Dialogue: 1,1:01:00.03,1:01:01.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,换换刮胡水
Dialogue: 1,1:01:02.87,1:01:04.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还要换别的吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:05.16,1:01:07.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,强力漱口水也不错
Dialogue: 1,1:01:08.27,1:01:09.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是萨姆·坷曼
Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.96,1:01:11.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,正在事故现场给您报道
Dialogue: 1,1:01:11.30,1:01:12.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,呃,上校
Dialogue: 1,1:01:12.31,1:01:14.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们猜到他们所有行动
Dialogue: 1,1:01:14.66,1:01:15.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,…到目前为止
Dialogue: 1,1:01:16.00,1:01:18.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,官方仍然没有发布任何消息
Dialogue: 1,1:01:18.61,1:01:21.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只有一条跑道
Dialogue: 1,1:01:21.11,1:01:23.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因发生惨剧而关闭
Dialogue: 1,1:01:23.13,1:01:26.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但从我站的这里仍可以看到许多飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:01:26.17,1:01:27.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在不断围着机场盘旋着
Dialogue: 1,1:01:28.04,1:01:30.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,另有消息称在飞机坠毁前,指挥塔内
Dialogue: 1,1:01:30.21,1:01:31.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了大麻烦
Dialogue: 1,1:01:31.34,1:01:33.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这也许也是造成坠机事故的原因之一
Dialogue: 1,1:01:33.55,1:01:34.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有一件事能确定
Dialogue: 1,1:01:34.90,1:01:36.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,随着天气逐渐转坏
Dialogue: 1,1:01:36.41,1:01:38.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,地上和天上的麻烦
Dialogue: 1,1:01:38.46,1:01:39.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,将越来越大
Dialogue: 1,1:01:39.58,1:01:42.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,莎曼萨柯曼 在达拉斯国际机场报导
Dialogue: 1,1:01:50.53,1:01:52.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多 维克多
Dialogue: 1,1:01:52.25,1:01:53.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 怎么了
Dialogue: 1,1:01:53.44,1:01:54.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你把无线麦克风放在行李里…
Dialogue: 1,1:01:55.04,1:01:56.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还是带在身上?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:56.35,1:01:57.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:57.48,1:01:58.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会让那些混球没收
Dialogue: 1,1:01:58.90,1:01:59.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你
Dialogue: 1,1:02:00.11,1:02:01.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给我一具接收器
Dialogue: 1,1:02:06.41,1:02:08.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你能把它调到机师舱频率吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:09.82,1:02:10.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可以 为什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:11.07,1:02:12.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要听听现在怎么样了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:15.50,1:02:17.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,应该就是这个频率了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:18.66,1:02:19.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也听不见
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.82,1:02:20.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说能行的
Dialogue: 1,1:02:20.88,1:02:21.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它到底有没有用呀?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:21.95,1:02:23.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它有用 不过…
Dialogue: 1,1:02:23.06,1:02:25.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我只听到一些机场信号
Dialogue: 1,1:02:25.85,1:02:27.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怪了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:27.55,1:02:29.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是指挥塔不存在了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:31.96,1:02:33.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,继续听吧
Dialogue: 1,1:02:35.31,1:02:36.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听到动静后马上告诉我
Dialogue: 1,1:02:36.90,1:02:37.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:16.45,1:03:18.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,葛蓝少校 我们能行动了
Dialogue: 1,1:03:18.10,1:03:19.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗林 司法部
Dialogue: 1,1:03:19.10,1:03:21.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,特鲁多 飞务总管
Dialogue: 1,1:03:21.32,1:03:23.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伦佐 航警局局长
Dialogue: 1,1:03:23.65,1:03:25.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要的一切 全力支援
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.80,1:03:26.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就这些人?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:26.93,1:03:28.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一个排的兵力?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:28.65,1:03:31.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一个危机一个排 你是谁?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:31.34,1:03:32.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·麦克莱!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:32.77,1:03:35.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱, 你刚才表现很有种.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:35.78,1:03:36.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是呀!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:36.78,1:03:38.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在表现些理智
Dialogue: 1,1:03:38.84,1:03:40.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让专家来处理
Dialogue: 1,1:03:40.70,1:03:43.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是的,不过今晚看来专家是在敌对那一边
Dialogue: 1,1:03:43.55,1:03:45.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,史都华上校不正是你们的人吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:45.30,1:03:46.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不,不再是了,他不是
Dialogue: 1,1:03:46.96,1:03:49.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是来这儿搞掂他的
Dialogue: 1,1:03:49.46,1:03:51.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定会搞掂他的
Dialogue: 1,1:03:51.11,1:03:52.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他是同事
Dialogue: 1,1:03:52.77,1:03:54.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他什么都是我教的
Dialogue: 1,1:03:55.07,1:03:57.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,呃,也许他还学会了一些别的
Dialogue: 1,1:03:59.65,1:04:01.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,动作快!
Dialogue: 1,1:04:01.17,1:04:02.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,指挥所设在
Dialogue: 1,1:04:02.69,1:04:03.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,机场警察局里
Dialogue: 1,1:04:04.00,1:04:07.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要在十五分钟内 接通塔台通讯
Dialogue: 1,1:04:07.13,1:04:09.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧,我们动手吧!
Dialogue: 1,1:04:10.58,1:04:12.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 特鲁多
Dialogue: 1,1:04:14.22,1:04:16.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,事情好转了还是更糟了?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:20.53,1:04:22.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,灯光 大型、可携带的灯光
Dialogue: 1,1:04:22.84,1:04:24.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把这些放在跑道上 然后…
Dialogue: 1,1:04:24.78,1:04:26.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等那些疯子把灯全部打掉?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:26.73,1:04:27.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到哪去弄大型便携灯光?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:27.94,1:04:29.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,从蝙蝠侠那里借?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:29.21,1:04:30.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,无线电话的主意呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:30.69,1:04:32.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上头有十八架飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:04:32.14,1:04:33.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只有五架有电话
Dialogue: 1,1:04:33.82,1:04:34.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跟其中三架通话成功
Dialogue: 1,1:04:34.95,1:04:36.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,其他的还在试
Dialogue: 1,1:04:36.25,1:04:38.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那就等着要发生十三件意外
Dialogue: 1,1:04:38.42,1:04:39.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,逆风情况如何?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:39.56,1:04:42.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚看过气象 外指点标方位的飞机都是顶风
Dialogue: 1,1:04:42.86,1:04:45.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有足够油料的飞机都已经转往亚特兰大
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.16,1:04:46.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,曼菲斯和纳许维尔
Dialogue: 1,1:04:47.39,1:04:48.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,外指点标示
Dialogue: 1,1:04:49.01,1:04:50.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的
Dialogue: 1,1:04:50.79,1:04:52.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那个外指点标示
Dialogue: 1,1:04:53.23,1:04:56.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一种信号,对吗? 会发出哔哔哔的信号
Dialogue: 1,1:04:56.69,1:04:57.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这样他们就会知道 他们飞越了它 对吧?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:57.76,1:05:00.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 又怎样? - 谁说无线电只能发出哔哔声?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:00.91,1:05:04.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的. 把塔台频率换到发信标频率
Dialogue: 1,1:05:04.55,1:05:06.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,增加输出功率
Dialogue: 1,1:05:06.24,1:05:07.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就能跟我们飞机通话
Dialogue: 1,1:05:07.65,1:05:09.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那些杂种绝对不会发现
Dialogue: 1,1:05:12.68,1:05:13.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,追踪信号来源
Dialogue: 1,1:05:14.10,1:05:15.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在行李区发现的
Dialogue: 1,1:05:15.85,1:05:18.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们整晚在窃听你们塔台的电话
Dialogue: 1,1:05:18.76,1:05:21.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,小贼偷行李 嗯?  卡麦?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:24.40,1:05:25.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你进行的如何了? 德福
Dialogue: 1,1:05:25.65,1:05:26.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无进展
Dialogue: 1,1:05:27.00,1:05:28.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我通知林了
Dialogue: 1,1:05:28.20,1:05:30.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们正在装配一个便携解码器,两小时内会送来
Dialogue: 1,1:05:30.97,1:05:32.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我老婆可坚持不了两个小时
Dialogue: 1,1:05:32.37,1:05:34.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我才刚转到葛蓝队上一天
Dialogue: 1,1:05:34.60,1:05:36.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为原本的人得了阑尾炎
Dialogue: 1,1:05:37.21,1:05:40.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可是葛蓝少校是最棒的
Dialogue: 1,1:05:40.15,1:05:41.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,立正
Dialogue: 1,1:05:41.12,1:05:43.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许除了史都华上校
Dialogue: 1,1:05:44.45,1:05:47.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要得知他们要求的那架飞机的情况
Dialogue: 1,1:05:47.86,1:05:49.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,然后再告诉你们我的命令
Dialogue: 1,1:05:49.42,1:05:51.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在到机师简报室去
Dialogue: 1,1:05:51.44,1:05:52.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,继续努力
Dialogue: 1,1:05:52.73,1:05:54.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾伯逊! 跟我来
Dialogue: 1,1:05:59.31,1:06:00.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,平民不能参加
Dialogue: 1,1:06:11.93,1:06:13.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:13.86,1:06:15.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:15.90,1:06:18.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,外指点标发射器不哔哔叫了
Dialogue: 1,1:06:19.00,1:06:20.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,它在说话
Dialogue: 1,1:06:20.47,1:06:23.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,达拉斯机场 所有准备进场飞机注意
Dialogue: 1,1:06:23.10,1:06:25.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是总工程师莱斯利 巴恩
Dialogue: 1,1:06:25.30,1:06:27.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我经授权向各位简报全部情况
Dialogue: 1,1:06:28.24,1:06:32.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,目前 这是我们唯一可用的频道
Dialogue: 1,1:06:32.91,1:06:34.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,情况是这样的
Dialogue: 1,1:06:35.74,1:06:37.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大概在两个小时以前…
Dialogue: 1,1:06:40.53,1:06:42.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一直等到你听到大量这样的声音
Dialogue: 1,1:06:42.28,1:06:44.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不要接受任何声称来自指挥塔的指令
Dialogue: 1,1:06:44.60,1:06:47.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你听到你自己飞机飞行记录仪的访问密码
Dialogue: 1,1:06:47.92,1:06:50.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 恐怖份子破坏了我们所有系统 - 妈的
Dialogue: 1,1:06:50.21,1:06:51.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把这段录下来
Dialogue: 1,1:06:51.55,1:06:53.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,控制了一切 除了这个频道
Dialogue: 1,1:06:53.40,1:06:54.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给我一会就行 求你了
Dialogue: 1,1:06:55.63,1:06:57.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个频道是安全的 你们自己的通信却不是
Dialogue: 1,1:06:57.95,1:07:00.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不要试图,重复一遍,不要试图
Dialogue: 1,1:07:00.13,1:07:02.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,用你们的频率
Dialogue: 1,1:07:02.25,1:07:04.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,回答这个播音
Dialogue: 1,1:07:04.41,1:07:07.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们模仿我们指挥塔已经造成了一架飞机的坠毁
Dialogue: 1,1:07:07.26,1:07:08.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷!
Dialogue: 1,1:07:19.76,1:07:21.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再重复一遍 恐怖份子已经切断了
Dialogue: 1,1:07:21.47,1:07:23.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,降落的两套系统
Dialogue: 1,1:07:24.18,1:07:26.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,包括目视降落的机场指示灯光
Dialogue: 1,1:07:26.43,1:07:28.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,及自动导航降落仪
Dialogue: 1,1:07:28.65,1:07:31.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一支美军特遣队已经到达这里
Dialogue: 1,1:07:31.26,1:07:32.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,正准备消灭这帮恐怖份子
Dialogue: 1,1:07:33.07,1:07:34.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷
Dialogue: 1,1:07:35.14,1:07:36.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 马文
Dialogue: 1,1:07:36.38,1:07:38.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要一件好大衣吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:38.71,1:07:40.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我穿从来都不好看
Dialogue: 1,1:07:40.60,1:07:42.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听着,你必须让我去到机师简报室
Dialogue: 1,1:07:43.02,1:07:44.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我得听听他们都说些什么
Dialogue: 1,1:07:45.04,1:07:47.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那一张图才能让我找到那儿…
Dialogue: 1,1:07:47.43,1:07:48.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰它! 别碰它!
Dialogue: 1,1:07:48.98,1:07:50.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把图找出来,马文 - 我会找到
Dialogue: 1,1:07:50.46,1:07:52.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你会把我的档案系统全弄乱的
Dialogue: 1,1:07:52.82,1:07:54.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想想 机师简报室...
Dialogue: 1,1:07:54.29,1:07:56.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为是在主航站大楼里
Dialogue: 1,1:07:56.19,1:07:59.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那么这个P是不是指的是机师简报室?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:59.90,1:08:01.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,或者也许是...
Dialogue: 1,1:08:01.45,1:08:03.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在M下面 杂物间
Dialogue: 1,1:08:08.48,1:08:09.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的
Dialogue: 1,1:08:09.88,1:08:11.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要求准许岗哨减至
Dialogue: 1,1:08:11.91,1:08:13.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,三十分换一班
Dialogue: 1,1:08:13.55,1:08:15.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我手下又冷又不耐烦 完毕
Dialogue: 1,1:08:15.45,1:08:16.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是史都华上校
Dialogue: 1,1:08:17.05,1:08:19.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把没有站岗的人集合起来听简报 完毕
Dialogue: 1,1:08:19.60,1:08:20.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 上校
Dialogue: 1,1:08:20.66,1:08:21.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:24.70,1:08:26.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,各位
Dialogue: 1,1:08:26.71,1:08:28.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚过后 旧的格局将结束
Dialogue: 1,1:08:29.61,1:08:31.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,多米诺骨牌不再倒下…
Dialogue: 1,1:08:31.80,1:08:33.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,堡垒仍维持坚固
Dialogue: 1,1:08:33.91,1:08:35.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 埃斯波兰萨将军的飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:08:35.51,1:08:37.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,刚进入荧幕
Dialogue: 1,1:08:44.00,1:08:45.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意 达拉斯塔台
Dialogue: 1,1:08:45.95,1:08:47.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要打开一个跑道的照明
Dialogue: 1,1:08:47.80,1:08:51.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 重复 不要企图让任何飞机降落
Dialogue: 1,1:08:51.77,1:08:53.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,记住 我们在监视你们
Dialogue: 1,1:08:56.55,1:08:58.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么办?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:59.70,1:09:00.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,服从
Dialogue: 1,1:09:07.24,1:09:09.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,达拉斯塔台呼叫 狐步舞迈克一号
Dialogue: 1,1:09:09.70,1:09:12.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,达拉斯塔台呼叫 狐步舞迈克一号
Dialogue: 1,1:09:12.48,1:09:14.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是狐步舞迈克一号, 达拉斯
Dialogue: 1,1:09:14.65,1:09:16.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听到了 完毕
Dialogue: 1,1:09:16.48,1:09:19.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,狐步舞迈克一号 你要在15跑道上降落
Dialogue: 1,1:09:19.50,1:09:21.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重复 15
Dialogue: 1,1:09:35.36,1:09:38.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在行李输送带旁
Dialogue: 1,1:09:38.22,1:09:39.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,地上发现的
Dialogue: 1,1:09:39.67,1:09:42.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底这么兴奋干嘛?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:42.32,1:09:44.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意仍在接受信号
Dialogue: 1,1:09:44.09,1:09:45.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:45.62,1:09:48.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,二十块钱卖给你如何?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:48.41,1:09:50.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那我让你活下去如何?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:51.60,1:09:53.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你真会讨价还价
Dialogue: 1,1:09:53.78,1:09:56.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这和我们原先的指令相反
Dialogue: 1,1:09:56.36,1:09:58.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该在10号跑道降落
Dialogue: 1,1:09:59.20,1:10:02.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,并且和你们司法部的代表…
Dialogue: 1,1:10:03.25,1:10:05.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,机长,请告诉指挥塔
Dialogue: 1,1:10:05.90,1:10:07.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你会照指令行事
Dialogue: 1,1:10:18.38,1:10:20.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 达拉斯
Dialogue: 1,1:10:21.22,1:10:23.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,继续飞向第15号跑道
Dialogue: 1,1:10:39.19,1:10:41.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,狐步舞迈克一号 请回答
Dialogue: 1,1:10:42.32,1:10:44.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在要怎样?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:44.33,1:10:45.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把我杀了?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:46.01,1:10:47.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来飞这架飞机?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:47.54,1:10:48.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别操心
Dialogue: 1,1:10:49.03,1:10:50.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的问题了
Dialogue: 1,1:10:56.65,1:10:59.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克1号 听到没?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:02.92,1:11:05.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,狐步舞迈克一号 请回答
Dialogue: 1,1:11:14.45,1:11:15.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鹰巢
Dialogue: 1,1:11:15.85,1:11:17.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是猎鹰 求助
Dialogue: 1,1:11:17.36,1:11:20.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鹰巢 这是猎鹰 求助
Dialogue: 1,1:11:22.16,1:11:23.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请讲 猎鹰
Dialogue: 1,1:11:23.64,1:11:27.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了舱压 能见度近乎零
Dialogue: 1,1:11:27.37,1:11:30.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须躲避天气 得马上降落
Dialogue: 1,1:11:30.33,1:11:32.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在最近的跑道上
Dialogue: 1,1:11:32.15,1:11:33.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重复
Dialogue: 1,1:11:33.22,1:11:36.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了舱压 能见度近乎零
Dialogue: 1,1:11:36.69,1:11:38.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须脱离这暴风
Dialogue: 1,1:11:38.68,1:11:41.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以降落 但必须马上降落
Dialogue: 1,1:11:41.41,1:11:43.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在最近的跑道上
Dialogue: 1,1:11:43.38,1:11:45.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重复 我不能绕到
Dialogue: 1,1:11:45.45,1:11:47.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,15跑道去了
Dialogue: 1,1:11:50.77,1:11:52.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们做个交易 马文
Dialogue: 1,1:11:52.80,1:11:54.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉我去跑道的捷径
Dialogue: 1,1:11:54.68,1:11:56.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我就给你弄件大衣的衬里
Dialogue: 1,1:11:56.38,1:11:59.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重复 我不能绕到15跑道去了
Dialogue: 1,1:11:59.95,1:12:00.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:01.04,1:12:02.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,待命 猎鹰
Dialogue: 1,1:12:04.30,1:12:05.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里 长官
Dialogue: 1,1:12:05.43,1:12:07.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他从海洋的方向飞过来
Dialogue: 1,1:12:09.07,1:12:11.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一颗子弹弄坏了我的仪表
Dialogue: 1,1:12:11.55,1:12:13.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能确定我的方位
Dialogue: 1,1:12:13.45,1:12:15.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须马上目视降落
Dialogue: 1,1:12:15.85,1:12:17.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听到了没 鹰巢?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:17.75,1:12:18.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 猎鹰
Dialogue: 1,1:12:19.05,1:12:20.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,使用右25跑道
Dialogue: 1,1:12:20.98,1:12:23.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重复 右25跑道
Dialogue: 1,1:12:23.25,1:12:25.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,打定主意呀
Dialogue: 1,1:12:26.20,1:12:29.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,又碰上 爱耍人的恐怖份子了 约翰
Dialogue: 1,1:12:29.59,1:12:31.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,确认 右25 完毕
Dialogue: 1,1:12:31.26,1:12:32.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,右25
Dialogue: 1,1:12:34.57,1:12:36.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定得戒烟了
Dialogue: 1,1:12:37.53,1:12:39.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你告诉我 鹰巢
Dialogue: 1,1:12:39.80,1:12:41.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你能打开跑道照明
Dialogue: 1,1:12:41.85,1:12:43.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我会很感激
Dialogue: 1,1:12:54.45,1:12:55.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到灯光了
Dialogue: 1,1:12:55.96,1:12:58.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就在我正前方
Dialogue: 1,1:12:58.29,1:12:59.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 老友
Dialogue: 1,1:12:59.79,1:13:02.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,降低空速 接近跑道
Dialogue: 1,1:13:02.80,1:13:04.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,祝我好运
Dialogue: 1,1:13:04.30,1:13:05.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 猎鹰
Dialogue: 1,1:13:06.97,1:13:09.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们听到了 五分钟后见
Dialogue: 1,1:13:09.44,1:13:10.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 混蛋…
Dialogue: 1,1:13:10.94,1:13:12.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后就捉到你们了
Dialogue: 1,1:13:36.27,1:13:38.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见灯了
Dialogue: 1,1:13:38.27,1:13:39.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,预备九十秒降落
Dialogue: 1,1:13:48.78,1:13:51.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,到老爸这儿来 废物
Dialogue: 1,1:14:58.66,1:15:00.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 1,1:15:47.94,1:15:49.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,自由
Dialogue: 1,1:15:50.94,1:15:52.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还没有喔!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:54.18,1:15:55.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在飞机到停机坪前
Dialogue: 1,1:15:55.78,1:15:57.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该继续坐着
Dialogue: 1,1:15:57.29,1:15:59.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看样子不常坐飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:15:59.99,1:16:01.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:01.19,1:16:02.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警察
Dialogue: 1,1:16:02.36,1:16:03.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警察?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:03.36,1:16:04.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我是好人
Dialogue: 1,1:16:04.36,1:16:05.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而你是坏人
Dialogue: 1,1:16:06.10,1:16:08.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你在我手上,我得拿你换我老婆
Dialogue: 1,1:16:18.14,1:16:19.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下
Dialogue: 1,1:16:22.65,1:16:24.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,进去!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:30.35,1:16:31.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他去哪了?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:31.36,1:16:32.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在那里头
Dialogue: 1,1:16:42.57,1:16:43.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不信有这种事
Dialogue: 1,1:16:43.57,1:16:44.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,两个月计划…
Dialogue: 1,1:16:45.10,1:16:47.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没料到有笨警察
Dialogue: 1,1:16:47.27,1:16:48.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 将军!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:48.27,1:16:49.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,史都华上校到底在哪里?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:53.62,1:16:54.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,将军!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:54.78,1:16:55.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!我没事
Dialogue: 1,1:16:56.05,1:16:58.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他是个警察
Dialogue: 1,1:16:58.28,1:17:00.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你肃清了这个地方
Dialogue: 1,1:17:00.15,1:17:02.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他到机师舱里去了
Dialogue: 1,1:17:02.29,1:17:04.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,马上要他的命
Dialogue: 1,1:17:04.29,1:17:05.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,1:17:05.49,1:17:09.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这是你 麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,1:17:09.30,1:17:11.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个不错的小战士
Dialogue: 1,1:17:11.80,1:17:15.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把这个当成一个军方葬礼
Dialogue: 1,1:17:38.90,1:17:41.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有几个手榴弹
Dialogue: 1,1:17:41.33,1:17:43.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,每人三个
Dialogue: 1,1:17:43.60,1:17:44.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,都丢进去
Dialogue: 1,1:17:54.78,1:17:56.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:10.55,1:18:11.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:27.01,1:18:28.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 1,1:18:28.95,1:18:30.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的!
Dialogue: 1,1:18:39.26,1:18:41.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你这幸运的混蛋
Dialogue: 1,1:18:44.19,1:18:45.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,救火车来了 长官
Dialogue: 1,1:18:45.95,1:18:48.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,退回到教堂去 现在
Dialogue: 1,1:19:10.52,1:19:12.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的门呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:27.25,1:19:29.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,旅客们很紧张
Dialogue: 1,1:19:29.50,1:19:31.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我也是
Dialogue: 1,1:19:31.04,1:19:32.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就在华盛顿上空
Dialogue: 1,1:19:32.55,1:19:33.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看你能否打开电视
Dialogue: 1,1:19:33.81,1:19:35.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们平静下来
Dialogue: 1,1:19:35.30,1:19:36.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的工作 我…
Dialogue: 1,1:19:37.55,1:19:39.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(油料控制)
Dialogue: 1,1:20:00.76,1:20:04.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,写铁钟奖最差节目受奖答词?
Dialogue: 1,1:20:04.95,1:20:06.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,普力兹奖还差不多
Dialogue: 1,1:20:06.35,1:20:07.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们女士们
Dialogue: 1,1:20:07.23,1:20:08.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等待降落时
Dialogue: 1,1:20:08.86,1:20:10.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,将播送华盛顿当地节目
Dialogue: 1,1:20:10.90,1:20:12.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,声音在第三频道
Dialogue: 1,1:20:19.69,1:20:20.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 1,1:20:21.24,1:20:22.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好 好
Dialogue: 1,1:20:31.15,1:20:33.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 先生 我们随时都会降落
Dialogue: 1,1:20:34.10,1:20:35.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请你坐到位子上…
Dialogue: 1,1:20:35.29,1:20:36.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想呕吐 抱歉 我想吐…
Dialogue: 1,1:20:36.97,1:20:38.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,安全带的灯亮了
Dialogue: 1,1:20:43.61,1:20:44.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,蠢蛋!
Dialogue: 1,1:20:44.90,1:20:45.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,WZDC新闻台
Dialogue: 1,1:20:45.71,1:20:47.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是理查德 索伯
Dialogue: 1,1:20:47.38,1:20:48.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给我接新闻室的鲁本
Dialogue: 1,1:20:49.00,1:20:50.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他就要直播了…
Dialogue: 1,1:20:50.29,1:20:51.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道马上要播出
Dialogue: 1,1:20:51.48,1:20:52.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但我需要他
Dialogue: 1,1:20:52.77,1:20:53.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你得等一下...
Dialogue: 1,1:20:53.91,1:20:55.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给我转过去,西莉娅
Dialogue: 1,1:20:55.10,1:20:56.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不然就准备写自己的简历去
Dialogue: 1,1:20:57.91,1:20:59.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,埃斯波兰萨降落了
Dialogue: 1,1:21:00.90,1:21:02.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可是他受了伤
Dialogue: 1,1:21:02.93,1:21:04.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他肩膀上挨了一枪
Dialogue: 1,1:21:04.90,1:21:06.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我还杀了另外一个
Dialogue: 1,1:21:06.69,1:21:07.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经一共损失六个人了
Dialogue: 1,1:21:07.82,1:21:09.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是能知道 他们总共有多少人
Dialogue: 1,1:21:10.00,1:21:11.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们才高兴得起来
Dialogue: 1,1:21:11.14,1:21:12.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们有五十人
Dialogue: 1,1:21:12.35,1:21:14.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就别太急着开香槟庆祝了
Dialogue: 1,1:21:14.95,1:21:16.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱 我欣赏你的努力
Dialogue: 1,1:21:16.87,1:21:18.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不需要自行其事的人
Dialogue: 1,1:21:18.85,1:21:20.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是他们决定再弄毁另一架飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:21:20.85,1:21:22.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,来报复你的小把戏呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:22.33,1:21:24.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们办不到了 对吧 巴恩?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:24.64,1:21:26.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我已经捉到埃斯波兰萨
Dialogue: 1,1:21:26.64,1:21:27.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就全部搞掂了
Dialogue: 1,1:21:27.72,1:21:30.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,呃,如果他们比你想的 更难对付呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:30.35,1:21:32.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,至少我有计划 该死
Dialogue: 1,1:21:32.14,1:21:33.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,给我听好
Dialogue: 1,1:21:33.62,1:21:36.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在他们离地前 与他们战斗是我的责任
Dialogue: 1,1:21:36.48,1:21:37.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样!
Dialogue: 1,1:21:37.48,1:21:41.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你现身的地点及时间都不对
Dialogue: 1,1:21:43.00,1:21:44.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这事老发生在我身上
Dialogue: 1,1:21:46.10,1:21:47.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,少校!
Dialogue: 1,1:21:47.20,1:21:49.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五角大厦战况室来电
Dialogue: 1,1:21:49.17,1:21:50.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五角大厦…
Dialogue: 1,1:21:50.21,1:21:51.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里接
Dialogue: 1,1:21:51.70,1:21:52.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 德福
Dialogue: 1,1:21:52.87,1:21:54.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些人跟我来
Dialogue: 1,1:21:57.18,1:21:58.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,1:21:58.18,1:21:59.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样 巴恩?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:59.24,1:22:01.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你说那些恐怖份子立刻就现身了
Dialogue: 1,1:22:01.16,1:22:01.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,恩？
Dialogue: 1,1:22:01.88,1:22:05.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那他们一定在跑道上 或是在附近
Dialogue: 1,1:22:05.35,1:22:07.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道是哪里
Dialogue: 1,1:22:07.39,1:22:08.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 我给你看一样东西
Dialogue: 1,1:22:11.22,1:22:13.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是十二年前
Dialogue: 1,1:22:13.88,1:22:16.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,兴建长跑道的计划
Dialogue: 1,1:22:16.20,1:22:18.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来他们对 航站大厦做了些修改
Dialogue: 1,1:22:18.73,1:22:20.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,雷达、电话和导航仪…
Dialogue: 1,1:22:20.84,1:22:22.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有地下的玩意 都被移动
Dialogue: 1,1:22:22.40,1:22:24.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以便对排水道施工
Dialogue: 1,1:22:24.37,1:22:25.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我想的没错
Dialogue: 1,1:22:25.22,1:22:27.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,线路会顺着机场
Dialogue: 1,1:22:27.87,1:22:29.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,通到这附近
Dialogue: 1,1:22:33.29,1:22:35.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们两小时前就该降落了!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:35.23,1:22:37.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白 请你放轻松…
Dialogue: 1,1:22:38.55,1:22:40.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没希望了
Dialogue: 1,1:22:41.26,1:22:44.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,弄得这一团糟 得有人挨揍才对
Dialogue: 1,1:22:45.56,1:22:46.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,恩 很不幸
Dialogue: 1,1:22:46.90,1:22:49.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天气是这样的 我们谁也不能怪
Dialogue: 1,1:22:49.27,1:22:52.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?  那个报气象的老俊男呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:52.27,1:22:54.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我该坐巴士的
Dialogue: 1,1:22:54.27,1:22:57.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,至少他们能停下来 吃东西及加油
Dialogue: 1,1:22:57.27,1:22:58.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:58.48,1:22:59.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:00.44,1:23:01.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不明白…
Dialogue: 1,1:23:02.47,1:23:03.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,飞行时间原定是
Dialogue: 1,1:23:03.80,1:23:06.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五个半小时 对不对?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:06.90,1:23:08.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有足够的油料吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:08.60,1:23:10.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们不停绕圈?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:10.29,1:23:11.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有
Dialogue: 1,1:23:11.12,1:23:13.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们预先想到类似这样的问题了
Dialogue: 1,1:23:31.58,1:23:33.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,巴恩, 我们看了他妈12个房子
Dialogue: 1,1:23:33.51,1:23:34.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也没有
Dialogue: 1,1:23:34.75,1:23:36.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最后一个可能了
Dialogue: 1,1:23:37.65,1:23:39.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里有一所旧教堂
Dialogue: 1,1:23:39.50,1:23:40.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走
Dialogue: 1,1:23:45.26,1:23:46.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 1,1:23:54.03,1:23:56.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,教堂在那里
Dialogue: 1,1:24:04.17,1:24:05.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是个岗哨
Dialogue: 1,1:24:05.96,1:24:08.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也可能是出来散步的
Dialogue: 1,1:24:08.07,1:24:10.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么来回走来走去?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:13.04,1:24:14.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快来
Dialogue: 1,1:24:16.40,1:24:17.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,1:24:17.83,1:24:20.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,待在这儿 准备叫陆战队的人来
Dialogue: 1,1:24:20.32,1:24:21.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为他们是陆军来的
Dialogue: 1,1:24:21.95,1:24:24.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,管他妈的 准备好就行了
Dialogue: 1,1:24:42.81,1:24:43.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:43.95,1:24:45.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在别响!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:47.76,1:24:49.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 1,1:24:59.20,1:25:01.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伦佐 我是巴恩
Dialogue: 1,1:25:01.54,1:25:03.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,巴恩 你们到底去了哪里?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:03.10,1:25:03.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:04.01,1:25:07.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他和我在一起 我们在机场西侧的教堂
Dialogue: 1,1:25:07.11,1:25:09.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在哪儿?  该死
Dialogue: 1,1:25:09.05,1:25:10.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你这神经白痴 怎么...
Dialogue: 1,1:25:10.79,1:25:12.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的行动基地在这里
Dialogue: 1,1:25:12.29,1:25:13.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,闭上嘴 赶紧过来
Dialogue: 1,1:25:13.79,1:25:14.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: 1,1:25:14.79,1:25:16.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,红色警戒 更新情报
Dialogue: 1,1:25:16.29,1:25:18.62,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们确定了史都华的位置
Dialogue: 1,1:25:18.73,1:25:19.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,动身吧
Dialogue: 1,1:25:30.74,1:25:32.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们撤离的飞机会在
Dialogue: 1,1:25:33.08,1:25:35.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,三十分钟内准备好 将军
Dialogue: 1,1:25:35.75,1:25:38.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有意外的话
Dialogue: 1,1:25:53.66,1:25:56.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 我们这里有状况
Dialogue: 1,1:26:43.69,1:26:46.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 1,1:26:55.83,1:26:56.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦
Dialogue: 1,1:27:14.39,1:27:15.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,在这边
Dialogue: 1,1:27:27.73,1:27:30.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 麦克莱 你还好吧? 要医护兵吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:30.57,1:27:32.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱 你以为你在干什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:32.51,1:27:33.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,扮牛仔吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:34.07,1:27:36.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,想不想在看守所待一夜?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:36.31,1:27:38.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伦佐 闭上鸟嘴 去做些有用的事
Dialogue: 1,1:27:38.61,1:27:39.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,去把路封了
Dialogue: 1,1:27:39.91,1:27:41.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿,你不能这样对我说话
Dialogue: 1,1:27:42.08,1:27:43.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,不行吗? 卡麦
Dialogue: 1,1:27:43.48,1:27:47.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,士官 马上让这个白痴官僚在麦克莱先生面前消失
Dialogue: 1,1:27:47.29,1:27:49.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意效劳 长官
Dialogue: 1,1:27:50.93,1:27:52.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,少校
Dialogue: 1,1:27:53.09,1:27:54.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都就位了
Dialogue: 1,1:27:54.43,1:27:56.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,包围后面再进去
Dialogue: 1,1:27:56.43,1:27:57.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,听我口令开火
Dialogue: 1,1:27:57.93,1:27:59.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命 长官
Dialogue: 1,1:27:59.43,1:28:01.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜我想错你了
Dialogue: 1,1:28:01.40,1:28:03.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,终究你不是那么混帐
Dialogue: 1,1:28:03.97,1:28:05.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你是对的
Dialogue: 1,1:28:05.47,1:28:07.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一样混帐
Dialogue: 1,1:28:15.92,1:28:18.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘉伯 情况汇告!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:18.69,1:28:22.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,陆军特遣队从三面包围我们
Dialogue: 1,1:28:22.66,1:28:23.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,又出问题了? 上校!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:24.09,1:28:26.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 将军
Dialogue: 1,1:28:26.20,1:28:29.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 你们知道怎么处理
Dialogue: 1,1:28:39.94,1:28:40.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:40.95,1:28:42.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下 趴下
Dialogue: 1,1:29:10.24,1:29:13.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,将军 是时候了
Dialogue: 1,1:29:20.19,1:29:23.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快 我们走
Dialogue: 1,1:29:37.24,1:29:40.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们撤退了!
Dialogue: 1,1:29:47.55,1:29:49.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快!
Dialogue: 1,1:29:59.70,1:30:02.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,艾伯逊 叫你手下绕到后头
Dialogue: 1,1:30:08.91,1:30:10.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 1,1:30:15.38,1:30:17.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 1,1:30:27.66,1:30:30.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这些设备能让飞机降落
Dialogue: 1,1:30:30.43,1:30:33.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰 他们可能装了诡雷…
Dialogue: 1,1:30:33.23,1:30:34.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的确装了
Dialogue: 1,1:30:34.24,1:30:35.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这里也有一个
Dialogue: 1,1:30:35.30,1:30:36.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,像是塑胶炸弹 而且已经武装了
Dialogue: 1,1:30:36.97,1:30:40.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的人 离开这里
Dialogue: 1,1:30:43.41,1:30:44.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在设备上装了诡雷
Dialogue: 1,1:30:44.91,1:30:46.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把教堂封闭起来
Dialogue: 1,1:30:46.42,1:30:47.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:47.92,1:30:49.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,派警卫 不准任何人接近
Dialogue: 1,1:30:49.92,1:30:53.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 狗日的麦克莱呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:42.18,1:31:43.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,米勒 干掉他
Dialogue: 1,1:31:45.08,1:31:48.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我掩护你
Dialogue: 1,1:32:33.97,1:32:37.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这下可永绝后患了
Dialogue: 1,1:32:37.37,1:32:38.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,出发吧
Dialogue: 1,1:32:56.32,1:32:58.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我明明有瞄到那杂种
Dialogue: 1,1:32:58.49,1:33:00.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我有
Dialogue: 1,1:33:10.00,1:33:11.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷
Dialogue: 1,1:33:17.08,1:33:19.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,注意,指挥塔注意 达拉斯指挥塔注意
Dialogue: 1,1:33:19.45,1:33:22.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是史都华上校 我们的飞机准备好没?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:22.45,1:33:24.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 在第11号机棚里
Dialogue: 1,1:33:24.45,1:33:26.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,距此最远的建筑物
Dialogue: 1,1:33:26.76,1:33:29.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这就去
Dialogue: 1,1:33:29.86,1:33:33.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,派一组地勤人员 检查飞机的适飞状况
Dialogue: 1,1:33:33.46,1:33:36.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们相信那家伙 真有这个种吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:36.43,1:33:39.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上校 你自己就有 足够的能力去检查
Dialogue: 1,1:33:39.27,1:33:43.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别想让我们奉送人质
Dialogue: 1,1:33:43.47,1:33:44.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,葛蓝少校 是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:44.98,1:33:46.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你记得我…上校
Dialogue: 1,1:33:46.71,1:33:50.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那你该记得我也懂这一套
Dialogue: 1,1:33:50.35,1:33:52.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,自己去检查该死的飞机吧!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:52.48,1:33:54.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后行动
Dialogue: 1,1:33:54.99,1:33:56.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都穿上防弹衣
Dialogue: 1,1:33:56.49,1:33:58.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,突击组着全身护甲
Dialogue: 1,1:33:58.99,1:34:00.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,狙击手要带红外线瞄准镜
Dialogue: 1,1:34:00.49,1:34:02.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到机棚去对付他们
Dialogue: 1,1:34:02.49,1:34:04.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要亲自把引爆器
Dialogue: 1,1:34:04.50,1:34:07.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,从史都华的尸体上取过来
Dialogue: 1,1:34:07.50,1:34:10.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伦佐 带你手下回到机场
Dialogue: 1,1:34:10.97,1:34:12.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把所有的出口都封闭
Dialogue: 1,1:34:12.47,1:34:13.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以防有人溜过防线
Dialogue: 1,1:34:14.01,1:34:15.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,趁机脱逃出去
Dialogue: 1,1:34:16.01,1:34:17.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题
Dialogue: 1,1:34:19.41,1:34:21.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们走
Dialogue: 1,1:34:21.31,1:34:22.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迪克 这真是疯了
Dialogue: 1,1:34:22.62,1:34:23.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,每家电视台都派了人在机场
Dialogue: 1,1:34:23.95,1:34:26.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可是你说的这事可没人听过
Dialogue: 1,1:34:26.95,1:34:28.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可不像我
Dialogue: 1,1:34:28.89,1:34:30.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要证据吗? 听听这个
Dialogue: 1,1:34:30.66,1:34:34.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,“重复 恐怖份子谋杀了许多平民”
Dialogue: 1,1:34:34.16,1:34:37.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,“切断了让你们降落的系统设备”
Dialogue: 1,1:34:37.27,1:34:39.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,“陆军特遣队 己到这
Dialogue: 1,1:34:39.47,1:34:40.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,包围恐怖份子”
Dialogue: 1,1:34:40.84,1:34:41.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天
Dialogue: 1,1:34:41.84,1:34:43.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你马上直播出去
Dialogue: 1,1:34:43.97,1:34:45.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,用我的相片 从档案里面取
Dialogue: 1,1:34:46.04,1:34:48.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,找一张地图 去气象部偷一张
Dialogue: 1,1:34:48.18,1:34:49.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,正在办了 我们五分钟后做插播
Dialogue: 1,1:34:49.48,1:34:50.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉友台如果他们也要联播
Dialogue: 1,1:34:50.98,1:34:52.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们得在三分钟内知会
Dialogue: 1,1:34:52.48,1:34:54.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们来干吧!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:54.92,1:34:57.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,全国电视网 我来了
Dialogue: 1,1:35:00.56,1:35:03.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,德福 我们去格瑞纳达时
Dialogue: 1,1:35:03.49,1:35:05.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛穿得跟雪人一样?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:07.03,1:35:09.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,格瑞纳达 交火五分钟
Dialogue: 1,1:35:09.53,1:35:12.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,冲浪五星期
Dialogue: 1,1:35:12.34,1:35:14.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望我也有去
Dialogue: 1,1:35:14.41,1:35:16.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我也是 孩子
Dialogue: 1,1:35:16.51,1:35:17.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真的 长官?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:17.94,1:35:19.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当然
Dialogue: 1,1:35:19.74,1:35:22.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就用不着这么做了
Dialogue: 1,1:35:37.80,1:35:40.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,鹰巢 我是幼鹰
Dialogue: 1,1:35:40.47,1:35:44.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,按时到了指定位置
Dialogue: 1,1:35:44.60,1:35:46.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 幼鹰 我们这里很平静
Dialogue: 1,1:35:46.97,1:35:48.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以进行了
Dialogue: 1,1:35:48.98,1:35:52.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我重复 可以进行
Dialogue: 1,1:36:03.49,1:36:05.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 警官 你从那里来的?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:05.99,1:36:07.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,珍珠港?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:11.53,1:36:14.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 清场 拜托
Dialogue: 1,1:36:16.04,1:36:17.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,准备
Dialogue: 1,1:36:17.94,1:36:20.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五…四…三…
Dialogue: 1,1:36:20.64,1:36:23.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,WZDC新闻 特别新闻快报
Dialogue: 1,1:36:23.90,1:36:26.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚早些时候达拉斯机场发生坠机事件
Dialogue: 1,1:36:26.40,1:36:28.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,其他飞机仍在当地继续盘旋
Dialogue: 1,1:36:28.40,1:36:31.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,机场或航空局官方 均未发表声明
Dialogue: 1,1:36:31.36,1:36:34.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在WZDC独家报导…
Dialogue: 1,1:36:34.71,1:36:37.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迪克索伯自华盛顿上空报导
Dialogue: 1,1:36:38.12,1:36:40.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在华府上空盘旋着的
Dialogue: 1,1:36:40.50,1:36:42.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,千名旅客之一
Dialogue: 1,1:36:42.14,1:36:44.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们假定在下方发生的情况
Dialogue: 1,1:36:44.15,1:36:46.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,只是一般常发生的小错误
Dialogue: 1,1:36:47.07,1:36:49.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,然而事实与想像相距甚远
Dialogue: 1,1:36:49.48,1:36:51.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,事实很可怕
Dialogue: 1,1:36:52.00,1:36:54.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让开 女士 让开
Dialogue: 1,1:36:55.01,1:36:56.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,小心!
Dialogue: 1,1:36:56.63,1:36:58.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,当心,让开
Dialogue: 1,1:36:59.12,1:37:00.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走开啊!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:00.49,1:37:02.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士 走开
Dialogue: 1,1:37:02.69,1:37:04.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快  嘿 嘿 小心
Dialogue: 1,1:37:04.65,1:37:06.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,以下的录音是
Dialogue: 1,1:37:06.49,1:37:09.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,塔台 和盘旋飞机之间的对话
Dialogue: 1,1:37:11.93,1:37:13.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,让开
Dialogue: 1,1:37:15.35,1:37:16.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,罗伦佐
Dialogue: 1,1:37:17.01,1:37:18.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱,你他妈的疯了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:18.44,1:37:20.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,陆军特遣队在哪里
Dialogue: 1,1:37:20.44,1:37:22.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,史都华在教堂 装了摇控爆炸装置
Dialogue: 1,1:37:22.11,1:37:23.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,葛蓝呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:23.35,1:37:25.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,葛蓝和他手下 正要去把他杀了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:25.95,1:37:27.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会这么做
Dialogue: 1,1:37:27.15,1:37:29.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不 他们是要跟他一起上飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:37:29.45,1:37:30.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的滚出去
Dialogue: 1,1:37:30.62,1:37:32.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,军方解雇史都华的时候
Dialogue: 1,1:37:32.62,1:37:33.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经把自己人马都安插进去了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:33.79,1:37:35.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗? 那场枪战…
Dialogue: 1,1:37:35.59,1:37:37.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是换取时间的烟火秀
Dialogue: 1,1:37:37.13,1:37:40.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱 你真是疯子 你知道吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:40.56,1:37:41.93,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,同时你被捕了 你他妈的!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:48.41,1:37:51.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这个就是他们今晚 所使用的子弹
Dialogue: 1,1:37:51.41,1:37:53.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,空心弹
Dialogue: 1,1:37:54.98,1:37:57.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷
Dialogue: 1,1:38:04.49,1:38:07.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我是罗伦佐局长
Dialogue: 1,1:38:07.23,1:38:08.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后我要所有警官
Dialogue: 1,1:38:08.49,1:38:10.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,集合全员全副武装
Dialogue: 1,1:38:10.50,1:38:12.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,备摩托雪橇
Dialogue: 1,1:38:13.97,1:38:17.66,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,准备砍人啰!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:19.51,1:38:21.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就像在硫磺岛
Dialogue: 1,1:38:21.98,1:38:25.17,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们获悉 恐怖份子
Dialogue: 1,1:38:25.28,1:38:27.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,已经实质控制了机场
Dialogue: 1,1:38:27.35,1:38:30.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,此一被当局所隐瞒的真相
Dialogue: 1,1:38:30.52,1:38:32.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,除非满足恐怖分子提出的要求
Dialogue: 1,1:38:32.52,1:38:34.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,否则他们声称会有更多 流血事件发生
Dialogue: 1,1:38:34.82,1:38:36.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在陆军特遣队
Dialogue: 1,1:38:36.96,1:38:38.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,己抵达机场
Dialogue: 1,1:38:38.46,1:38:42.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,一场生死之战将是不可避免的
Dialogue: 1,1:39:03.25,1:39:06.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那个愚蠢傲慢的混帐…
Dialogue: 1,1:39:06.49,1:39:09.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,已经传遍了机场
Dialogue: 1,1:39:09.39,1:39:11.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,300人已经死亡
Dialogue: 1,1:39:11.40,1:39:13.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么时候降落
Dialogue: 1,1:39:13.90,1:39:16.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的是 他们不是最后的牺牲者
Dialogue: 1,1:39:16.50,1:39:19.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,令人惊恐的事实是 没有人是安全的
Dialogue: 1,1:39:19.17,1:39:21.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,无论是上方的飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:39:21.44,1:39:23.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,或是下方的航站
Dialogue: 1,1:39:23.94,1:39:27.34,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那种不论你我 随时会死去的恐惧
Dialogue: 1,1:39:27.45,1:39:29.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,使所有的人备感威胁
Dialogue: 1,1:39:29.45,1:39:31.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,而充满宁静和爱的假期
Dialogue: 1,1:39:31.45,1:39:33.82,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在变成了可怕的恶梦
Dialogue: 1,1:39:39.83,1:39:41.23,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好 各单位注意!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:41.33,1:39:44.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要全员于11号机棚集合
Dialogue: 1,1:39:44.47,1:39:45.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,全面包围!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:45.97,1:39:47.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这辆车 麦克莱 上车
Dialogue: 1,1:39:47.97,1:39:50.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等市警局的后备人员到达时…
Dialogue: 1,1:39:50.84,1:39:52.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们只负责收尸了
Dialogue: 1,1:39:52.47,1:39:54.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,出发!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:54.41,1:39:58.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱 见过我弟弟维多
Dialogue: 1,1:39:58.45,1:40:00.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 1,1:40:00.12,1:40:01.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 1,1:40:08.16,1:40:09.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的 搞什么!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:09.49,1:40:12.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把这破车开走!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:12.23,1:40:16.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你开走好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:40:16.50,1:40:17.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,维多 给我滚下来
Dialogue: 1,1:40:17.93,1:40:20.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,过来帮我把这车弄走
Dialogue: 1,1:40:20.94,1:40:22.24,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你能...
Dialogue: 1,1:40:22.34,1:40:24.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,马上把车移走!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:24.88,1:40:26.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就在那 拍那里!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:26.11,1:40:28.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 柯曼
Dialogue: 1,1:40:28.21,1:40:32.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,莎曼萨柯曼!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:32.38,1:40:34.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,柯曼!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:36.12,1:40:38.56,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,柯曼!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:38.66,1:40:42.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,不过至少人质并不晓得真相
Dialogue: 1,1:40:42.46,1:40:45.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,因为在下理查索伯 凑巧在此地
Dialogue: 1,1:40:45.97,1:40:50.16,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,将我的生命和才干
Dialogue: 1,1:40:50.27,1:40:53.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,奉献给人性和国家
Dialogue: 1,1:40:53.24,1:40:56.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这也许是我最后一次播报
Dialogue: 1,1:40:58.48,1:41:01.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,阿门!  迪克(混帐)!
Dialogue: 1,1:41:01.55,1:41:04.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迪克! 我们在直播呢? 迪克
Dialogue: 1,1:41:04.48,1:41:06.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪里?
Dialogue: 1,1:41:06.65,1:41:09.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,迪克
Dialogue: 1,1:41:09.12,1:41:10.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,有卡车接近 先生
Dialogue: 1,1:41:11.06,1:41:14.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们到了 完全按计划时间
Dialogue: 1,1:41:14.50,1:41:16.90,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,机棚门 把它打开
Dialogue: 1,1:41:17.00,1:41:18.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真准时
Dialogue: 1,1:41:41.46,1:41:42.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊! 你把这新闻给我
Dialogue: 1,1:41:42.96,1:41:45.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我就替你生孩子
Dialogue: 1,1:41:45.46,1:41:48.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想你占便宜
Dialogue: 1,1:41:59.98,1:42:03.38,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上校 容我说 你真是了不起的
Dialogue: 1,1:42:03.48,1:42:04.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 少校
Dialogue: 1,1:42:04.98,1:42:06.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己也不错
Dialogue: 1,1:42:06.99,1:42:08.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你逃了出来 长官
Dialogue: 1,1:42:08.82,1:42:09.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 少校
Dialogue: 1,1:42:09.99,1:42:12.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,也许待留到我们安全后再说
Dialogue: 1,1:42:12.43,1:42:13.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是 长官
Dialogue: 1,1:42:13.99,1:42:15.89,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我要恭喜各位
Dialogue: 1,1:42:16.00,1:42:17.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你们赢得了自己的生活方式
Dialogue: 1,1:42:17.50,1:42:21.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的骄傲 我的钦佩… 和一个绝顶的假期
Dialogue: 1,1:42:21.87,1:42:23.50,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,登机吧!
Dialogue: 1,1:42:52.57,1:42:54.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 牛仔 飞行让你不舒服?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:54.57,1:42:55.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢飞行
Dialogue: 1,1:42:56.07,1:42:57.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那你到这上头来干嘛?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:57.57,1:42:59.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不喜欢输
Dialogue: 1,1:42:59.38,1:43:01.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们走吧
Dialogue: 1,1:43:09.75,1:43:11.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你们怎么想
Dialogue: 1,1:43:11.79,1:43:14.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要在雪地里滚了
Dialogue: 1,1:43:14.96,1:43:16.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,温带是不下雪的 少校
Dialogue: 1,1:43:17.10,1:43:19.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为了你们 我们可以进口雪
Dialogue: 1,1:43:22.84,1:43:24.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的! 他们出机棚了
Dialogue: 1,1:43:27.27,1:43:28.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那边
Dialogue: 1,1:43:28.81,1:43:30.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那边 拍摄那架747
Dialogue: 1,1:43:30.74,1:43:31.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,现在该怎样?
Dialogue: 1,1:43:31.74,1:43:32.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,挡在他们前头
Dialogue: 1,1:43:33.05,1:43:35.14,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,使他们无法起飞
Dialogue: 1,1:43:35.25,1:43:36.74,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不跟那200吨的飞机玩老鹰抓小鸡游戏
Dialogue: 1,1:43:36.85,1:43:38.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我虽疯但还没那么疯呢
Dialogue: 1,1:43:38.22,1:43:39.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧
Dialogue: 1,1:43:39.39,1:43:40.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,达拉斯 我是西北140班机
Dialogue: 1,1:43:41.06,1:43:42.28,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请求跑道降落
Dialogue: 1,1:43:42.39,1:43:43.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是荷莉的飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:43:43.59,1:43:45.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,重覆 要求紧急降落许可!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:46.09,1:43:47.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们不能回答
Dialogue: 1,1:43:47.23,1:43:48.35,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,但是最好听清楚
Dialogue: 1,1:43:48.46,1:43:50.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们油料用光了 必须降落
Dialogue: 1,1:43:50.56,1:43:53.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟 不管怎样 我们一定得进场
Dialogue: 1,1:43:53.40,1:43:54.63,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 那是我老婆的飞机
Dialogue: 1,1:43:54.74,1:43:56.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快降到它前面!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:56.14,1:43:57.57,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,才不要到那架飞机前面!
Dialogue: 1,1:44:02.58,1:44:05.07,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧… 那你能飞到它上头去吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:44:05.18,1:44:06.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们, 我是机长
Dialogue: 1,1:44:06.77,1:44:07.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请各位注意
Dialogue: 1,1:44:07.88,1:44:08.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有选择
Dialogue: 1,1:44:09.09,1:44:11.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,必须尝试紧急迫降
Dialogue: 1,1:44:11.25,1:44:13.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,将你的安全带系好 将身体置于所教的
Dialogue: 1,1:44:14.04,1:44:16.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,假设坠机姿势
Dialogue: 1,1:44:16.43,1:44:18.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们按紧急程序行动
Dialogue: 1,1:44:18.93,1:44:21.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,达拉斯机场附近飞机请注意
Dialogue: 1,1:44:21.47,1:44:22.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这是西北140班机
Dialogue: 1,1:44:22.97,1:44:24.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正准备紧急降落
Dialogue: 1,1:44:24.60,1:44:25.73,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请注意
Dialogue: 1,1:44:28.61,1:44:30.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想死
Dialogue: 1,1:44:30.11,1:44:31.94,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想死 我不想死
Dialogue: 1,1:44:32.04,1:44:33.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把安全带扣好
Dialogue: 1,1:44:33.54,1:44:35.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 真的很抱歉…
Dialogue: 1,1:44:35.55,1:44:36.67,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,请向前倾
Dialogue: 1,1:44:38.14,1:44:39.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊…
Dialogue: 1,1:44:40.29,1:44:42.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哦
Dialogue: 1,1:44:45.12,1:44:47.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 1,1:44:48.56,1:44:52.36,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你的杖、你的竿、都安慰我
Dialogue: 1,1:44:58.54,1:45:00.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下!
Dialogue: 1,1:45:00.24,1:45:02.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要做什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:02.21,1:45:03.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要新闻不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:03.28,1:45:04.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别急慢慢来
Dialogue: 1,1:45:04.38,1:45:05.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把我放下去
Dialogue: 1,1:45:05.58,1:45:07.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,收到
Dialogue: 1,1:45:09.02,1:45:10.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,把我放下去
Dialogue: 1,1:45:11.09,1:45:12.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你会死的!
Dialogue: 1,1:45:12.59,1:45:15.06,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,回里面来!
Dialogue: 1,1:45:21.43,1:45:23.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,飞低一点 保持在机翼上方
Dialogue: 1,1:45:31.04,1:45:33.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再低点
Dialogue: 1,1:45:33.58,1:45:34.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 1,1:45:43.09,1:45:48.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 你他妈到这机翼上来做什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:53.73,1:45:54.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!
Dialogue: 1,1:46:00.77,1:46:02.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 1,1:46:02.48,1:46:03.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,出问题了
Dialogue: 1,1:46:03.94,1:46:06.64,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是副翼
Dialogue: 1,1:46:06.75,1:46:08.81,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没办法起飞了
Dialogue: 1,1:46:11.78,1:46:12.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的
Dialogue: 1,1:46:12.82,1:46:14.58,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,又是麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,1:46:16.32,1:46:17.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,那狗娘养的
Dialogue: 1,1:46:18.66,1:46:21.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我来对付他
Dialogue: 1,1:46:21.60,1:46:22.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,做得彻底一点
Dialogue: 1,1:46:22.96,1:46:24.86,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,将军 你把我们载上天就行了
Dialogue: 1,1:46:24.97,1:46:26.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你是唯一会开飞机的人
Dialogue: 1,1:46:26.63,1:46:28.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪 机翼里满是油料
Dialogue: 1,1:46:54.53,1:46:55.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,呀
Dialogue: 1,1:47:21.06,1:47:23.76,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜 麦克莱 我有点喜欢你呢
Dialogue: 1,1:47:27.83,1:47:28.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,哇
Dialogue: 1,1:47:31.54,1:47:33.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经有够多朋友了
Dialogue: 1,1:47:56.88,1:47:58.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,(油箱盖)
Dialogue: 1,1:48:10.78,1:48:12.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,1:48:12.62,1:48:14.11,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,压轴好戏上演了
Dialogue: 1,1:48:49.99,1:48:51.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,王八蛋
Dialogue: 1,1:49:03.74,1:49:04.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:08.58,1:49:10.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,[法语] 一路顺风!
Dialogue: 1,1:49:16.59,1:49:19.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,落地快乐 混球
Dialogue: 1,1:50:10.04,1:50:12.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 王八蛋
Dialogue: 1,1:50:25.33,1:50:26.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 这回行了
Dialogue: 1,1:51:04.07,1:51:06.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉
Dialogue: 1,1:51:07.07,1:51:09.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是给你点的降落灯
Dialogue: 1,1:51:17.32,1:51:18.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 1,1:51:21.22,1:51:22.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧
Dialogue: 1,1:51:22.79,1:51:23.69,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧
Dialogue: 1,1:51:23.79,1:51:26.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我看见了
Dialogue: 1,1:51:50.95,1:51:52.44,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们利用火光当降落灯
Dialogue: 1,1:51:52.55,1:51:53.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们利用火光当降落灯
Dialogue: 1,1:51:53.99,1:51:55.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可以照做 告诉他们吧
Dialogue: 1,1:51:55.32,1:51:56.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经知道了
Dialogue: 1,1:51:56.82,1:51:58.45,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们看到东北方的降落点了…
Dialogue: 1,1:51:58.56,1:51:59.79,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你听
Dialogue: 1,1:51:59.90,1:52:01.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正以火苗做为导向…
Dialogue: 1,1:52:02.03,1:52:03.26,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,要是他们能 我们也可以
Dialogue: 1,1:52:20.62,1:52:21.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,喔
Dialogue: 1,1:52:22.09,1:52:23.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,可以活着走出去
Dialogue: 1,1:52:23.59,1:52:24.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,就是成功的降落 太棒了
Dialogue: 1,1:52:54.82,1:52:56.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,跳!
Dialogue: 1,1:52:56.62,1:52:58.02,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,跳!
Dialogue: 1,1:52:58.13,1:52:59.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我接着你了
Dialogue: 1,1:52:59.63,1:53:00.68,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,跳!
Dialogue: 1,1:53:29.56,1:53:31.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了 很好
Dialogue: 1,1:53:33.96,1:53:35.09,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 1,1:53:36.21,1:53:38.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉!
Dialogue: 1,1:53:42.77,1:53:45.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉!
Dialogue: 1,1:53:46.35,1:53:48.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉!
Dialogue: 1,1:53:51.12,1:53:52.85,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉!
Dialogue: 1,1:53:56.40,1:53:59.22,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:01.51,1:54:04.80,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:08.64,1:54:12.03,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:14.34,1:54:16.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,荷莉!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:18.95,1:54:21.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,来 我们接住你了
Dialogue: 1,1:54:26.65,1:54:29.59,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 宝贝!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:29.69,1:54:31.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我永远再也见不到你了
Dialogue: 1,1:54:32.09,1:54:34.43,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是这么以为
Dialogue: 1,1:54:34.53,1:54:37.19,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我好爱你呀!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:39.87,1:54:42.77,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说恐怖分子到机场来了
Dialogue: 1,1:54:42.87,1:54:46.10,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我也听说了
Dialogue: 1,1:54:53.88,1:54:55.51,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 太美了!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:55.62,1:54:57.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,是呀!
Dialogue: 1,1:54:58.62,1:55:02.42,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,对 的确是
Dialogue: 1,1:55:02.53,1:55:05.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我太爱你了
Dialogue: 1,1:55:07.63,1:55:09.46,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰…
Dialogue: 1,1:55:09.57,1:55:12.20,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这种事 老发生在我们身上
Dialogue: 1,1:55:17.64,1:55:20.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回家吧
Dialogue: 1,1:55:20.41,1:55:22.61,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,上车吧
Dialogue: 1,1:55:22.72,1:55:24.55,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我们带她离开吧
Dialogue: 1,1:55:24.65,1:55:27.21,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来帮我 拜托
Dialogue: 1,1:55:27.32,1:55:29.18,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心 扶我起来 拜托
Dialogue: 1,1:55:29.29,1:55:30.78,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋!
Dialogue: 1,1:55:33.75,1:55:36.12,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,警官! 来吧 来吧
Dialogue: 1,1:55:36.60,1:55:38.00,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:55:38.10,1:55:41.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,快上来 尊夫人也上来
Dialogue: 1,1:55:41.40,1:55:42.97,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么办呀? 马文
Dialogue: 1,1:55:43.07,1:55:46.84,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会去清理这一团乱呢!
Dialogue: 1,1:55:53.80,1:55:55.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱
Dialogue: 1,1:55:56.86,1:55:59.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,你在机场前收到这张罚单的?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:01.01,1:56:02.47,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 1,1:56:02.93,1:56:07.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,管他呢! 是圣诞节
Dialogue: 1,1:56:10.11,1:56:12.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:12.50,1:56:13.65,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 马文!
Dialogue: 1,1:56:13.88,1:56:17.60,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:17.71,1:56:21.30,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:21.40,1:56:24.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:25.82,1:56:29.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:29.42,1:56:33.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:33.19,1:56:36.75,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:36.86,1:56:40.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:40.60,1:56:44.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:44.44,1:56:48.13,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:48.24,1:56:52.37,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:52.48,1:56:56.04,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:56.15,1:56:59.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:56:59.62,1:57:03.25,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:03.36,1:57:07.05,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:07.16,1:57:10.72,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:10.83,1:57:14.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:14.64,1:57:18.27,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:18.37,1:57:22.54,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:22.64,1:57:26.41,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:26.52,1:57:29.71,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:29.82,1:57:33.48,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:33.59,1:57:37.29,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:37.39,1:57:41.39,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:41.50,1:57:44.87,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:44.97,1:57:48.70,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:48.81,1:57:52.33,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:52.44,1:57:56.01,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:57:56.11,1:57:59.95,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:00.05,1:58:03.49,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:03.59,1:58:07.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:08.06,1:58:11.52,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:11.63,1:58:14.96,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:15.07,1:58:18.83,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:18.94,1:58:22.53,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:22.64,1:58:26.31,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:26.41,1:58:30.15,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:30.25,1:58:33.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:34.02,1:58:38.32,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:38.43,1:58:41.92,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:42.03,1:58:45.40,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:45.50,1:58:48.99,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:49.10,1:58:52.91,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:53.01,1:58:54.98,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:55.08,1:58:56.88,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,1:58:56.98,1:59:03.08,CHS,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:10.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:20.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:39.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Whoa! Yo! False alarm! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:40.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's O.K.! I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we are! It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:45.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Set it down nice and easy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:46.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sure, at the impound.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:47.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, read the sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I'm just here to meet my wife's plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:52.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got to let me have this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:53.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sure, tomorrow, 8:00 to 4:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:55.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You pay 40 bucks, we give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:57.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't write it up. Don't write it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.11,0:00:59.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, man. This is my mother-in-law's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:01.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,She's already mad at me 'cause I'm not a dentist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:04.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I'm a cop...  L.A.P.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:06.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I was in L.A. once. Hated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:07.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:09.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like it much myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.47,0:01:11.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a plastic fender up there! Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:14.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut me some slack, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:15.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I used to be a cop in New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:18.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I only moved to L.A. because my wife took a job there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.34,0:01:19.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:22.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,New York , Washington, D.C., the heart of democracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:24.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One hand washes the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:26.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, man. It's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:28.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So ask Santa Claus to give you another car.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:30.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Merry Christmas, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all yours, Murray.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:39.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:17.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know that, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are the telephones?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:24.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:25.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.82,0:02:29.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Leonard Adkins is in a warmer clime with a story that grows hotter by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:32.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Security was tight today at Escalan Airport
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:33.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in the Republic of Valverde
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:35.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,where government authorities report
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:37.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that deposed General Ramon Esperanza
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:41.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,will be delivered for immediate extradition to the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.07,0:02:43.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Only two years ago, General Esperanza
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:44.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,led his country's army
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:46.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in a campaign against Communist insurgents,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:49.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,a campaign fought with American money and advisers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:54.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Esperanza's fall from power caused ripples not only in his country's recent election,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but closer to home, as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.75,0:02:59.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,when high-ranking Pentagon officials were charged...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:02.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,with supplying him with weapons despite the Congressional ban.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:05.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But mounting evidence that Esperanza's forces
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:07.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,violated the neutrality of neighboring countries
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,made Congress withhold funds,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:12.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,funds which Esperanza is accused of replacing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:15.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,by going into the lucrative business of cocaine smuggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:19.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Although Esperanza was removed as Commander In Chief earlier this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.23,0:03:22.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the agreement to extradite him was only reached yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:24.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and Washington insiders say
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:26.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,it was a phone call that made it happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:28.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,a phone call from a...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:34.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If I could find a phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.39,0:03:41.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd call you, whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:13.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:15.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:26.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, this is Lieutenant McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:27.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody there just beep me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:28.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to think I'm somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:30.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Honey, what are you doing? where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:32.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you land yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the nineties, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:38.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Microchips, microwaves, faxes, air phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.35,0:04:41.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,As far as I'm concerned...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:43.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,progress peaked with frozen pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:46.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, we're gonna be about half an hour late landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:49.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:50.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The kids OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:54.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're about to lose their minds from all the sugar your parents are giving them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:57.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did Mom give you a hard time about borrowing her car?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:05:00.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:04.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, honey, when you land, can we just rent a car...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,check into a hotel, leave the kids with your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:12.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Order some room service, a bottle of champagne? What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:15.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're on, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:18.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you in half an hour, honey. I love you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:25.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't technology wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:30.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- My husband doesn't think so. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:34.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I used to carry around those awful Mace things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:41.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I zap any bastard that screws with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:45.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried it on my little dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:49.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Poor thing limped for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:58.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You look really familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:04.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I get that a lot. I've been on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:06.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Grab the tools. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:37.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Amy Nichole, live from Escalan airport,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:42.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,where deposed general, Ramon Esperanza, has just arrived under heavy guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:45.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The deposed dictator's mood seems jubilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:49.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He is smiling and waving to the crowd, like a man running for political office.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:55.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,...thousands of political prisoners, including the new president.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:07:01.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no doubt he still has some ardent supporters, both here and abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Rumours abound on Capitol Hill that there were...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:09.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Yeah? - Sorry to bother you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:10.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we're checking our equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:14.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Any problems with the conduit line? - I don't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:17.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Would you mind if we take a look? - Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:32.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It don't seem right somehow, closing down this church.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The parish is gonna keep on using it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.67,0:07:36.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but it won't be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Been here a lot of years, and I've been right here with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:42.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I kind of feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:44.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,a piece of me is dying along with this church.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:46.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:55.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,...cocaine smuggling and bribing government officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:07:58.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He certainly doesn't show it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:08:00.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but no matter how high his spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:02.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,they can't hide the fact that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:03.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that America's war on drugs
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:06.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,has finally taken its first prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Buckwheat. The clubhouse is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:17.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here at Dulles, the men from the Justice Department
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:22.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,wait to handcuff the man who symbolises the enemy in America's fight against cocaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:25.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That battle may be almost won, but the war is still in doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:29.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Samantha Coleman, WNTW, for Night-Time News.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger that, Colonel. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:48.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That was the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:52.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's in position. How's the weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:55.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We got flurries all along the Virginia coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:58.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,New storm front coming in from the northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:02.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- God loves the infantry. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:05.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Carry out your assignments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:11.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- 15.51. Mark. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:13.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:15.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Adios.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:39.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's cold out there, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:41.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I stomped my feet for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.87,0:09:53.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Two cappuccinos. Make it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:14.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Scotch straight up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:16.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.55,0:10:17.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This may sound like a wild-goose chase,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:19.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but I think I saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Saw what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:26.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Elvis. Elvis Presley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fucking tourists. Ought to be a law.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:34.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me. There's a large number of you from the justice department here this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:38.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Is there any particular reason for that? - Just routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:38.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just routine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:41.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Any comment, sir? - Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, sir. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:51.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Colonel Stuart over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Got a little problem with personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Last-minute replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:11:00.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- How's the security here? - Like we figured... ajoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Colonel Stuart, could we have a few words?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:05.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can have two: "fuck" and "you".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.30,0:11:07.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No pictures, you pinko bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:10.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Old news.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:26.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.28,0:11:29.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:57.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- What is it? - You got a key for this door?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:58.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:01.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Because I want you to open it up, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:07.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Is there a cop on duty around here? - The airport police.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:09.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:37.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hand me the wrench.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:41.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Going to work overtime. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.27,0:12:44.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K., hold that end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.35,0:12:46.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:49.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:52.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:12:57.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! It's a restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:13:00.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter? Couldn't wait for a skycap?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:01.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:03.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see some ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:06.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:48.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:49.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:38.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a tag team?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:15.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- He came in here and flashed a badge? - Yeah. He said to bring you guys back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:45.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.58,0:16:03.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice guess, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a cop. That was the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:13.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your ID?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:20.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,On its way to Cleveland?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:27.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You did not explain anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:30.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You just shoved me back here into this cattle car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.77,0:16:34.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Sir, you were told we were overbooked. - Fine. I accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:38.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But why can't I get the first-class meal my network paid for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:41.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Do you know who I am? - Yes. We've seen your programme.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:45.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your episode "Flying Junkyards" was an objective look at air-traffic safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:49.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't nearly as edifying as "Bimbos of the Sky", was it, Connie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You think you're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.16,0:16:56.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. I've got your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:59.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And I've got yours. So park it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:02.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:15.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Stewardess. - Mr Thornberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.81,0:17:17.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You cannot monopolise my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:20.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- You cannot put me near that woman. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:26.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He means he's filed a restraining order against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:28.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not allowed within 50 feet of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:34.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,50 yards. So by keeping me in this section, you are violating a court order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:37.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can sue you and this airline.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:42.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That woman assaulted me, and she humiliated me in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:51.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:54.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Knocked out two of his teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like some champagne?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.15,0:18:04.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Officer McClane. I had to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:06.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's your piece and shield back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:09.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:11.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here, Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.23,0:18:13.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We understand that there was a shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.81,0:18:16.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The presence of Justice Department officials...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:18.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus! Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:19.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come on. Just a word, O.K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:23.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck are you people... What are you doing here, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a crime scene. You gotta seal this area off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:30.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- That's up to the captain. - Maybe you better take me up to the captain, then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:42.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Cochrane?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.54,0:18:43.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:54.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:58.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We ran into trouble, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:01.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Some cop... killed Cochrane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:03.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I barely got away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:05.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you accomplish your mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.97,0:19:09.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir, but... Cochrane, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.47,0:19:11.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, then the damage is minimal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:13.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The penalty could be severe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:23.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You fail me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:25.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and the chamber won't be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:27.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.63,0:19:33.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss. Miss. I can't find my dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:36.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss. My dog. One minute, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to fill out this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:46.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it? Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.77,0:19:48.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Captain Lorenzo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:49.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:51.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm John McClane...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:52.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah. I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the asshole that just broke seven FAA
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.60,0:19:59.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and five District of Columbia regulations running around my airport
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:20:01.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,with a gun, shooting at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.35,0:20:03.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you call that shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:04.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Self...defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:07.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, what, you think that L.A. badge is going to get you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:09.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,a free lunch or something around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.53,0:20:13.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... maybe a little professional courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:15.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh! In an airport on Christmas week?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.59,0:20:16.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:17.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K. Fuck courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:19.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How about just being professional?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.95,0:20:22.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your boys just walked away from a crime scene, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:24.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't wrap this thing up in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:27.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got to seal the area off, dust for prints...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:29.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't lecture me, hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:32.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know what I'm doing. We're going to dust it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:36.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll take all the pictures. We'll sweep for fibers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:38.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When will you do this? After 400 people go through?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.97,0:20:40.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd be lucky to get a print from one of your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:44.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Shut down that area... - Oh, shut the area down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.14,0:20:46.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's that simple, huh? Just shut the area down?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:50.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit,Yeah, and I got everybody from the Shriners' convention
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:52.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to the goddamn Boy Scouts in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got lost kids, lost dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.95,0:20:56.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not now! Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:20:58.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got international diplomats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.55,0:21:02.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got a fucking reindeer flying in here from the fucking petting zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:06.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But John McClane, he's got a little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:08.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's shut down the whole fucking airport!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.73,0:21:11.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think they'll say upstairs when I tell them that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:12.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Phone and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:18.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't need fucking forensics to tell me this was some punk stealing luggage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:21.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Luggage? That punk pulled a Glock 7 on me. You know ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:23.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a porcelain gun made in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:25.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't show up on airport x-ray machines
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:27.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and costs more than you make in a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:29.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd be surprised what I make in a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:31.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's more than $1.98...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.05,0:21:35.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, McClane, don't start believing your own press, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:38.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know all about you and that Nakatomi thing in LA.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.83,0:21:42.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But just cos the TV thinks you're hot shit, that don't make it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:45.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, you are in my little pond now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:48.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I am the big fish that runs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:51.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So you capped some lowlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:52.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:56.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll send your fucking captain in LA a fucking commendation!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.73,0:21:58.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, get the hell out of my office
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.95,0:22:01.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,before I have you thrown out of my goddamn airport!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:14.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Carmine, let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:17.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What sets off the metal detectors first?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.43,0:22:20.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The lead in your ass or the shit in your brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.07,0:22:21.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fat fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:32.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Any ID on this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:34.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's somebody else's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.95,0:22:40.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your car's ready. Sign right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:44.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to borrow this and this. I'll bring it right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.06,0:22:45.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:47.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Yo! Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:49.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:53.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold up, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:54.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold up. We got to check something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.93,0:22:57.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- What are you doing? - Pretty gruesome fucking job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:23:02.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All the confusion in there, forgot to get this clown's prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.18,0:23:07.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ew! Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.75,0:23:09.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're supposed to do that at the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.61,0:23:13.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not anymore. Got a new SOP for DOAs from the FAA.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.10,0:23:19.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think this one's going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:20.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:31.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.04,0:23:36.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.71,0:23:39.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.60,0:23:40.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:43.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.91,0:24:00.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:05.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:07.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.91,0:24:11.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.15,0:24:15.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.85,0:24:18.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.63,0:24:25.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.03,0:25:15.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Powell here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.25,0:25:16.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take that Twinkie out of your mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.80,0:25:18.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and grab a pencil, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.27,0:25:20.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ha ha! Hey,John, how are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.68,0:25:24.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly stood me up a day, and I'm here alone in D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.23,0:25:26.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,with my in-laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.25,0:25:27.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, the old in-laws, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.85,0:25:30.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They do love their policemen son-in-laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.80,0:25:31.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, Al,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.55,0:25:34.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,what is the fax machine telephone number there at the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.37,0:25:36.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:41.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,555-3212.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.56,0:25:44.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,3212. Hold on a second, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.27,0:25:46.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to send you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.22,0:25:47.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.22,0:25:50.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You and faxes? This is a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.35,0:25:51.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well, Holly told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.77,0:25:53.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I should wake up and smell the nineties.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.87,0:25:54.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This way?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.86,0:25:56.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No. That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.59,0:25:57.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait. It's upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.98,0:25:59.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.10,0:26:00.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K. Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.36,0:26:05.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sending you something right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.39,0:26:07.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a second, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.48,0:26:23.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fingerprints?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.58,0:26:25.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got an unidentified stiff here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.55,0:26:27.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've circled the whirls in pen
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.43,0:26:29.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in case the transmission's a little fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.05,0:26:31.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, run it through state and federal, and if you can, run it through Interpol.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.97,0:26:34.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Will do. Well, what's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.42,0:26:36.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,just a feeling I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.16,0:26:38.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch. When you get those feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.42,0:26:40.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,insurance companies start to go bankrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.50,0:26:43.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, the, uh, fax number is...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.16,0:26:45.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is on the top edge of the transmission...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.13,0:26:47.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is on the top edge of the transmission you just got.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, an airport, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.47,0:26:55.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, you're not pissing in somebody's pool, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.64,0:26:58.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ha ha. Yeah. And I'm fresh out of chlorine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.05,0:27:07.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just as this storm starts breaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.52,0:27:10.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the satellite will feed up and drop the other shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.56,0:27:12.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this new front moving in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.73,0:27:15.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Makes its baby brother look like chicken shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.62,0:27:19.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can sand down all the runways
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.23,0:27:21.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and keep the plows going between landings,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.05,0:27:23.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but you got to downshift them up there, give me time to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.70,0:27:24.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.60,0:27:27.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.78,0:27:30.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's call all our birds and slow them down
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:32.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,before we get a parking lot over our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.39,0:27:34.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The line starts at the Mississippi,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.12,0:27:36.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and they better start taking numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.60,0:27:48.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I get you another?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.64,0:27:53.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.16,0:27:54.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I only have to look at his face
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.22,0:27:56.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,for another 15 or 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.40,0:27:59.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen, this is the captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.95,0:28:02.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've just been informed by Dulles Traffic Control
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.73,0:28:05.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that there's a weather front moving in ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.48,0:28:08.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We may be up here a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.46,0:28:09.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.15,0:28:11.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,On second thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.14,0:28:20.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.06,0:28:21.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I'm right here, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.00,0:28:25.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your stiff's dossier is coming through right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.67,0:28:28.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What can you tell me about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.74,0:28:29.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.98,0:28:31.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You needed a computer to figure that one out?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.93,0:28:33.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no. You don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.08,0:28:35.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,According to the Department of Defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.04,0:28:38.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,he's been dead for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.88,0:28:39.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.93,0:28:42.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Sergeant Oswald Cochrane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.31,0:28:44.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,American adviser in Honduras.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.88,0:28:47.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Killed in a helicopter accident 5...11...88.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.92,0:28:48.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.23,0:28:54.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Read between the lines, and I'd say it looks like a lot of black...bag stuff to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.27,0:28:55.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.48,0:28:56.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, Al. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.09,0:28:58.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.78,0:28:59.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.34,0:29:03.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Say, I close in about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.67,0:29:05.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe we can go get a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.60,0:29:09.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just the fax, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.61,0:29:11.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just the fax.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.98,0:29:17.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait a second. Wait. I see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.61,0:29:19.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.24,0:29:27.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Ghost of Christmas Past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.18,0:29:29.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nakatomi? L.A.? You're John McClane, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.79,0:29:30.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.67,0:29:32.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sam Coleman. WNTW news.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.78,0:29:34.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.82,0:29:37.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a break. I saw the stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.21,0:29:39.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Word is that was your handiwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.02,0:29:42.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No. I only do needlepoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.16,0:29:49.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Great. National just shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.90,0:29:51.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Totally iced.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.53,0:29:52.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going to be sending us their planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.86,0:29:54.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Happy, happy holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.24,0:29:56.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The worst part, Mr. Trudeau, was the press.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.55,0:29:59.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, they were here anyways, crawling all over the Esperanza story,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.66,0:30:01.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so they got it right on the fucking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.30,0:30:02.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, bloodstains and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.87,0:30:05.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Personally, I'd like to lock every damn reporter
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.27,0:30:07.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,out of the airport, but then they'd just pull
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.24,0:30:09.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that freedom...of...speech crap on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.18,0:30:11.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then the ACLU would be all over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.51,0:30:13.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Murder on television.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.12,0:30:15.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hell of a start for Christmas weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.44,0:30:18.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it? A gang thing like last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.98,0:30:21.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Only if your gangs get their training at Fort Bragg.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.22,0:30:24.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.21,0:30:25.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh...uh, McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.25,0:30:26.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.27,0:30:27.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In an unauthorized area.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.82,0:30:30.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,L.A., Mr. Trudeau, don't mean shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.37,0:30:33.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I said about my last cholesterol test.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.00,0:30:36.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So what's your problem, Lieutenant McClane?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:40.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Captain Lorenzo has explained to you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.40,0:30:43.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the minor little fracas with the minor little thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.35,0:30:45.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he can explain this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.74,0:30:47.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.34,0:30:49.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.02,0:31:05.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All systems tapped, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.00,0:31:07.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fire it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.77,0:31:23.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,," H" minus five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.96,0:31:25.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.78,0:31:29.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. We've got a body in the morgue
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.16,0:31:30.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that seems to have died twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.92,0:31:32.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Assuming it's not a computer error,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.68,0:31:33.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,what do we assume?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.61,0:31:35.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That somebody's about to seriously fuck with this airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.99,0:31:37.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.86,0:31:39.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, I know we're dummies up here, McClane,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.83,0:31:42.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so give us a taste of your genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.14,0:31:43.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This a hijacking? A robbery? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.96,0:31:45.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.18,0:31:47.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, he's not sure. Well, I'm stunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.00,0:31:49.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got to lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.22,0:31:51.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The only people that go to this much trouble are professionals...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:53.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,not luggage thieves and not punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.25,0:31:54.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Professional at what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.45,0:31:56.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck do you think this is, huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.56,0:31:57.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the safety patrol here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.95,0:32:00.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the resume of a professional mercenary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.41,0:32:02.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got the world's biggest drug dealer on his way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.52,0:32:04.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You need a slide rule to figure this out,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.09,0:32:06.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,or maybe another body in a zipper bag before you start asking questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.90,0:32:09.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one that gave us that fucking body.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.20,0:32:10.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.60,0:32:11.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.85,0:32:22.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lorenzo, have all your shift commanders report in. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.69,0:32:24.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What? You're not buying into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.47,0:32:26.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want them to report anything out of the ordinary,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.62,0:32:28.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,no matter how trivial. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.28,0:32:29.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.56,0:32:30.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.87,0:32:31.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.00,0:32:33.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The runways.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.62,0:32:34.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.71,0:32:36.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.83,0:32:38.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.88,0:32:45.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to emergency lighting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.63,0:32:49.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Emergency. We are in a code yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.61,0:32:51.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Backup systems won't come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.30,0:32:52.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shunt to another terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.31,0:32:53.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bobby, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:56.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing. The whole network is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.17,0:32:58.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe we should call the power company, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.04,0:32:59.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're on the same goddamn grid. We're hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.92,0:33:01.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dulles, what's going on? I'm on approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.66,0:33:03.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maintain position. Repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.60,0:33:05.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.24,0:33:06.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger. We're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.71,0:33:08.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're unable right now. Please delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.15,0:33:10.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuji 604. Execute published missed...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.83,0:33:12.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,approach procedure and hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.68,0:33:15.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,TWA 23, unable to clear you for approach at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.79,0:33:18.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Climb to and maintain one zero thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.18,0:33:20.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've checked all systems. It ain't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.05,0:33:37.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.81,0:33:39.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Approach control... it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.40,0:33:42.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus. Instrument landing system is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:45.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Confirmed. ILS is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.05,0:33:48.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Every goddamn system's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.59,0:33:50.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And Inmac monitors are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.33,0:33:57.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention all controllers. Attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.46,0:33:59.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have a code...red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.63,0:34:02.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Every aircraft approaching our sector
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.10,0:34:04.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,who are not already in our landing pattern
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.25,0:34:06.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,gets diverted to their alternate airport now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.93,0:34:09.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone already on approach
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:11.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,or inside our pattern
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.40,0:34:13.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,holds at the outer markers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.82,0:34:16.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stack 'em, pack 'em, and rack 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.29,0:34:17.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.45,0:34:19.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get someone on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.88,0:34:25.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Not a word of this leaves this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.67,0:34:28.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There must be 15,000 people in this airport,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.24,0:34:30.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and we don't need panic on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.84,0:34:33.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We just bought ourselves maybe two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.51,0:34:35.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,After that, those planes low on fuel
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.45,0:34:36.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,aren't going to be circling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.02,0:34:39.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going to be dropping on the White House lawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.65,0:34:44.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane, this what you expected?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.49,0:34:47.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.49,0:34:50.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.40,0:34:56.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,FAA hot line.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.46,0:34:58.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How could they know already?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.14,0:34:59.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.95,0:35:03.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's the boys that pulled all your plugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.57,0:35:05.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put it on speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.29,0:35:09.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention, Dulles Tower. Attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.32,0:35:13.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They say that blind men become very attentive by way of compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.27,0:35:15.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you're both blind and deaf,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.18,0:35:17.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I've got your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.29,0:35:19.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm aware your recorders are active,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.02,0:35:21.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so I'll be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.55,0:35:23.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can play me back later to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.86,0:35:26.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How did you get on this line? Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.93,0:35:29.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who I am is unimportant.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.16,0:35:30.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.39,0:35:34.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if you don't want those planes to start splashing into the Potomac
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.55,0:35:35.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,as they run out of fuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.65,0:35:37.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,what I want is very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.94,0:35:41.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aplane will be landing at this airport in 58 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.58,0:35:44.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It is FM...1, Foreign Military One.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.42,0:35:47.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, I'm sure you gentlemen are well aware of the unique nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.56,0:35:48.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Esperanza?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.89,0:35:51.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,of this flight, the importance of its cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.25,0:35:54.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This plane will not be met by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.24,0:35:57.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It will land on a runway of my designation,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.84,0:36:00.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,where it will remain isolated and unapproached.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.40,0:36:03.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That will conclude my interest in this aircraft
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.40,0:36:05.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and your responsibility for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.81,0:36:07.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,At the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.37,0:36:11.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want a 747 cargo conversion fully fueled
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.58,0:36:13.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and placed at my disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.08,0:36:17.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You have two more minutes to advise your inbound aircraft
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.11,0:36:18.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to hold at their outer radio marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.84,0:36:21.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,After that,you will be able to receive only.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.12,0:36:24.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Any attempt to restore your systems
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.44,0:36:26.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,will be met by severe penalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.82,0:36:28.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.68,0:36:30.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it, you can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.05,0:36:32.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I am doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.38,0:36:41.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K., you guys, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.94,0:36:43.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I need you to punch up a code 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.32,0:36:45.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got an idea, and I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.82,0:36:47.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If Esperanza gets on that plane
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.12,0:36:49.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and makes it to a country with no extradition treaties,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.43,0:36:50.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.32,0:36:51.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're talking to us on our own system.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.10,0:36:53.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They got to be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.09,0:36:55.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have my men tear this airport apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.43,0:36:56.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just in the nick of time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:36:58.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, McClane, I got a first...class unit here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.00,0:37:00.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,S.W.A.T. team and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.15,0:37:02.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't need any Monday...morning quarterbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.51,0:37:05.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My wife's on one of the goddamn planes these guys are fucking with.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.47,0:37:07.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That puts me on the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.27,0:37:09.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd have moved your fat ass when I told you to,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.12,0:37:10.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we wouldn't be hip deep in shit right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.05,0:37:12.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it. Security. You're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.78,0:37:14.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Trudeau, do I have to remind you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.74,0:37:16.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,about FAA regulations
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.29,0:37:17.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,regarding unauthorized personnel
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.61,0:37:18.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in the control tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.74,0:37:20.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All we have to do is find a way to transmit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.92,0:37:23.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, right. Somebody want to run down to Radio Shack and get a transmitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.93,0:37:24.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We already have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.88,0:37:26.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The new terminal wing they're building...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.23,0:37:29.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,20 airlines when it's done, all with their own reservation computers,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.45,0:37:32.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,all tied in to a nice big antenna arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.35,0:37:34.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better see Mr. McClane out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.10,0:37:35.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got no business being up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.65,0:37:37.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm telling you guys. Everything we need is over
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.57,0:37:39.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,by the Annex Skywalk just sitting there,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.30,0:37:40.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,waiting to go on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Annex Skywalk?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.26,0:37:43.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're dealing with pros here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.06,0:37:46.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't fuck with these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.15,0:37:47.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sam Coleman. WNTW news.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.15,0:37:50.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Trudeau, there are a lot of rumors flying around here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.08,0:37:51.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No way. No way, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.63,0:37:52.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hell, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.64,0:37:54.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is off limits, Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.95,0:37:56.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.51,0:37:59.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Anything you can think of, they'll think of, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.56,0:38:00.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get your fucking hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.94,0:38:03.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,For shit's sake. Just get them both out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.31,0:38:06.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lobby Security, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.69,0:38:07.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomalson here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.90,0:38:09.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Captain Lorenzo here
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.06,0:38:11.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,with two unauthorized personnel in the fucking tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.51,0:38:13.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, would you get your thumb out of your ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.35,0:38:14.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,get them out of the elevator,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.38,0:38:17.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,or you're going to find a goddamn pink slip in your Christmas stocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.21,0:38:19.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,10...4. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.05,0:38:21.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.55,0:38:23.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Anything who can think of?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.75,0:38:24.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't fuck with what guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.81,0:38:26.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit. Hang on over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.76,0:38:28.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.86,0:38:31.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Big drug dealer on his way to prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.86,0:38:33.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,gunfight at airport,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.35,0:38:36.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,every controller in the coffee shop getting beeped and hauling ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.05,0:38:37.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and you rocking the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.50,0:38:38.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Connection? Come on, McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.06,0:38:40.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.25,0:38:42.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K.,just a few words. Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.56,0:38:45.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, but I already got that from Colonel Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.71,0:38:48.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.50,0:38:50.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The guy that got canned by Congress. That's who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.98,0:38:53.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Who he who? What? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.20,0:38:55.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shh! It's O.K. I've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.47,0:39:08.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.90,0:39:10.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.22,0:39:11.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Claustrophobic, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.00,0:39:16.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a VHF system, but the planes are so close
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.51,0:39:17.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.45,0:39:19.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can rig our frequency in 30 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.37,0:39:21.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,wire in a crossover, and we're hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.52,0:39:23.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the planes wouldn't know the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.15,0:39:25.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get what you need. Borrow. Steal. Kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.52,0:39:27.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want my S.W.A.T. team to go with him as cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.77,0:39:30.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever we can think of, they can think of, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.40,0:39:38.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, man. I can't fucking believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.95,0:39:41.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Another basement. Another elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.81,0:39:44.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How can the same shit happen to the same guy twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.97,0:40:44.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.26,0:40:47.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Marvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.89,0:40:50.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Marvin. I'm Marvin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.08,0:40:51.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you was trying...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.21,0:40:53.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to steal my records, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.40,0:40:55.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just the janitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.22,0:41:04.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Dulles Approach to all aircraft
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.53,0:41:06.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,holding at Potomac Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.40,0:41:08.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We are experiencing some technical problems here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.01,0:41:11.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Weather conditions, which have been deteriorating all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.77,0:41:16.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,have now been complicated by an unforeseen human factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.86,0:41:19.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This has affected all of our electronic equipment
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.51,0:41:21.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and their redundant backups, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.38,0:41:25.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,As a result, our Nav and approach systems are down,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.66,0:41:28.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and we expect to lose voice in another minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.59,0:41:29.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We want you to continue...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.09,0:41:32.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,holding at the outer marker as directed
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.38,0:41:34.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and wait for further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.89,0:41:36.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,As soon as we're back on line,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.91,0:41:40.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we'll expedite your landings on a fuel...emergency basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.53,0:41:42.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.24,0:41:46.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,God bless.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.44,0:41:54.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. Change the boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.80,0:41:58.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.40,0:42:00.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.28,0:42:23.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.05,0:42:25.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Skywalk Annex.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.65,0:42:27.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, Goddamn it. The Annex Skywalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.40,0:42:30.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the last thing I heard before they kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.79,0:42:32.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let me see here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.91,0:42:34.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, this must be it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.59,0:42:37.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,See? That's the raised platform,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.63,0:42:39.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and there's the new terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.21,0:42:41.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's your Skywalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.33,0:42:43.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Goddamn bottleneck.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.15,0:42:45.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice place for an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.31,0:42:47.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the fastest way
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.68,0:42:49.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,you can get me out to that spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.95,0:42:54.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This kind of thing wasn't in my job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.89,0:42:57.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, Mr. Barnes. We'll watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.55,0:42:59.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah? Who watches yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.57,0:43:12.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Main ventilation duct.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.75,0:43:14.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Main ventilation duct.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.57,0:43:17.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.24,0:43:19.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just once, I'd like a regular,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.93,0:43:21.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,normal Christmas...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.70,0:43:27.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eggnog, a fucking Christmas tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.53,0:43:30.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,a little turkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.87,0:43:34.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But, no, I got to crawl around
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.27,0:43:36.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in this motherfucking tin can.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.00,0:43:42.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're in the Annex Skywalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.60,0:43:43.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can see the array.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.01,0:43:47.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give you a call for a protocol test as soon as it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.19,0:43:48.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's all for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.31,0:43:50.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sergeant, we need some more equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.07,0:43:52.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to send one of your guys back for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.86,0:43:54.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, sir. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.08,0:43:59.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.68,0:44:01.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Put that back on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.89,0:44:06.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, asshole, what do I look like to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.10,0:44:09.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A sitting duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.56,0:44:11.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.30,0:44:14.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.57,0:44:19.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it. I hate it when I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.30,0:44:26.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.89,0:46:07.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.50,0:46:22.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.86,0:46:33.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.18,0:46:56.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fucking son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.44,0:47:27.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to kick your fucking ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.00,0:48:02.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.74,0:48:03.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.03,0:48:06.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Yeah. But the antenna array...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.22,0:48:08.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got to get to it and set it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.33,0:48:14.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.85,0:48:34.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Goddamn.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.50,0:48:38.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.15,0:48:42.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jerk us off,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.81,0:48:46.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,make Lorenzo sacrifice his best men.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.06,0:48:51.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Make you waste your time...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.20,0:48:57.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,time we don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.56,0:49:14.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you're closer than 50 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.27,0:49:17.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So's that airplane. Practically.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.65,0:49:20.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. There's quite a few of them out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.33,0:49:21.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like a regular traffic jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.03,0:49:23.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing regular about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.87,0:49:26.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,See? You're intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.00,0:49:28.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my gift, Mrs. McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.45,0:49:29.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I notice things...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.06,0:49:31.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,things other people wouldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.63,0:49:34.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's how I make people curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.74,0:49:36.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you mean nauseous?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.20,0:49:39.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look. The people have a right to know
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.02,0:49:40.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,everything about everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.09,0:49:43.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got in the way of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.15,0:49:45.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, buster, you endangered my children,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.65,0:49:48.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and you didn't do it for anything as noble as the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.26,0:49:51.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The only time you even see the people is when you look down
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.73,0:49:53.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to see what it is you're stepping on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.45,0:50:00.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Me? Yeah, I'll live,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.71,0:50:03.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but Lorenzo's S.W.A.T. team is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.10,0:50:05.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and the antenna array is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.86,0:50:07.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.09,0:50:11.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard looking for a new miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.58,0:50:13.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just hold for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.08,0:50:15.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.40,0:50:16.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just hold for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.76,0:50:18.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Something's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.44,0:50:20.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Just hold on for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.05,0:50:23.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I say again, Annex Team, give us a sit rep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.44,0:50:27.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Annex Team, come in. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.48,0:50:31.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's got some kind of scrambler on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.71,0:50:33.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you do anything with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.70,0:50:36.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No. This scramble mode
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.85,0:50:38.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,must activate on this code panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.62,0:50:40.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we scan their frequency,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.29,0:50:41.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we can't listen in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.74,0:50:42.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These guys are pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.95,0:50:44.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So are you. Break the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.19,0:50:46.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hear what these bastards are saying to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.06,0:50:47.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a 10...digit control panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.95,0:50:49.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Six...digit read...out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.45,0:50:51.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hell, there could be a million combinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.99,0:50:54.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Next time you kill one of these guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.24,0:50:56.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,get him to enter the code first.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.30,0:50:57.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.73,0:51:01.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir, we just monitored a call from their chief engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.96,0:51:04.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Our people took out their S.W.A.T. team completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.20,0:51:06.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You were right. They went for the antenna array.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.52,0:51:07.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:09.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Losing our own team wasn't part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.50,0:51:18.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention, Dulles Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.35,0:51:20.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention, Dulles Control Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.38,0:51:22.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Trudeau, I know you're listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.76,0:51:24.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately, you're not obeying.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.81,0:51:26.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Try me face to face, and we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.57,0:51:28.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You were warned not to try to restore your systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.90,0:51:30.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You've wasted lives and precious time
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.73,0:51:32.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,on a futile and obvious target.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.17,0:51:35.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you're going to pay the penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.33,0:51:37.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got five dead officers down here, Colonel Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.88,0:51:39.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that penalty enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.75,0:51:41.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane, you keep out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.25,0:51:42.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You've been nothing but a pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.91,0:51:48.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, McClane. John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.20,0:51:52.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The policeman hero who saved the Nakatomi hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.31,0:51:55.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I read about you in People magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.53,0:51:58.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You seemed out of your league on Nightline, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.10,0:51:59.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Colonel, blow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.79,0:52:02.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How much drug money is Esperanza paying you to turn traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.94,0:52:08.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Cardinal Richelieu said it best. Treason is merely a matter of dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.37,0:52:09.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This country's got to learn
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.91,0:52:11.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,that it can't keep cutting the legs off
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.25,0:52:13.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,of men like General Esperanza,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.28,0:52:15.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,men who have the guts to stand up
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.43,0:52:17.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,against Communist aggression.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.25,0:52:20.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And lesson one starts with killing policemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.76,0:52:23.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's lesson two... the neutron bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.93,0:52:27.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No. I think we can find something in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.26,0:52:31.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.80,0:52:35.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a flight number, one that's low on fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.93,0:52:39.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Windsor 114. Transatlantic from London.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.30,0:52:41.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuel tank's dry as a martini.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.37,0:52:44.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Activate the I LS landing system,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.40,0:52:46.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but recalibrate sea level
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.30,0:52:49.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,minus 200 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.93,0:53:00.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.77,0:53:15.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.48,0:53:18.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They've reset ground level minus 200 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.42,0:53:20.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Windsor flight 114.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.26,0:53:21.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Dulles Approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.87,0:53:23.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.78,0:53:25.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dulles Approach, this is Windsor 114.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.00,0:53:27.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where the devil have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.72,0:53:29.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Windsor 114. Dulles Approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.86,0:53:32.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've been right here all along, old buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.14,0:53:35.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Our systems only came back on line just this very second.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.75,0:53:39.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Windsor 114, you are cleared for I LS approach,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.55,0:53:41.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,runway two...niner.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.60,0:53:44.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Contact Dulles Tower frequency at the outer marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.27,0:53:46.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ,he's going to crash the fucking plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.34,0:53:48.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger, Approach, and about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.10,0:53:51.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got 230 people up here flying on petrol fumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.45,0:53:52.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger, 114. Understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.08,0:53:54.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Calibrate Dulles altimeter...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.69,0:53:55.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.72,0:53:57.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They'll fly right into the concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.80,0:53:59.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.32,0:54:00.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are they listening to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.67,0:54:02.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's our frequency! Why shouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.73,0:54:04.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dulles, this is Windsor 114.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.65,0:54:05.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Barnes!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.60,0:54:08.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Dulles Tower. We have radar contact...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.29,0:54:10.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me your coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.70,0:54:12.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Windsor 114, stand by...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.45,0:54:13.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.15,0:54:16.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.84,0:54:21.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.17,0:54:23.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,as you've probably noticed, we've started our descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.72,0:54:25.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're sorry for the inconvenience,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.65,0:54:27.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but we'll all be on the ground in a few minutes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.65,0:54:29.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please keep your seat belts on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.36,0:54:31.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.63,0:54:32.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've made arrangements for your next flight,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.05,0:54:34.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so you won't miss it, O.K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.37,0:54:36.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In your seat, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.49,0:54:38.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, in your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.77,0:54:42.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're just like British Rail, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.67,0:54:44.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We may be late, but we get you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.84,0:54:46.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.69,0:55:04.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck, McClane!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.31,0:55:29.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dulles, this is Windsor 114,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.55,0:55:31.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,inside the outer marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.63,0:55:34.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger, 114. This is Dulles Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.66,0:55:37.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have radar contact and show you on I LS.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.16,0:55:38.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're in the glide path, and you're looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.70,0:55:50.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's somebody out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.91,0:55:56.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.89,0:55:58.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.42,0:56:03.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Approach flaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.29,0:56:05.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Approach flaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.19,0:56:07.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Approach speed 140.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.08,0:56:09.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Approach speed 140.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.65,0:56:10.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,130.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.66,0:56:13.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Altitude 1,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.89,0:56:15.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,800, guys! You're only at 800 feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.85,0:56:17.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fire and Rescue, this is Cummings.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.10,0:56:19.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roll everything out to runway two...niner!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.94,0:56:22.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ref speed plus 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.61,0:56:24.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,600 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.45,0:56:26.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Looking good, Windsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.05,0:56:27.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.94,0:56:30.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,30...knot crosswinds, and the runway is icy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.99,0:56:33.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Atta boy. We've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.24,0:56:35.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.97,0:56:50.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pull it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.81,0:56:53.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.35,0:57:07.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aah! We're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.37,0:57:08.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.10,0:57:34.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.85,0:57:37.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.04,0:57:43.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.57,0:57:48.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.19,0:57:53.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.29,0:58:07.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That concludes our object lesson for this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.42,0:58:11.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If the 747 we requested is ready on time
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.10,0:58:14.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and General Esperanza's plane arrives unmolested,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.17,0:58:15.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,further lessons can be avoided.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.80,0:58:17.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.52,0:59:06.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We got no sign of survivors down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.57,0:59:08.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a goddamn nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.20,0:59:10.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Nelson! Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.91,0:59:24.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Barnes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.96,0:59:26.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We've got to warn those planes
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.09,0:59:27.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,there's a lunatic down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.45,0:59:30.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get up to the cabin. Get me on the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.48,0:59:31.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.30,0:59:32.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.17,0:59:34.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the manifest.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.18,0:59:57.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane, I know how you must feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.72,1:00:04.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to help those people.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.69,1:00:08.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was pretty goddamn useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.65,1:00:15.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We called the government for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.95,1:00:18.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going to send in a special Army unit,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.91,1:00:21.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,a counterterrorist team.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.65,1:00:30.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your wife's plane?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.52,1:00:32.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, they're still broadcasting
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.05,1:00:34.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,even though we can't answer them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.14,1:00:40.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going to run out of fuel in 90 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.80,1:00:53.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.42,1:00:54.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That is your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.16,1:00:56.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.04,1:00:58.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're going to continue to get this close,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.95,1:00:59.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,do you think you might consider
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.03,1:01:01.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,switching after...shaves?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.87,1:01:04.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.16,1:01:07.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stronger mouthwash might be nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.27,1:01:09.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And here's Sam Coleman
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.96,1:01:11.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,reporting live from the site of the accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.30,1:01:12.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.31,1:01:14.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,they've done everything we've anticipated...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.66,1:01:15.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.00,1:01:18.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But still there has been no official word.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.61,1:01:21.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Meanwhile, despite the fact only one runway
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.11,1:01:23.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,has been closed due to the tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.13,1:01:26.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,several dozen airliners are visible from where I stand,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.17,1:01:27.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,endlessly circling the field.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.04,1:01:30.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Other reports say that there was trouble in the tower
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.21,1:01:31.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,before the crash
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.34,1:01:33.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and that that may have even contributed to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.55,1:01:34.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One thing is certain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.90,1:01:36.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,With weather conditions worsening,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.41,1:01:38.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the problem here and in the sky above us
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.46,1:01:39.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,will continue to grow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.58,1:01:42.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Samantha Coleman at Dulles International Airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.53,1:01:52.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Victor. Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.25,1:01:53.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.44,1:01:54.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you pack the radio mikes from the shoot,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.04,1:01:56.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,or did you put them in your carry...on?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.35,1:01:57.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.48,1:01:58.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't let those assholes check them in.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.90,1:01:59.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.11,1:02:01.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me one of the receivers.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.41,1:02:08.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you tune in to the cockpit frequency?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.82,1:02:10.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.07,1:02:12.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hear what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.50,1:02:17.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Should be right here on our band.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.66,1:02:19.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.82,1:02:20.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You just told me it would work.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.88,1:02:21.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it working or not working?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.95,1:02:23.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It is working, but it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.06,1:02:25.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All I'm getting is some kind of airport beacon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.85,1:02:27.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.55,1:02:29.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's like the tower isn't there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.96,1:02:33.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.31,1:02:36.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me know when there is something there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.90,1:02:37.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.45,1:03:18.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Major Grant. We're Blue Light.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.10,1:03:19.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Rollins, Department of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.10,1:03:21.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Trudeau, Chief of Air Operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.32,1:03:23.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lorenzo, Terminal Police.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.65,1:03:25.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You want something, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.80,1:03:26.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.93,1:03:28.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One fucking platoon?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.65,1:03:31.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,One Crisis...1 Platoon. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.34,1:03:32.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.77,1:03:35.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane, you showed some balls out there, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.78,1:03:36.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.78,1:03:38.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now show some good sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.84,1:03:40.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let the pros handle this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.70,1:03:43.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well, it looks like the pros are on the wrong team tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.55,1:03:45.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't Colonel Stuart one of your men?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.30,1:03:46.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, not anymore, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.96,1:03:49.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now we're here to take Colonel Stuart down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.46,1:03:51.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And we will take him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.11,1:03:52.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You see, I served with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.77,1:03:54.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I taught him everything he knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.07,1:03:57.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, maybe he's learned a few more things since then.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.65,1:04:01.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hustle!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.17,1:04:02.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The command post will be set up
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.69,1:04:03.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in the airport police station.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.00,1:04:07.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be tied in to the tower in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.13,1:04:09.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.58,1:04:12.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Trudeau.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.22,1:04:16.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Did things just get better or worse?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.53,1:04:22.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lights... big, portable lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.84,1:04:24.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We set up the field, and then we...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.78,1:04:26.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We wait for those lunatics to shoot them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.73,1:04:27.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And where do we get those big, portable lights...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.94,1:04:29.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Borrow them from Batman?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.21,1:04:30.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the airphone idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.69,1:04:32.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's 18 planes up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.14,1:04:33.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Only five of them have those phones.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.82,1:04:34.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We got through to three of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.95,1:04:36.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're still trying on the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.25,1:04:38.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That leaves 13 accidents waiting to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.42,1:04:39.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are they still bucking head winds?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.56,1:04:42.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I just checked the weather. Head winds are slamming everybody over the outer marker.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.86,1:04:45.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The planes with enough fuel have already been shunted to Atlanta
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.16,1:04:46.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Memphis, and Nashville.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.39,1:04:48.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Outer marker.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.01,1:04:50.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.79,1:04:52.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The outer marker!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.23,1:04:56.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a beacon, right? It sends out this "beep beep beep"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.69,1:04:57.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so they know they're over it, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.76,1:05:00.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- So? - So who says that radio signal has to just beep?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.91,1:05:04.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. We switch the frequency from the tower over to the one in the beacon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.55,1:05:06.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We pump up the wattage.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.24,1:05:07.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And we can talk to our planes,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.65,1:05:09.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and those bastards who did this will never know!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.68,1:05:13.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Traced the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.10,1:05:15.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Found it in the luggage area.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.85,1:05:18.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They've been tapped in to your tower chatter all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.76,1:05:21.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Punks stealing luggage, huh, Carmine?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.40,1:05:25.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How you doing, Telford?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.65,1:05:26.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.00,1:05:28.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I called Lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.20,1:05:30.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're rigging a portable decoder. It'll be here in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.97,1:05:32.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My wife doesn't have two hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.37,1:05:34.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was only transferred to Grant's team yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.60,1:05:36.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The regular guy got appendicitis.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.21,1:05:40.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Word is, nobody's better at this than Major Grant.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.15,1:05:41.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.12,1:05:43.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Except maybe Colonel Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.45,1:05:47.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hear about the plane those bastards asked for.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.86,1:05:49.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll fill you in on my orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.42,1:05:51.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pilots' briefing room. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.44,1:05:52.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep working.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.73,1:05:54.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Albertson. With me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.31,1:06:00.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No civilians.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.93,1:06:13.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.86,1:06:15.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.90,1:06:18.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The outer marker beeper. It isn't beeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.00,1:06:20.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.47,1:06:23.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention all aircraft in Dulles landing pattern.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.10,1:06:25.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Chief Engineer Leslie Barnes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.30,1:06:27.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I have been authorized to brief you in full.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.24,1:06:32.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,At this time, this is the only channel available to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.91,1:06:34.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here is the situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.74,1:06:37.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Approximately two hours ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.53,1:06:42.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait until you get a load of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.28,1:06:44.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do not accept any instructions claiming to be from our tower
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.60,1:06:47.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,unless you hear your own flight recoder access code.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.92,1:06:50.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- The terrorists have got all our systems and now... - Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.21,1:06:51.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get this on tape!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.55,1:06:53.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,have control of everything except this channel.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.40,1:06:54.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Give us a second here, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.63,1:06:57.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This channel is secure. Your own transmissions are not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.95,1:07:00.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do not, repeat, do not attempt
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.13,1:07:02.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to reply on your own frequencies
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.25,1:07:04.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to this broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.41,1:07:07.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These people have already caused one crash by impersonating our tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.26,1:07:08.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.76,1:07:21.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Repeat. The terrorists have cut off
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.47,1:07:23.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the two systems that can allow you to land...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.18,1:07:26.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,field lights for a visual landing
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.43,1:07:28.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and the ILS for an instrument.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.65,1:07:31.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A special U.S. Army unit is already here
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.26,1:07:32.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and preparing to take out the terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.07,1:07:34.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.14,1:07:36.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Marvin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.38,1:07:38.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you interested in a nice coat?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.71,1:07:40.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No. It never looked good on me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.60,1:07:42.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, you've got to get me up to the pilots' briefing room.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.02,1:07:44.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to hear what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.04,1:07:47.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Which one of these maps gets me in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.43,1:07:48.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch it! Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.98,1:07:50.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,- Find the map, Marvin. - I'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.46,1:07:52.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll mess up my whole damn filing system here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.82,1:07:54.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see. Pilots' Briefing Room.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.29,1:07:56.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I think that's in the main terminal,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.19,1:07:59.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so would that be under " P" for Pilots' Briefing Room?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.90,1:08:01.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Or maybe it would be...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.45,1:08:03.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,under " M" for Miscellaneous.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.48,1:08:09.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.88,1:08:11.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Request permission to reduce sentry duty
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.91,1:08:13.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to 30...minute rotation.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.55,1:08:15.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My men are getting cold and antsy. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.45,1:08:16.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Colonel Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.05,1:08:19.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Have the men not on watch assemble for a briefing. Over
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.60,1:08:20.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.66,1:08:21.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.70,1:08:26.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.71,1:08:28.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight, the pattern ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.61,1:08:31.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The dominoes will fall no more,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.80,1:08:33.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and the ramparts will remain upright.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.91,1:08:35.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir, General Esperanza's plane
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.51,1:08:37.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,just came on the scope.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.00,1:08:45.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention, Dulles Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.95,1:08:47.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We will be lighting up a runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.80,1:08:51.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do not, repeat, do not attempt to land any planes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.77,1:08:53.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember, we're monitoring you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.55,1:08:58.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.70,1:09:00.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Obey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.24,1:09:09.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dulles Tower to Fox Trot Michael One.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.70,1:09:12.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dulles Tower to Fox Trot Michael One.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.48,1:09:14.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Fox Trot Michael One, Dulles.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.65,1:09:16.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We read you. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.48,1:09:19.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fox Trot Michael One, you are to come in on runway 15,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.50,1:09:21.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,repeat, 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.36,1:09:38.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I found it on the floor, by the coat,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.22,1:09:39.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,next to the luggage belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.67,1:09:42.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell you so excited about that for?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.32,1:09:44.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The code's still punched into this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.09,1:09:45.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You like it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.62,1:09:48.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How about giving me 20 bucks for it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.41,1:09:50.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How about I let you live?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.60,1:09:53.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Man knows how to bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.78,1:09:56.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is contrary to our instructions.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.36,1:09:58.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We are to land at runway 10,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.20,1:10:02.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,where we are to be met by representatives of your justice de...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.25,1:10:05.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Captain, please tell the tower
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.90,1:10:07.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,you will proceed as ordered.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.38,1:10:20.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger, Dulles.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.22,1:10:23.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Proceeding to runway 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.19,1:10:41.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Foxtrot Michael One. Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.32,1:10:44.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.33,1:10:45.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.01,1:10:47.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So who will fly the plane?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.54,1:10:48.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.03,1:10:50.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.65,1:10:59.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Michael One. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.92,1:11:05.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Foxtrot Michael One. Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.45,1:11:15.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eagle Nest.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.85,1:11:17.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Falcon. Mayday.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.36,1:11:20.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eagle Nest. This is Falcon. Mayday!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.16,1:11:23.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead, Falcon.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.64,1:11:27.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've lost cabin pressure. Near zero visibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.37,1:11:30.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I must drop out of this weather and land now,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.33,1:11:32.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,on the first accessible runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.15,1:11:33.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Repeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.22,1:11:36.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've lost cabin pressure. Near zero visibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.69,1:11:38.53,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I must drop out of the storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.68,1:11:41.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I can land, but I must land now,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.41,1:11:43.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,on the first outgoing runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.38,1:11:45.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Repeat. I cannot circle around
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.45,1:11:47.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to runway 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.77,1:11:52.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you a deal, Marvin.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.80,1:11:54.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You show me a shortcut out to those runways,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.68,1:11:56.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I'll get you a liner for that coat.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.38,1:11:59.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Repeat. I cannot circle around to runway 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.95,1:12:00.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.04,1:12:02.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stand by, Falcon.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.30,1:12:05.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.43,1:12:07.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's coming in from the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.07,1:12:11.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A bullet has damaged my instruments.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.55,1:12:13.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure of my bearings,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.45,1:12:15.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I must make a visual landing immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.85,1:12:17.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you copy, Eagle Nest?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.75,1:12:18.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger, Falcon.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.05,1:12:20.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That would be 25 right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.98,1:12:23.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Repeat. 25 right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.25,1:12:25.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Make up your fucking mind!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.20,1:12:29.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, we are just up to our ass in terrorists again,John.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.59,1:12:31.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Affirmative. 25 right. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.26,1:12:32.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,25 right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.57,1:12:36.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to quit smoking cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.53,1:12:39.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for telling me, Eagle Nest.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.80,1:12:41.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But if you could show it to me as well,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.85,1:12:43.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I would be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.45,1:12:55.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I see the lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.96,1:12:58.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They are directly in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.29,1:12:59.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gracias, compadre.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.79,1:13:02.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Reducing air speed. Approaching runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.80,1:13:04.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wish me luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.30,1:13:05.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger, Falcon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.97,1:13:09.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We copy. We'll have you in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.44,1:13:10.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.94,1:13:12.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll have you in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.27,1:13:38.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I see your lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.27,1:13:39.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,ETA 90 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.78,1:13:51.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come to papa, scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.66,1:15:00.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.94,1:15:49.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.94,1:15:52.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.18,1:15:55.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're supposed to stay in your seat
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.78,1:15:57.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,until the plane reaches the terminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.29,1:15:59.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No frequent...flier mileage for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.99,1:16:01.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.19,1:16:02.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.36,1:16:03.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A cop?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.36,1:16:04.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, one of the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.36,1:16:05.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're one of the bad guys,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.10,1:16:08.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and now that I got your sorry ass, I'm going to trade it for my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.14,1:16:19.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.65,1:16:24.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go in!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.35,1:16:31.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.36,1:16:32.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.57,1:16:43.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.57,1:16:44.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Two months of planning,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.10,1:16:47.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and you can't anticipate one pendejo of a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.27,1:16:48.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, General.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.27,1:16:49.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where the hell is Colonel Stuart?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.62,1:16:54.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,General!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.78,1:16:55.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.05,1:16:58.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He said he was a policeman.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.28,1:17:00.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you had this place secured.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.15,1:17:02.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He went in the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.29,1:17:04.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's going to hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.29,1:17:05.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.49,1:17:09.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I assume it's you, McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.30,1:17:11.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're quite a little soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.80,1:17:15.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You can consider this a military funeral!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.90,1:17:41.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How many grenades we got?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.33,1:17:43.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Three each!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.60,1:17:44.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Use them!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.78,1:17:56.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.55,1:18:11.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.01,1:18:28.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.95,1:18:30.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.26,1:18:41.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You lucky fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.19,1:18:45.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fire trucks, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.95,1:18:48.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fall back to the church. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.52,1:19:12.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the fucking door?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.25,1:19:29.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're getting a little nervous back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.50,1:19:31.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, so am I.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.04,1:19:32.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're right over Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.55,1:19:33.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,See if you can get any TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.81,1:19:35.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That will settle them down.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.30,1:19:36.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Works for me. I'll...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.55,1:19:39.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.76,1:20:04.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Writing your acceptance speech for the Video Sleaze Awards?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.95,1:20:06.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Try Pulitzer.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.35,1:20:07.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.23,1:20:08.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,while waiting to land, our cabin attendants
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.86,1:20:10.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,are turning on local Washington broadcasting.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.90,1:20:12.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The sound is on channel three.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.69,1:20:20.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.24,1:20:22.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K., O.K.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.15,1:20:33.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, sir, we may land at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.10,1:20:35.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you'll take your seat...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.29,1:20:36.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to be sick. Excuse me. I'm going to be sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.97,1:20:38.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir, the seat belt light is on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.61,1:20:44.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Moron.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.90,1:20:45.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,WZDC.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.71,1:20:47.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is Richard Thornberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.38,1:20:48.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put me through to Ruben in the newsroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.00,1:20:50.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, he's about to go live...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.29,1:20:51.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know he's about to go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.48,1:20:52.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I need him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.77,1:20:53.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll have to hold on...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.91,1:20:55.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Put me through, Celia,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.10,1:20:56.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,or start typing your resume.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.91,1:20:59.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Esperanza's down...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.90,1:21:02.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But he's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.93,1:21:04.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He took a round in his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.90,1:21:06.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus I got one more of their guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.69,1:21:07.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's six they lost altogether.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.82,1:21:09.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe if we knew how many they had to start with,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.00,1:21:11.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we could get excited,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.14,1:21:12.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but if they got 50 guys,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.35,1:21:14.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,it's a little early to break out the champagne!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.95,1:21:16.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, we appreciate your effort, McClane,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.87,1:21:18.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but we don't need a loose cannon on this deck!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.85,1:21:20.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What if they decide to crash another plane
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.85,1:21:22.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in retaliation for your little stunt?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.33,1:21:24.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They can't do that anymore, right, Barnes?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.64,1:21:26.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, if I grabbed Esperanza,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.64,1:21:27.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,this would all be over by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.72,1:21:30.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, maybe they're just a little bit more creative than you think!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.35,1:21:32.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least I'm thinking, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.14,1:21:33.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, you wise...ass,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.62,1:21:36.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,we're here to jerk off that cocksucker until he tries to take off.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.48,1:21:37.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Period!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.48,1:21:41.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, you're the wrong guy in the wrong place at the wrong time!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.00,1:21:44.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The story of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.10,1:21:47.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Major,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.20,1:21:49.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pentagon situation room, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.17,1:21:50.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pentagon.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.21,1:21:51.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take it in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.70,1:21:52.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Telford.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.87,1:21:54.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You men come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.18,1:21:58.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.18,1:21:59.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Barnes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.24,1:22:01.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You said those guys showed up out there right away?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.16,1:22:01.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.88,1:22:05.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That means they're on the field or close,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.35,1:22:07.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I think I know where.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.39,1:22:08.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come here. Let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.22,1:22:13.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,These are the old plans when the longer runways went in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.88,1:22:16.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's 12 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.20,1:22:18.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like they've done some modifications on site...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.73,1:22:20.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,moved Tra Con phones, I LS,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.84,1:22:22.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,all the underground stuff
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.40,1:22:24.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,so they could handle drainage.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.37,1:22:25.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If I'm right,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.22,1:22:27.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,all of it would run right along the airport property
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.87,1:22:29.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and go right past this neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.29,1:22:35.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We should have been on the ground two hours ago!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.23,1:22:37.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand, but if you just relax...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.55,1:22:40.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.26,1:22:44.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody ought to get their ass kicked for this mess, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.56,1:22:46.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.90,1:22:49.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,there really isn't anyone we can blame for the weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.27,1:22:52.08,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah? What about that porker Willard Scott?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.27,1:22:54.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I should have taken the bus.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.27,1:22:57.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,At least they can pull over for food and gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.27,1:22:58.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.48,1:22:59.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.44,1:23:01.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.47,1:23:03.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This flight originally
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.80,1:23:06.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,was supposed to be 5  half a hours, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.90,1:23:08.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do we have enough fuel?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.60,1:23:10.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to keep circling like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.29,1:23:11.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.12,1:23:13.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They anticipate little problems like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.58,1:23:33.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Barnes, we looked at 12 fucking houses,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.51,1:23:34.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and we're nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.75,1:23:36.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is our last possibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.65,1:23:39.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here there's an old church.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.50,1:23:40.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.26,1:23:46.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.03,1:23:56.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's the church over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.17,1:24:05.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Could be a sentry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.96,1:24:08.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And he could just be out for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.07,1:24:10.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why is he going over his own footsteps?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.04,1:24:14.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.40,1:24:17.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.83,1:24:20.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just stay here and get ready to call the marines.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.32,1:24:21.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought they were the army.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.95,1:24:24.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Who gives a fuck? Just be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.81,1:24:43.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.95,1:24:45.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.76,1:24:49.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.20,1:25:01.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lorenzo, it's Barnes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.54,1:25:03.05,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Barnes, where the hell did you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.10,1:25:03.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's McClane?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.01,1:25:07.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,He's with me. We're at the Hidey Lake Community Church on the west side of the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.11,1:25:09.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're where? Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.05,1:25:10.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You crazy idiot, why didn't...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.79,1:25:12.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This must be their base of operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.29,1:25:13.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up and get your ass over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.79,1:25:14.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.79,1:25:16.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Code red! Sit rep.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.29,1:25:18.62,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We got positive I.D. on Stuart's location.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.73,1:25:19.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.74,1:25:32.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Our escape plane will be ready
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.08,1:25:35.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,within 30 minutes, General.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.75,1:25:38.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If there are no more surprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.66,1:25:56.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gentlemen, we have a situation here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.69,1:26:46.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.83,1:26:56.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.39,1:27:15.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.73,1:27:30.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, McClane, you all right? You want a medic?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.57,1:27:32.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell you think you're doing out there,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.51,1:27:33.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,playing John Wayne?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.07,1:27:36.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How would you like to spend the night in a cell?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.31,1:27:38.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lorenzo, shut the fuck up and do something useful.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.61,1:27:39.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go seal off the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.91,1:27:41.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you can't talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.08,1:27:43.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no, Carmine?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.48,1:27:47.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sergeant, get this bureaucrat out of Mr. McClane's face now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.29,1:27:49.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,With pleasure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.93,1:27:52.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.09,1:27:54.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the men are in position, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.43,1:27:56.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Close up the back. Then we go in.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.43,1:27:57.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Fire only on my order.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.93,1:27:59.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.43,1:28:01.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess I was wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.40,1:28:03.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not such an asshole after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.97,1:28:05.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.47,1:28:07.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just your kind of asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.92,1:28:18.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Garber, sit rep!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.69,1:28:22.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Army Special Forces on three sides, closing in fast around the back!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.66,1:28:23.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Another problem, Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.09,1:28:26.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,No problem, General.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.20,1:28:29.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Gentlemen, you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.94,1:28:40.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Down!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.95,1:28:42.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.24,1:29:13.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,General... it's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.19,1:29:23.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.24,1:29:40.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're pulling out out the back!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.55,1:29:49.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.70,1:30:02.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Albertson, take your men around the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.91,1:30:10.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.38,1:30:17.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.66,1:30:30.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This equipment, it could land our planes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.43,1:30:33.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There were trip wires outside. They could have booby...trapped...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.23,1:30:34.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They did.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.24,1:30:35.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Got one here, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.30,1:30:36.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like C...4. The motherfucker is armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.97,1:30:40.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Clear the area! Everybody, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.41,1:30:44.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They booby...trapped all the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.91,1:30:46.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Seal off the building!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.42,1:30:47.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.92,1:30:49.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Post sentries. No civilians allowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.92,1:30:53.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, where the fuck is McClane?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.18,1:31:43.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Miller, take him!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.08,1:31:48.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cover you!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.97,1:32:37.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,So much for the element of chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.37,1:32:38.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.32,1:32:58.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I had the bastard in my sights.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.49,1:33:00.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.00,1:33:11.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.08,1:33:19.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention, Tower. Attention, Dulles Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.45,1:33:22.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Colonel Stuart. Is our plane prepared?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.45,1:33:24.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It is. It's in hangar 11.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.45,1:33:26.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the most remote building we've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.76,1:33:29.75,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.86,1:33:33.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Have a ground crew there to confirm the condition of the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.46,1:33:36.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you believe the balls on this son of a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.43,1:33:39.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Colonel, you're quite capable of confirming it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.27,1:33:43.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, please, don't ask us to gift...wrap potential hostages for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.47,1:33:44.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Major Grant, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.98,1:33:46.60,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If you remember me, Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.71,1:33:50.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,then you remember I know the drill as well as you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.35,1:33:52.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Check out your own fucking plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.48,1:33:54.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We move out in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.99,1:33:56.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Flak jackets for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.49,1:33:58.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Body armor for the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.99,1:34:00.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Night scopes for the snipers.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.49,1:34:02.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We will take them in the hangar,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.49,1:34:04.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I will pull that detonator
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.50,1:34:07.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,out of Stuart's dead fucking hand myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.50,1:34:10.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take all your men back to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.97,1:34:12.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Seal off every exit
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.47,1:34:13.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in case they try to slip past us
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.01,1:34:15.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to break out onto the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.01,1:34:17.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.41,1:34:21.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.31,1:34:22.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dick, this is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.62,1:34:23.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Every station in town has people out at the airport,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.95,1:34:26.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and none of them has heard even a whisper of this shit you're running now!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.95,1:34:28.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, none of them is me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.89,1:34:30.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You want proof, try this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.66,1:34:34.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Repeat. Terrorists have murdered civilians
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.16,1:34:37.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and cut off the two systems that can allow you to land.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.27,1:34:39.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,A special U.S. Army unit is already here
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.47,1:34:40.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and preparing to take out the terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.84,1:34:41.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.84,1:34:43.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to go live now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.97,1:34:45.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get me in from the files... a publicity shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.04,1:34:48.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Connie's got one. The maps...get one from weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.18,1:34:49.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're on it. We're cutting in five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.48,1:34:50.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell the affiliates if they want in,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.98,1:34:52.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,they got three minutes to shout.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.48,1:34:54.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.92,1:34:57.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Network, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.56,1:35:03.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Telford, what was your chicken shit outfit doing
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.49,1:35:05.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,while we were taking Grenada?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.03,1:35:09.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Grenada... five minutes of fire fight,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.53,1:35:12.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,five weeks of surfing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.34,1:35:14.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I was with you guys for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.41,1:35:16.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Me, too, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.51,1:35:17.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Really, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.94,1:35:19.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.74,1:35:22.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then we wouldn't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.80,1:35:40.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Eagle Nest, this is Hatchling.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.47,1:35:44.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,On schedule... and in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.60,1:35:46.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger, Hatchling. We are secure here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.97,1:35:48.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You have a green light.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.98,1:35:52.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I repeat, a green light.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.49,1:36:05.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus, Officer, where did you come from,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.99,1:36:07.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Pearl Harbor?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.53,1:36:14.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's clear it out, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.04,1:36:17.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.94,1:36:20.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,5, 4, 3...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.64,1:36:23.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a special bulletin from WZDC News.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.90,1:36:26.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There was a plane crash earlier this evening at Dulles,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.40,1:36:28.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,where other aircraft continue to circle,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.40,1:36:31.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,with no explanation from airport or FAA officials.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.36,1:36:34.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,And now, with an exclusive WZDC report,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.71,1:36:37.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,here's Dick Thornberg reporting from the skies over Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.12,1:36:40.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm one of the thousand people
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.50,1:36:42.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,who has been circling our nation's capital
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.14,1:36:44.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,under the assumption that whatever problem
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.15,1:36:46.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,was going on far below was a normal one,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.07,1:36:49.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but the truth is far from normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.48,1:36:51.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.00,1:36:54.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out! Lady, look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.01,1:36:56.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.63,1:36:58.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out! Look out! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.12,1:37:00.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.49,1:37:02.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of the way, lady!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.69,1:37:04.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Go, go, go! Hey, hey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.65,1:37:06.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a recording of a conversation
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.49,1:37:09.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,between Dulles Tower and a captive aircraft overhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.93,1:37:13.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.35,1:37:16.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lorenzo!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.01,1:37:18.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane, are you out of your fucking mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.44,1:37:20.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The Blue Light team... where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.44,1:37:22.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Stuart's got explosives in the church rigged with a remote.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.11,1:37:23.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Grant?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.35,1:37:25.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going to kill that son of a bitch and get it from them!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.95,1:37:27.04,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're not going to do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.15,1:37:29.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're going to get on the same plane with him and take off with him!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.45,1:37:30.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.62,1:37:32.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When the army canned Stuart,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.62,1:37:33.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,he loaded that unit with his own men!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.79,1:37:35.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you nuts? That fire fight...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.59,1:37:37.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sideshow to buy them some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.13,1:37:40.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane, you are completely around the fucking bend.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.56,1:37:41.93,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're under arrest, you motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.41,1:37:51.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here! These are the bullets they used out there tonight!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.41,1:37:53.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Blanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.98,1:37:57.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.49,1:38:07.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Chief Lorenzo.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.23,1:38:08.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I want every officer recalled
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.49,1:38:10.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and assembled in body armor and full weaponry
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.50,1:38:12.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,in the motor pool in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.97,1:38:17.66,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time to kick ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.51,1:38:21.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like IwoJima!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.98,1:38:25.17,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This reporter has learned that the terrorists
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.28,1:38:27.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,have virtual control of the entire airport,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.35,1:38:30.41,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,a fact that the authorities have repressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.52,1:38:32.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The terrorists promise more bloodshed
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.52,1:38:34.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,unless their demands are met,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.82,1:38:36.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and now that the Special Army commandos
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.96,1:38:38.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,have arrived at the airport,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.46,1:38:42.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,the likelihood of a full...scale, deadly battle is dangerously close.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.25,1:39:06.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That stupid, arrogant son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.49,1:39:09.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all over the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.39,1:39:11.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,300 people have died...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.40,1:39:13.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When are we going to land?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.90,1:39:16.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,...and unfortunately they may not be the last.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.50,1:39:19.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The horrifying fact is that no one is safe,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.17,1:39:21.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,either in the planes above Dulles
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.44,1:39:23.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,or in the terminal below.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.94,1:39:27.34,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The threat of a new and higher body count at the airport
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.45,1:39:29.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,hangs over the heads of everyone,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.45,1:39:31.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and the holiday season of peace and love
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.45,1:39:33.82,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,has become a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.83,1:39:41.23,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.33,1:39:44.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All units, I want you to converge on hangar 11,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.47,1:39:45.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,all sides!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.97,1:39:47.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This car, McClane! Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.97,1:39:50.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,When the City Blue show up with their backup,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.84,1:39:52.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,they'll pick up the pieces!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.47,1:39:54.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, move out!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.41,1:39:58.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,McClane, say hi to my brother Vito.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.45,1:40:00.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.12,1:40:01.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.16,1:40:09.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Goddamn it to hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.49,1:40:12.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Move that piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.23,1:40:16.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you move that goddamn piece of shit out of here?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.50,1:40:17.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Vito, get the fuck out of the car
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.93,1:40:20.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and get your ass in gear and help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.94,1:40:22.24,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you get...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.34,1:40:24.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Move that car right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.88,1:40:26.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right there. Right there. Get that.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.11,1:40:28.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Coleman!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.21,1:40:32.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sam! Sam Coleman!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.38,1:40:34.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Coleman!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.12,1:40:38.56,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Coleman!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.66,1:40:42.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,But at least the truth is not among the hostages
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.46,1:40:45.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,because I, Richard Thornberg, just happened to be here
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.97,1:40:50.16,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,to put his life and talent
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.27,1:40:53.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,on the line for humanity and country,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.24,1:40:56.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and if this should be my final broadcast...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.48,1:41:01.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Amen to that... Dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.55,1:41:04.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dick? We're live, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.48,1:41:06.54,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.65,1:41:09.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dick?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.12,1:41:10.95,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Truck lights approaching, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.06,1:41:14.39,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They're here, right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.50,1:41:16.90,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The hangar door, open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.00,1:41:18.33,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.46,1:41:42.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, you give me this story,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.96,1:41:45.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and I'll have your baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.46,1:41:48.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Not the kind of ride I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.98,1:42:03.38,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Colonel, if I may say so, you are some piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.48,1:42:04.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Major.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.98,1:42:06.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not so bad yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.99,1:42:08.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations on your escape, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.82,1:42:09.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Major.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.99,1:42:12.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you should save them until we are all safe, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.43,1:42:13.96,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.99,1:42:15.89,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,My congratulations, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.00,1:42:17.40,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You've won a victory for our way of life,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.50,1:42:21.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,my pride, my admiration, and a kick...ass vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.87,1:42:23.50,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, get on board.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.57,1:42:54.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter, cowboy, ride too rough?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.57,1:42:55.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like to fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.07,1:42:57.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Then what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.57,1:42:59.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like to lose, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.38,1:43:01.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K. Whoo! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.75,1:43:11.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know about you guys,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.79,1:43:14.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but I've seen enough fucking snow to last me a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.96,1:43:16.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't get much of that in the tropics, Major.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.10,1:43:19.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,For you, gentlemen, we'll import it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.84,1:43:24.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit! They left the hangar!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.27,1:43:28.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.81,1:43:30.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Right there. Get that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.74,1:43:31.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.74,1:43:32.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get in front of them! Take it down!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.05,1:43:35.14,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Block their path so they can't get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.25,1:43:36.74,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not playing chicken with a 200...ton plane!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.85,1:43:38.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm crazy, man, but I ain't that crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.22,1:43:39.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.39,1:43:40.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Dulles, this is Northeast 140.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.06,1:43:42.28,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Request clearance on first available runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.39,1:43:43.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Holly's plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.59,1:43:45.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Repeat. Request emergency clearance.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.09,1:43:47.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I know you're not going to answer me,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.23,1:43:48.35,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but you damn well better listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.46,1:43:50.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're down to fumes, and we have to land,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.56,1:43:53.30,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,and in five minutes we're coming in one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.40,1:43:54.63,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my wife's plane!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.74,1:43:56.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take it fucking down!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.14,1:43:57.57,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not getting in front of that plane!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.58,1:44:05.07,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, how about getting over top of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.18,1:44:06.71,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ladies and gentlemen, this is the captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.77,1:44:07.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Your attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.88,1:44:08.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We have no choice
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.09,1:44:11.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,but to attempt an emergency landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.25,1:44:13.91,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Please fasten your seat belts and assume crash positions
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.04,1:44:16.32,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,as instructed by your cabin attendants.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.43,1:44:18.83,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's have the emergency check list.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.93,1:44:21.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Attention all air traffic in Dulles area.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.47,1:44:22.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Northeast 140.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.97,1:44:24.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to attempt an emergency landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.60,1:44:25.73,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Be advised.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.61,1:44:30.01,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.11,1:44:31.94,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to die. I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.04,1:44:33.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just buckle your seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.54,1:44:35.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.55,1:44:36.67,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lean forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.14,1:44:39.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,God!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.29,1:44:42.25,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.12,1:44:47.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.56,1:44:52.36,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Thy rod and Thy staff they comfort me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.54,1:45:00.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Just hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.24,1:45:02.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.21,1:45:03.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You wanted a story, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.28,1:45:04.27,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice and easy, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.38,1:45:05.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get me in low!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.58,1:45:07.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.02,1:45:10.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring me down!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.09,1:45:12.48,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get yourself killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.59,1:45:15.06,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come back inside!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.43,1:45:23.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring it in low! Keep over the wing!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.04,1:45:33.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Lower!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.58,1:45:34.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.09,1:45:48.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,John, what the fuck are you doing out on the wing of this plane?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.73,1:45:54.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.77,1:46:02.37,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Mierda.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.48,1:46:03.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There's something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.94,1:46:06.64,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,The ailerons.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.75,1:46:08.81,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't take off.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.78,1:46:12.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hijo de puta.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.82,1:46:14.58,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,It's McClane again.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.32,1:46:17.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.66,1:46:21.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do him.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.60,1:46:22.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,This time do it right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.96,1:46:24.86,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You just get us in the air, General.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.97,1:46:26.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the only man who can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.63,1:46:28.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't shoot. That wing is fully fueled.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.53,1:46:55.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.06,1:47:23.76,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Too bad, McClane. I kind of liked you!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.83,1:47:28.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.54,1:47:33.87,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got enough friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.88,1:47:58.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.78,1:48:12.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K., McClane...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.62,1:48:14.11,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,time for the main event!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.99,1:48:51.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.74,1:49:04.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.58,1:49:10.13,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.59,1:49:19.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Happy landings, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.04,1:50:12.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yippie...kai...yay, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.33,1:50:26.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.07,1:51:06.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.07,1:51:09.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's your fucking landing light!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.32,1:51:18.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.22,1:51:22.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.79,1:51:23.69,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.79,1:51:26.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,O.K., I see it! I see it!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.95,1:51:52.44,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They used the fire to see!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.55,1:51:53.88,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They used the fucking fire to see!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.99,1:51:55.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They can all do that. Tell them.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.32,1:51:56.72,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They already know.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.82,1:51:58.45,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We had a visual on Northeastern's landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.56,1:51:59.79,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.90,1:52:01.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,We're following the fire trail in as a guide.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.03,1:52:03.26,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If they can do it, so can we!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.62,1:52:21.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.09,1:52:23.49,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,If any landing you can walk away from
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.59,1:52:24.92,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,is a good one, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.82,1:52:56.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.62,1:52:58.02,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.13,1:52:59.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.63,1:53:00.68,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.56,1:53:31.15,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,There you go. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.96,1:53:35.09,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.21,1:53:38.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.77,1:53:45.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.35,1:53:48.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.12,1:53:52.85,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.40,1:53:59.22,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.51,1:54:04.80,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.64,1:54:12.03,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.34,1:54:16.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.95,1:54:21.98,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! We got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.65,1:54:29.59,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, God. Oh, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.69,1:54:31.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I was never going to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.09,1:54:34.43,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I thought about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.53,1:54:37.19,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.87,1:54:42.77,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,They told me there were terrorists at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.87,1:54:46.10,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I heard that, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.88,1:54:55.51,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,God, that's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.62,1:54:57.52,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.62,1:55:02.42,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, it sure is.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.53,1:55:05.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.63,1:55:09.46,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh,John.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.57,1:55:12.20,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Why does this keep happening to us?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.64,1:55:20.31,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.41,1:55:22.61,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Get in the truck!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.72,1:55:24.55,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get her out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.65,1:55:27.21,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Somebody help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.32,1:55:29.18,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, honey, help me up here, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.29,1:55:30.78,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.75,1:55:36.12,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Officer! Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.60,1:55:38.00,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.10,1:55:41.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hop on in here! Get your missus in!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.40,1:55:42.97,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you say, Marv?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.07,1:55:46.84,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be damned if I'm going to clean up this mess!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.80,1:55:55.70,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, McClane!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.86,1:55:59.99,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,You get this parking ticket in front of my airport?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.01,1:56:02.47,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.93,1:56:07.29,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, what the hell. It's Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.50,1:56:13.65,ENG,,0000,0000,0000,,Take off, Marv!
